Located on a quiet street is within walking distance to Lisbon''s cosmopolitan and cultural center.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '74 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.70908, -9.15268, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.154327, 38.709728), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 101.0, 29.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (205, 205, 'Sta Catarina apartment with a view', 'Amazing apartment, with an excellent and privilege location in the heart of Lisbon, where everything happens within a walking distance. It is the perfect base point to discover the city, starting in a beautiful terrace with a magnificent view over it', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '154 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.70978, -9.15024, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.149722, 38.712207), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 192.86, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (206, 206, 'Cotovelo House, Ericeira', 'House in the Centre of the village of Ericeira, totally remodeled with an environment that blends modernism and culture typical of a charismatic sea Village. 
1 minute walking from the beach and near all sevices.
Charming and confortable terrace.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Ericeira', '136 Demo Street, Ericeira, Lisbon', 38.96717, -9.41944, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.419722, 38.964984), 4326)::geography, 6, true, 2, 3, 4, 2.0, 117.6, 22.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (207, 207, 'Sintra - Praia Grande Villa', 'Exclusive villa in Praia Grande: 270m² on 6,000m² of land. It has 4 bedrooms (3 en-suites), capacity for up to 9 people and an incredible outdoor area for leisure and socializing. Minutes from the beach, it combines comfort, privacy and a prime location in Colares. Ideal for family vacations', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Colares', '83 Demo Street, Colares, Lisbon', 38.81039390000001, -9.4697427, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.467371, 38.810653), 4326)::geography, 9, false, 0, 4, 10, 3.5, 256.5, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (208, 208, '8 Building Apartment 403 - River & Garden View', 'The apartment is in one of Lisbon’s prime areas, near the river, surrounded by shops and restaurants. The neighborhood is rich in History, Tradition, and Culture — perfect for a stay full of elegance and comfort.
For stays longer than 28 days, a lodging contract will be required, as per Portuguese regulations.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '14 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.70768, -9.14671, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.14985, 38.70523), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 4, 1.0, 268.0, 30.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (209, 173, 'Grandchildren''s House', 'Located in the heart of Leila, just steps from everything, this house is the ideal retreat to relax and make the most of everything the town has to offer during your vacation. With two bedrooms, a mezzanine, and a cozy living room with an open-plan kitchen, every detail has been designed to ensure your comfort. Feel at home in a comfortable and inviting environment.
Explore our stunning beaches, delectable restaurants, and vibrant nightlife.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Ericeira', '5 Demo Street, Ericeira, Lisbon', 38.96681, -9.41595, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.413358, 38.965245), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 4, 2.0, 135.0, 34.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (210, 209, '-', 'Modern and cozy studio in the heart of Lisbon, ideal for couples, solo travelers or friends traveling together. It features a comfortable double bed, a fully equipped kitchen with dishwasher and washing machine, air conditioning, elevator access and brand new furniture throughout. The studio is quiet and well insulated; Nearby kennel; occasional light noise, brief and not disruptive stay. Located in a modern building, walking distance to Lisbon’s main attractions, restaurants and transport.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '32 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.7100927, -9.15073, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.152085, 38.710451), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 143.0, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (211, 210, 'Casa 37 - Country Home', 'Welcome to Casa 37,
A very nice house located in the countryside with an interior area of 37 m², set in a quiet area and overlooking the pine forest. Enjoy and hike the area!

A 10-minute drive from the historic center of the village of Sintra, classified as a World Heritage Site by UNESCO.
If you prefer the beach, Casa 37 is a 13-minute drive from Magoito Beach.
Easy access to public transportation (buses), supermarkets, restaurants and local shops.

Ideal for 2 people!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'So Joo das Lampas e Terrugem', '165 Demo Street, So Joo das Lampas e Terrugem, Lisbon', 38.8426, -9.38064, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.382987, 38.842407), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 87.0, 25.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (212, 211, 'Apartments Center Bairro Alto 1D', 'In the center of the Bairro Alto, ideal place to the travelers that prefere being close to the great interesting points and at the same time next to a net of public transports that allows to move and visit easily.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '166 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.71204, -9.14401, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.139889, 38.713368), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 238.0, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (213, 212, 'Double Bed Apartment – Ground Floor', 'The apartment in Lisbon has 1 bedrooms and has capacity for 2 people.
The apartment is cozy, is fully-equiped, and is 20 m², with access by stars.
The apartment has bed linen and towels. 
In the hotplate of glass ceramics open plan kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, freezer, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils, toaster and kettle are provided.

The accommodation is equipped with the following items: internet (Wi-Fi), gym / fitness centre and a common area with coffee machine.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Campolide', '147 Demo Street, Campolide, Lisbon', 38.73361, -9.16362, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.161413, 38.734544), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 102.0, 26.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (214, 213, 'Charming Rooms', 'Enjoy a unique stay in these four modern, themed suites, available for rent per room. Located near the airport, this accommodation is perfect for those looking for comfort, privacy and easy access to the main travel connections.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Olivais', '34 Demo Street, Olivais, Lisbon', 38.76192, -9.11936, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.118264, 38.76037), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 65.7, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (215, 214, 'Marquinhos do Mar by ACasaDasCasas', 'Excellent duplex apartment in Ericeira, with 107 m2, right in front of the sea, with 2 bedrooms and capacity for 6 people. On the lower floor, there is a living room with sofa and Tv, 2 bedrooms, one being a suite bedroom with a double bed and another with 2 single beds, a bathroom with a bathtub, a bathroom with a shower in the suite and a balcony. The upper floor is an open space with a living area and 1 bed. From this floor, you also have access to the house''s terrace.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Carvoeira', '22 Demo Street, Carvoeira, Lisbon', 38.95213, -9.41316, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.415705, 38.952486), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 4, 2.0, 145.8, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (216, 215, 'GuestReady - Spacious Flat in the heart of Lisbon', 'Centrally located to enjoy all the area has to offer! This apartment can sleep up to 4 people comfortably.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Penha de Frana', '11 Demo Street, Penha de Frana, Lisbon', 38.72858, -9.1291, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.133702, 38.728753), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 139.0, 26.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (217, 216, 'Fantastic view in historic center Sea &Castle', 'My accommodation is in Portas Do Sol, Alfama, Chateau Saint Georges. Enjoy my housing not only for the area, brightness, comfortable bed and comfort but also its breathtaking view of the Tagus. 
My accommodation is perfect for couples, solo travelers, business travelers and families (with children).', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'So Vicente', '6 Demo Street, So Vicente, Lisbon', 38.71325, -9.12946, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.130982, 38.714303), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 82.06, 12.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (218, 217, 'Correeiros 28 - 2 Bedrooms Apartment', 'The apartment is situated at the 2nd floor (with elevator starting at the 1st floor) and has modern and warm decor. It is a 110 m2 apartment, with 2 bedrooms, living room, dining room with table for four person, fully equipped kitchen, bathroom with modern shower cabin. Both bedrooms, living and dining room have air conditioning units. WiFi available.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santa Maria Maior', '6 Demo Street, Santa Maria Maior, Lisbon', 38.70898, -9.13636, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.138164, 38.711405), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 240.0, 82.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (219, 218, 'Soul of Lisbon V - 2BR, AC, in Historic Center', 'Wake up to harmonic church bells and draw back the canopy around the rustic timber four-poster at this bright urban oasis with traditional charm. Take a balmy evening stroll through the winding streets, then curl up on the cream L-shaped sofa. Fully renovated in 2025, with sound proof windows and air conditioning in both bedrooms.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santa Maria Maior', '35 Demo Street, Santa Maria Maior, Lisbon', 38.71244, -9.13512, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.130208, 38.711822), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 4, 1.0, 235.0, 54.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (220, 219, 'Romantic Cottage w/BAY VIEW-2mins to Beach@OldTown', '- 2 MINUTE WALK TO BEACH
- AMAZING VIEW
- SUPERFAST WIFI 
- WORK FROM HOME
- LAUNDRY FACILITIES 
- CENTRAL LOCATION IN HISTORIC OLD 
 TOWN

This Traditional Portuguese Cottage oozes style, charm & character. With its Romantic Bohemian Style & Stunning Cascais Bay View, this little gem is not to be missed. Located in the heart of the Historical Old Town in Cascais, it is only a 2 minute walk to the beach. Restaurants, bars, cafes, museums and public transport are all at your doorstep too.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Cascais e Estoril', '53 Demo Street, Cascais e Estoril, Lisbon', 38.69538, -9.4221, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.416569, 38.694232), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 245.0, 64.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (221, 213, 'Alfama Modern Apartment- 41', 'Apartment with a breathtaking view of the city! Located in the historic heart of Alfama, the apartment offers a cozy and authentic atmosphere. With two bedrooms, a bright living room with a sofa bed, and an equipped kitchen, it''s perfect for a local experience. 
Just a few minutes'' walk from iconic monuments, typical restaurants and the famous Tram 28. Book now and experience the best of Lisbon!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santa Maria Maior', '81 Demo Street, Santa Maria Maior, Lisbon', 38.712587885096674, -9.128400790737924, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.12344, 38.7124), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 179.0, 34.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (222, 220, 'Alfama City Apartment | Old Lisbon', 'Discover Lisbon from this cozy studio in a classic Alfama building, in the city’s oldest and most charming neighborhood. 
Enjoy a compact kitchen with dishwasher, air conditioning, Wi-Fi, and Smart TV. 
Step outside to cobbled streets, cafés, viewpoints, and local life, with the National Pantheon just minutes away. Flexible self check-in lets you explore Lisbon at your own pace and return to a welcoming retreat.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'So Vicente', '120 Demo Street, So Vicente, Lisbon', 38.7138917, -9.1250302, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.123788, 38.710576), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 138.0, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (223, 221, 'Almirante GuestHouse - QuartoE', 'Located in the heart of Lisbon in one of the noblest areas of the city, this apartment provides all the amenities you could wish for during your stay.
With 5 bedrooms (all with natural light), 2 bathrooms, kitchen (fully equipped including washing machine) and common living room.
All rooms are equipped with a single bed (linen included), desk, wardrobe, TV, fan and Wi-Fi internet in all rooms!', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Arroios', '127 Demo Street, Arroios, Lisbon', 38.73129, -9.13428, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.135698, 38.730759), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 2.0, 53.0, 8.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (224, 145, 'Mini Hostel in Lisbon. Room for 2 guests', 'Greetings to all who plan their trip to Lisbon and looking for a cheap and convenient option where to stay. Cozy and nice rooms ideal for those planning to use the time to explore Lisbon, to the maximum. Absolutely all public transport is within walk', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Areeiro', '9 Demo Street, Areeiro, Lisbon', 38.7379, -9.13446, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.135936, 38.739163), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 2, 3.0, 62.0, 11.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (225, 222, 'Estevao ABC• 3 appartements• 10 pers• 4 ch• Alfama', 'Three apartments in the same building, typical of the Alfama district, ideal for up to 10 people while still offering 3 independent accommodation units.
→ 2 duplexes + 1 studio with separate bedroom
→ 4 bedrooms + 1 living room with sofa bed
→ 4 shower rooms + 1 separate toilet
→ 3 fully equipped kitchens, Wi-Fi, beds ready upon arrival (excluding the sofa bed)
5-min walk to Santa Apolónia train station and public transportation.
Perfect location for discovering Lisbon on foot.
NEW: Double soundproof windows.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santa Maria Maior', '129 Demo Street, Santa Maria Maior, Lisbon', 38.71204, -9.12758, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.124358, 38.715725), 4326)::geography, 10, true, 2, 4, 7, 4.5, 482.0, 164.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (226, 223, 'Bird House, tranquilidade e descanso.', 'Bird House
situated in a village in the countryside, S. Bartolomeu dos Galegos, 10 min. by car from the center of Lourinhã, Areia Branca beach, 1km Dino Park, 15 min. from Peniche, Super Tubos beach, 20 min. Cod Buddha Eden and Obidos.
Fully equipped kitchen, 2 wc, living room with recuperator, 3 double bedrooms, single 3 and crib. Parking/ private common, free wifi, cable tv.
Modern, wide, lots of light and black outs.
Private lawn garden, jacuzzi, sun loungers, table and chairs, sun hat, Bbq.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Lourinh e Atalaia', '151 Demo Street, Lourinh e Atalaia, Lisbon', 39.27227, -9.28298, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.284172, 39.27264), 4326)::geography, 9, true, 2, 4, 6, 2.0, 301.0, 46.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (227, 224, 'Fancy Room near Chiado w/ Private Bathroom', 'Located between Chiado, Bairro Alto, Santos and Cais Sodré at the heart of Lisbon''s historical center. Everything in a walking distance.
An absolutely Prime Location house!', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '86 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.70995, -9.15188, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.153002, 38.709593), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 1, 2, 2.0, 146.5, 34.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (228, 225, 'Private room close to beaches and mountain', 'My space is near the beaches at 2 km, and Sintra at 10 km, has many, activities for families. It is close to supermarkets, restaurants, etc.About 30 meters of house has, public transportation. You will love my space because it has a good environment, the neighborhood is quiet. You have access to an outside area. My space is good for couples and individual adventures', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Colares', '107 Demo Street, Colares, Lisbon', 38.81307, -9.45898, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.459942, 38.816016), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 37.0, 11.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (229, 226, 'Hedone Sintra', 'Relax with the whole family in this quiet accommodation with a private pool. A place with a lot of history and very rich in tourism. Close to beaches, golf and horseback riding.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'S.Maria, S.Miguel, S.Martinho, S.Pedro Penaferrim', '35 Demo Street, S.Maria, S.Miguel, S.Martinho, S.Pedro Penaferrim, Lisbon', 38.80112, -9.41348, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.41623, 38.8017), 4326)::geography, 6, true, 2, 3, 4, 2.0, 371.0, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (230, 227, 'Smart studio in the center', 'My apartment is located in the heart of the city, you can enjoy the best cafes, restaurants and coworking areas. It is a ground floor in a very quiet area. You have the Cais do Sodre metro stop just a 10-minute walk away and 2 trams just one minute away. a supermarket 2 minutes away. You have to keep in mind that it is not a luxurious house. It is old but meets expectations for price and location to enjoy the city and be able to walk everywhere. You also have the river and the ferry 10 minutes.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '60 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.7103019, -9.1517643, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.15017, 38.709964), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 93.0, 23.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (231, 228, '★Saldanha Prestige★ City Center Room 7', 'Your Private Bedroom (Double Room) in a high-quality, fully renovated 9-bedroom Apartment. Perfect for those who value maximum comfort, cleanliness, and a prime location in Lisbon.

* Premium Location: 1 min walk from Saldanha Metro station, with direct connection to the airport.

* Sophisticated and fully equipped kitchen and common areas.

* Trusted host for over 10 years, dedicated to an impeccable stay.

We invite you to enjoy the best of Lisbon, from its center. Welcome!', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Avenidas Novas', '41 Demo Street, Avenidas Novas, Lisbon', 38.73275375366211, -9.146366119384766, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.140966, 38.734279), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.5, 79.5, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (232, 229, 'Quarto 1 - 3o Andar - Bairro Alto - Santa Catarina', 'Enjoy easy access to everything from this perfectly located residential base. Close to the Santa Catarina viewpoint in a very central area of Lisbon. 3rd floor apartment without elevator and without AC.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '20 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.7107525, -9.1464074, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.144348, 38.709765), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 2.0, 52.0, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (233, 230, 'SantoSweethome 4A Lisboa', 'Apartment in the heart of the Santos neighborhood with 1 bedroom with double bed and sofa bed in the living room, capacity for up to 4 people.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '11 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.70902, -9.15205, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.152444, 38.707689), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 138.0, 39.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (234, 231, 'Casa em Sao Vicente', 'This spacious and bright third floor duplex apartment is located in Sao Vicente, just off the medieval district of Alfama.
The iconic tram 28 stops 100 m down the road and can take you across old Lisbon.
The apartment is located within a very short walking distance of Largo da Graça and its local amenities, shops, cafés and restaurants.
Please be aware, there is no lift in the building.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'So Vicente', '12 Demo Street, So Vicente, Lisbon', 38.71555, -9.13019, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.133243, 38.716173), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 4, 5, 3.0, 219.0, 44.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (235, 232, 'Lisboa Cathedral · Downtown · AC · Walk Everywhere', 'Stay in the heart of Lisbon at this charming apartment, just steps from Baixa, Alfama, and Praça do Comércio. The apartment features a comfortable queen-size bed, a modern kitchenette equipped with all essentials, along with a Nespresso coffee machine, air conditioning, high-speed Wi-Fi and a flat-screen TV. Located in a modern building with lift, it’s the perfect blend of comfort and convenience. Ideal for couples or solo travelers looking to explore Lisbon from a very central location.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santa Maria Maior', '93 Demo Street, Santa Maria Maior, Lisbon', 38.7093889, -9.1345327, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.135463, 38.710212), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 114.0, 36.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (236, 233, 'Mini Studio Mouraria', 'Our place is a central mini studio perfect to explore the oldtown of Lisboa on foot. Just a few steps away from the Castle and 2 minutes from downtown - with lots of restaurants, bars, authentic stores, viewpoints and narrow streets to discover! We love to pamper our guests!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santa Maria Maior', '55 Demo Street, Santa Maria Maior, Lisbon', 38.71299, -9.13559, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.132653, 38.711905), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 140.0, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (237, 234, 'ARROIOS NEW STYLISH APARTMENT', 'This new, modern, pleasent and confortable apartment, is the ideal place and on the ideal location for your stay in Lisbon, it has 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, at about 10 minutes from the Airport, on one of the best areas for wine tasting and tipical portuguese food. With alot to see and do with all the comodities close by, including all the transports and supermarkets. Non smoking.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Arroios', '147 Demo Street, Arroios, Lisbon', 38.73026, -9.13483, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.131635, 38.731368), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 3, 4, 2.0, 394.33, 120.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (238, 235, 'Luxury Vintage Apartment by MyPlaceforYou', 'Casa Viriato is a spacious and stylish home in the heart of Lisbon, adjacent to Marquês de Pombal, the city''s major square.

The space was created and decorated with one goal in mind: to immerse you in the scenery and culture of Lisbon while also providing you with the best accommodation experience possible.

It is a 130 sqm/1400 sqft two-bedroom apartment with two bathrooms, dining room, living room and kitchen. Ideal for families, couples or just solo adventurers who like space.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Avenidas Novas', '68 Demo Street, Avenidas Novas, Lisbon', 38.72995, -9.14862, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.148945, 38.728314), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 2, 3, 2.0, 200.0, 27.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (239, 134, 'Bright & Cozy Studio Near City Center', 'Welcome to your compact and comfortable retreat in Lisbon! Located at Rua B ao Bairro da Liberdade, this well-designed studio may be small, but it’s packed with charm, functionality, and everything you need for a restful city stay. Ideal for solo travelers or couples looking for comfort and convenience without the extra fuss.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Campolide', '136 Demo Street, Campolide, Lisbon', 38.7347496, -9.1701245, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.170982, 38.732875), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 111.0, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (240, 236, 'GuestReady - Republic Apartments 1E', 'This one-bedroom apartment is perfect for couples looking to stay in the city centre. It has everything you need for a pleasant stay. The property is close to various attractions, good restaurants and shops, and the Campo Pequeno metro station is just 4 minutes away, so guests can easily travel and explore the city!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Avenidas Novas', '35 Demo Street, Avenidas Novas, Lisbon', 38.73887, -9.1454, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.147683, 38.741128), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 3, 1.0, 104.1, 28.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (241, 237, 'Duplex Fado Alfama', 'The comfortable Duplex apartment with 2 bedroom it''s on the 2nd floor, inserted in building of the medieval district of Alfama. The decoration and concept it is related to Fado and typical Lisbon. You will love you stay.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santa Maria Maior', '178 Demo Street, Santa Maria Maior, Lisbon', 38.71051, -9.12789, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.126624, 38.707367), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 202.0, 23.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (242, 238, 'Charming Bedroom Suite with Private Balcony', 'Comfort sleep in this absolutely amazing suite with your own private balcony.
Located in a stylish and spacious home hosted by me.
-Two minute walk to Amadora train station.
-Bus links to all central areas.
-10 minutes train ride to Entrecampos. 
-10 minutes train ride to Central Lisbon (Rossio).
-25 minutes train ride to Sintra.
Grocery stores, restaurants, banks, pharmacies, electronics, clothing stores, and more are within 200 meters radius.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Venteira', '5 Demo Street, Venteira, Lisbon', 38.76034, -9.23798, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.239096, 38.758608), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 80.0, 9.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (243, 239, 'Calm sea view pool & lawn. Family & children', 'Relax with whole family in this quiet house, located on a dead end street. It has 4 bedrooms for 9 adults + 1 baby (there is an extra bedroom for more 2 adults).
Beach and restaurants distance 10 minute walking. The beautiful village of Sintra is 12km away. Lisbon airport distances 40km.
Enjoy the sea view on our private garden and pool w/salted water and fenced for small children. 
The large porch has a big table for lunch w/friends or summer dinners.
Our 5G Wi-Fi is suitable for digital work.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Colares', '161 Demo Street, Colares, Lisbon', 38.83071, -9.46398, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.465707, 38.827977), 4326)::geography, 9, true, 2, 4, 7, 3.5, 282.0, 57.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (244, 240, 'Discover Lisbon from São Vicente Base', '￫ 55 sqm / 592 sqft apartment located on a quiet street next to the Graça area
￫ Surrounded by local cafés, traditional bakeries, and small restaurants. A short walk to Graça’s famous viewpoints, the National Pantheon, and Feira da Ladra flea market.
￫ Well-connected by bus, with easy access to Alfama and downtown Lisbon
￫ 2-bedroom apartment with 2 bathrooms — sleeps 4
￫ 2nd Floor apartment NO elevator', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'So Vicente', '174 Demo Street, So Vicente, Lisbon', 38.72071, -9.12452, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.12684, 38.718229), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 2.0, 116.0, 28.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (245, 241, 'Cozy Central Studio with Private Terrace', 'Cozy and small studio for 2 people with a kitchenette. 

Located in a quiet area in the city center, 10 min walk from Rossio Square, considered the center of Lisbon, close to restaurants, terraces, supermarkets, parks and 4 min from the emblematic Av. da Liberdade, full of shops and surrounded by gardens.

The terrace is a great place to enjoy a lazy breakfast or to relax after a long day walking up and down Lisbon''s many hills. 

4 min from the Avenida metro station, connection to the airport.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santo Antnio', '146 Demo Street, Santo Antnio, Lisbon', 38.71993, -9.14422, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.142331, 38.718278), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 135.0, 32.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (246, 242, 'UNIQUE Clock Tower Suite historic building by LFS', 'This is not just another luxury Suite in the city of Lisbon. It is the only luxury Suite located in the most iconic and emblematic clock tower in Lisbon. Situated in the historical center, right next to the lively Mercado da Ribeira.This Suite possess beautiful timeless interior design, sophisticated finishes and unique features. In this Suite, you can see a breathtaking 360º view (river, city and castle), an unique experience you will never forget. 
Your time is precious, make it unforgettable!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '50 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.70702, -9.14615, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.149791, 38.707793), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 244.0, 79.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (247, 243, 'Amadora Flat 6', 'Modern 2-bedroom flat in a prime city location, perfect for families and friends. This bright and spacious apartment features a fully equipped kitchen, comfortable living area, and two cozy bedrooms with double-sized beds. Enjoy high-speed Wi-Fi, a clean bathroom, and all the amenities you need for a relaxing stay. With easy access to public transport, shops, restaurants, and attractions, it''s the ideal base for exploring the city. Book your stay today for a memorable experience!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Mina de gua', '144 Demo Street, Mina de gua, Lisbon', 38.76234, -9.23657, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.233389, 38.758729), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 176.04, 24.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (248, 244, 'ALEGRAMENTE - calm and cosy apt Lisbon central', 'Simplify in this quiet, centrally located space.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santo Antnio', '8 Demo Street, Santo Antnio, Lisbon', 38.717705, -9.146456, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.148143, 38.717819), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 4, 1.0, 135.5, 27.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (249, 245, 'Cais do Tojo - Loft', 'New loft at Cais do Sodré, a cool vibrant area, near the river and the historical center.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '172 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.70924, -9.15286, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.149376, 38.709752), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 90.8, 26.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (250, 246, 'Casinha Tia Rosário', 'Casinha Tia Rosário is located in Casal da Murta and belongs to Vila da Lourinhã. It is also close to the Municipality of Peniche. 
The house has rustic features with original furniture. Modest but friendly and welcoming decor. It has all the basic appliances for your convenience, many of them are modest but in good condition.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Lourinh e Atalaia', '73 Demo Street, Lourinh e Atalaia, Lisbon', 39.27586, -9.3257, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.331019, 39.276042), 4326)::geography, 4, true, 2, 2, 4, 1.0, 102.0, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01')
) AS v(id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city, neighborhood, address, latitude,
  longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms,
  price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
JOIN cities c ON c.name = v.city;

INSERT INTO listings (id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city_id, neighborhood, address,
  latitude, longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds,
  bathrooms, price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE
SELECT v.id, v.host_id, v.title, v.description, v.property_type, c.id, v.neighborhood, v.address,
  v.latitude, v.longitude, v.public_location, v.max_guests, v.pets_allowed, v.max_pets, v.bedrooms,
  v.beds, v.bathrooms, v.price_per_night, v.cleaning_fee, v.currency, v.created_at::timestamptz
FROM (VALUES
  (251, 247, 'Single room with a view !', 'Enjoy the simple life in this peaceful and centrally located home.
Very close to the metro station that is directly from Copenhagen Airport. Bright apartment with good views. You''ll be living with me and my little family in your own room. If you are traveling with a child, we will also figure it out ☺️
I have a small dog 🐶', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vanlse', '126 Demo Street, Vanlse, Copenhagen', 55.6919631, 12.4947876, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.497217, 55.689402), 4326)::geography, 1, true, 2, 1, 2, 1.0, 546.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (252, 248, 'Skøn lejlighed tæt på natur og offentlig transport', 'Enjoy Copenhagen from a cozy and bright apartment. Sydhavnen is the perfect place for those who like to have nature close by, with a 10-minute walk to Valbypark and the water. Also, it''s only a 10-minute bike ride to the center of the city.
Also enjoy the lovely courtyard and direct descent to your own terrace-

Should you be interested in seeing the whole of Copenhagen, public transport is only a 5-minute walk away and you will be able to be anywhere in Copenhagen in 10 minutes.
Looking forward to seeing you :-)', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '118 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.6499, 12.52723, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.531765, 55.65242), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1731.0, 501.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (253, 249, 'Charmerende byhus fra 1919', '120-square-meter house 5 kilometers from downtown Copenhagen. It is located in a safe and quiet neighborhood with green spaces within walking distance. In 17 minutes a bus will take you to Indre By from the stop 30 meters from the house.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Brnshj-Husum', '103 Demo Street, Brnshj-Husum, Copenhagen', 55.70855, 12.50685, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.503213, 55.707867), 4326)::geography, 6, true, 2, 3, 4, 1.0, 1299.33, 256.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (254, 250, 'Copenhagen apartment in quiet surroundings', 'Our cozy Copenhagen apratment is located 800 meters from Fasanvej Metro stop, 15 minutes from the city center. The apartment is overlooking the trees of Solbjerg Kirkegård on the balcony and by the end of the street we have Frederiksberg Have. The apartment is in quit surroundings and not fare away from good bars and restaurants. There is lots of space and all you need in the apartment.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '70 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.67479, 12.51724, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.516901, 55.671937), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1389.5, 281.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (255, 251, 'Central, cozy, with great atmosphere, babybed', 'Cozy 2 bedroom classic Copenhagener flat on quiet sidestreet, very central, in the midst of buzzing Vesterbro. 8 min walk from the Centralstation. Right behind Istedgade with tons of shops, cafees and restaurants. 100 m from nearest park. Lots of atmosphere in appartement. Eat your breakfast in the easy accesible yard with lots of greenery. Perfect appartement for exploring the city. I do not rent out to young people because of experiences in the past.
Laundry facilities inhouse.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '93 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.67002, 12.55359, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.549543, 55.66811), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 4, 1.0, 2148.4, 571.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (256, 252, 'Nice apartment on central Vesterbro close to Metro', 'Light & calm apartment - central Vesterbro near Enghave Plads. 

The apartment is located in a quiet street at central Vesterbro. Very close to Metro Station Enghave Plads only one stop from the Main Station. 

Vesterbro is a creative and vibrant Copenhagen neighbourhood filled with restaurants, cafés, bars, shops and galleries.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '33 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66923, 12.54805, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.54674, 55.673636), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1219.75, 294.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (257, 253, 'Lyst privat rum med balkon i København', 'Welcome to a bright and cozy private room with its own balcony in a classic Copenhagen apartment in Nørrebro. The room has a comfortable double bed (140 cm), high ceilings, and plenty of daylight. Here you live close to cafes, bakeries, restaurants, parks, and the metro – perfect if you want to experience Copenhagen like a local.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '97 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.697601318359375, 12.553696632385254, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.5494, 55.700138), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 0.5, 890.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (258, 254, 'Sunshine apartment at the sea, 7 min. from Central', 'Enjoy the best of Copenhagen in this cozy apartment close to the sea and Valbyparken.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '92 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.6498283, 12.5270767, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.522823, 55.646718), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 1700.0, 441.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (259, 255, 'Cozy apartment in the heart of Nørrebro, Cph.', 'Located in the heart of Nørrebro, this 55 m2 apartment is ideal for visitors wishing to experience Copenhagen. It is very centrally located with great bus options and only 50 meters from the nearest metrostation (Nørrebros runddel). The apartment is located on the vibrant and energetic Nørrebrogade, which is packed with exciting restaurants, cafes and bars, and if the weather is bad you can curl up on the couch and use the chromecast. It''s a quiet apartment on the 4. th floor :)', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '23 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.69425, 12.54967, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.552954, 55.69386), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1355.25, 359.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (260, 256, 'Østerbro family friendly home', 'Relax with the whole family at this peaceful place to stay.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'sterbro', '64 Demo Street, sterbro, Copenhagen', 55.703556, 12.583142, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.58482, 55.704273), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 1313.0, 311.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (261, 257, 'Charming basement apartment in villa', 'Discover a cozy basement retreat near the airport, city center, and beach. Enjoy a compact kitchen, spacious bathroom with floor heating, and a bedroom with a king-size bed. Relax in the shared garden area for a countryside feel. The airport is only a 15-minute bus ride away. Note: Upstairs apartments have pet-loving occupants; consider allergies to cats and bunnies.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '129 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.64449, 12.61699, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.614561, 55.645851), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1349.33, 333.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (262, 258, 'Unique sun soaked sanctuary', 'A high-end apartment with unique design solutions. The beautiful light soaks the kitchen and dinning area, and on the cosy balcony you can relax and enjoy a quiet moment. In the living room area, you have a flatscreen tv and a sofa where there easily sleeps an extra person or child. In the backyard of the apartment complex you’ll find a nice green barbecue area and play area. The apartment is situated right next to a metro station with easy access to all of Copenhagen.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'sterbro', '5 Demo Street, sterbro, Copenhagen', 55.707361288177026, 12.564445696771145, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.561332, 55.708931), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1500.0, 522.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (263, 259, 'Skøn og moderne lejlighed tæt på Indre København', 'We live in a nice and modern Newly-built apartment with a super cozy terrace. The apartment is bright and open and furnished with 3 rooms and a large bright kitchen, living room, living room. 

We live only 300 meters from the S-train and 15 minutes by bike to Copenhagen City Hall Square. There is a large park within walking distance and Valby itself contains a wealth of good cafes, restaurants and shopping.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Valby', '51 Demo Street, Valby, Copenhagen', 55.669693, 12.490049, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.494965, 55.667054), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 3, 5, 1.0, 1462.25, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (264, 260, 'Your Copenhagen Hideaway in the Heart of Nyhavn', 'Stay in a hidden gem in the heart of Nyhavn. This newly renovated 40 m² apartment for two is tucked away in a quiet courtyard of one of the area''s oldest buildings dating back to the 1700s. Enjoy a king-size bed, fully equipped kitchen, private bathroom, WiFi, and self check-in. Steps from Copenhagen''s top attractions, yet peaceful and secluded. Guests also enjoy special benefits at our renowned Nyhavn restaurants, including Cap Horn, Zeleste, and Nyhavns Færgekro.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '136 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.68077290000003, 12.58838213558195, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.592233, 55.679898), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1648.5, 214.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (265, 261, 'Private Room Copenhagen', 'The apartment is located at the trendy Vesterbro, and are very near to the popular “Meat-packing district” and the central station. Vesterbro is the most trendy area of Copenhagen with a lot of cafes, bars and Restaurants. Tivoli garden are only 5 min from the apartment. The apartment is located on the 3rd floor, an the privat room has window to the courtyard.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '99 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.67238, 12.55939, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.5549, 55.674827), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1059.6, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (266, 262, 'Quality, Central and Quiet.', 'Welcome to my 66m2 (700ft2) Apartment in Central Copenhagen. 
This 4th floor walk up Apartment is filled with light and features a bedroom, living room, dining room, kitchen and bath. 
Recently renovated and ready to host a great CPH stay for you.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '115 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.67619, 12.5877, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.591407, 55.678884), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 3103.33, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (267, 263, 'Super central villa på Frederiksberg', 'Family suitable villa close to everything you could want for a holiday in Copenhagen. Parks, Zoo, restaurants, shopping, cafes, and public transportation within walking distance. Copenhagen city center 3.5 km. All that in quiet surroundings on quiet residential street.
Living room in open connection with the kitchen. 3 rooms, all with double beds (width: 180, 180 and 120). Bathroom with shower, guest toilet.
Basement with washing machine.
Beautiful terrace with morning sun.
Garden with cozy terrace.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '54 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.66883, 12.51589, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.514624, 55.67058), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 3, 3, 1.5, 3104.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (268, 264, 'Bright Nørrebro Apartment with Sunset Balcony', 'Welcome to our bright and spacious 110 m² apartment in Inner Nørrebro. Enjoy two cozy living rooms and a west-facing balcony with evening sun overlooking historic Assistens Cemetery. The apartment is located on a quiet street, while Nørrebro''s cafés, restaurants, and vibrant city life are just around the corner. The perfect balance of city living and relaxation – and children are very welcome.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '151 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.6880822, 12.5527979, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.546808, 55.68803), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 1, 1.0, 2375.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (269, 265, 'Charming Flat w. Garden in Central Frederiksberg', 'Welcome to our beautiful 1-bedroom gem in the serene yet central part of Copenhagen! Located in the heart of Frederiksberg C, our flat is perfect for those who want to experience the best of the city while enjoying a peaceful retreat.

Whether you''re visiting for business or pleasure, our flat offers the perfect blend of convenience, comfort, and charm.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '40 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.68254, 12.54381, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.547442, 55.680129), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1770.33, 223.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (270, 266, 'Lys lejlighed i hjertet af KBH', 'Central apartment close to Copenhagen Central Station, Tivoli and Kødbyen.
90 sqm spacious apartment with bedroom, two living rooms, kitchen, bathroom and balcony.
Unique opportunity to live in the heart of Copenhagen
There is room for three sleeping guests in the apartment. The sleeping arrangements are a double bed and a sofa.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '163 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.6706711, 12.5591532, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.564326, 55.670021), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1671.5, 275.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (271, 267, 'Lovely flat in Nørrebro!', 'Welcome to our charming two-storey flat in the heart of Nørrebro! Perfect for couples. Nestled in a vibrant neighborhood with cafes, shops, and eateries, you''ll feel right at home. Just a stone''s throw from the metro for exploring museums and downtown. Please treat our space with love and care—it''s our home, and now yours too. Welcome!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '87 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.69289, 12.54177, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.548255, 55.690547), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1710.67, 204.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (272, 268, 'Cosy apartment in Amager - close to the metro', 'Cosy simplistic apartment in quiet Amager, Copenhagen. Very close to the metro and Amager Beach. You will have the place all to yourself. There is now internet! And good books, vinyls, a small balcony and a piano. I''m looking forward to welcoming you :-)

Please note that this is a quiet neighbourhood, so no parties are allowed, no additional guests, no smoking inside + music must be off by 22:00.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '1 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.65882, 12.6211, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.620121, 55.654953), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 1958.0, 527.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (273, 269, 'Charming 17th century flat -', 'The apartment, which is on two levels, is located in a listed building from the 1700s in the historic part of Christianshavn. 

The apartment is at the top of the 3rd and 4th floors. The apartment has a bedroom with a view of the tower of Vor Frelser Church, a bathroom with a washing machine, a living room, and on the 4th floor, a kitchen/dining room with exposed beams. There is a small yard attached, which is shared with the property''s other residents. 

The apartment is ideal for a couple - possibly with a smaller child.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '142 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.67404, 12.59226, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.594144, 55.671898), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1970.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (274, 270, 'Skøn lejlighed på Vesterbro', 'Nice apartment in the hip Vesterbro with room for two people. Located a 5-minute walk from Enghave Plads Metro and Carlsberg Station. Only a 2-minute walk from the cozy Enghave Park.
The apartment has a nice living room with a sofa and TV as well as a large dining table. From the living room there is access to a south-facing balcony with two seats. 
The apartment has a nice kitchen with stove, microwave and coffee machine. The bedroom has a good double bed. The apartment is normally occupied, so there will be clothes in the closets.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '151 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66506649999999, 12.5409492, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.539317, 55.663725), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1611.4, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (275, 271, 'Large bright apartment, Østerbro', '100 m2 apartment located in charming fashionable Østerbro, few steps to cozy cafes ,Michelin restaurant , design shop, the park where you can enjoy A morning run with all the Copenhageners ,and the famous lake of Copenhagen , 10 minutes from Down town by bus', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'sterbro', '108 Demo Street, sterbro, Copenhagen', 55.70136, 12.57877, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.580508, 55.705143), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 3, 1.0, 6486.12, 1435.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (276, 272, 'Light and spacious appartement in Copenhagen', 'Two balconies, 3 bedrooms, a cozy living room with a large television and a kitchen/dining room with space for a family or group of friends of 6. A perfect apartment for a longer stay, or a shorter stay with quick access to inner Copenhagen.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vanlse', '91 Demo Street, Vanlse, Copenhagen', 55.6937, 12.50924, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.507359, 55.690369), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 3, 3, 1.0, 2108.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (277, 273, 'Skøn udsigt i historisk kvarter', 'Cozy and elegant 45 m2 apartment with amazing views from the 11th floor to J.C. Jacobsens have in a cool and green neighbourhood (Carlsbergbyen) with easy access to vibrant Vesterbro. 

The apartment has a full kitchen, heated floors, a spacious bathroom, an oak dining table and Scandinavian design furniture. In the small and cozy bedroom there is a desk, where you can drink your morning coffee or write a novel.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '35 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66435, 12.53325, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.529949, 55.664934), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1289.5, 345.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (278, 274, 'Cosy centrally located apartment with balcony', 'Relax with the whole family at this peaceful place to stay. The apartment is 10 minutes away on foot from the seaside and has a metro station just nearby. It is fully furnished and was recently renovated.

The apartment is very cozy with a lot of plants and with a small balcony for your morning coffee/evening wine. Watch you favorite tv series on my comfortable sofa or take time to practice some piano if you like. The kitchen has all elements needed for cooking you own food.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '98 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.65739, 12.62206, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.617307, 55.653817), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 1, 2, 1.0, 1121.8, 123.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (279, 275, 'City Center Apartment.', 'The apartment is located in inner Copenhagen in the middle of the vibrant shopping district.
The apartment is facing a courtyard, but you can still hear the rich citylife in the background.
The neighboorhood is filled with cafées, bars and shopping opportunities. The famous street "Strøget" is an arms length from the apartment, and runs through the entire midtown.
The apartment is perfect for a couple, but it is also good for a Family or 3 or 4 friends or Mom, Dad and 2 kids.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '17 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.6767, 12.57169, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.567666, 55.675678), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1515.5, 299.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (280, 276, 'Købmagergade - copenhagen downtown - close to ever', '== Rooms ==
Main Floor:

Bathroom: basin, hairdryer, shower, toilet.
Bedroom: double bed (length: 2m, width: 1.6m), iron.
Kitchen + living room: dishwasher, dryer, freezer, fridge, oven, stove top, toaster, washing machine, well equipped kitchen, exit to the balcony, co2 detector, smoke detector, television, WIFI internet.
Dining room: dining table.
Toilet: basin, toilet.

Additional Areas:

Terrace: garden furniture.

Brief description: Beautiful, newly renovated chic apartment, offering ...', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '15 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.68025, 12.57792, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.581973, 55.683878), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1981.5, 664.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (281, 277, 'Pragtfuld herskabslejlighed i hjertet af Amager', 'Lovely apartment with lots of light and atmosphere. Amagerbrogade''s nicest neighborhood is just outside the door. Amagerbro Metro is a 5-minute walk from the apartment. Two stops and 10 minutes later, you''re in the inner city. If you choose to walk, the walk over Christianshavn is a feast for the eyes
You can also take the metro to Amager Strand, where both white sandy beaches and plenty of outdoor activities are offered. The possibilities are many and the apartment is a wonderful central base.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager Vest', '94 Demo Street, Amager Vest, Copenhagen', 55.6653213, 12.5992495, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.606597, 55.666177), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 2017.0, 204.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (282, 278, 'Apartment in the Latin Quarter', 'Very charming and cosy three-room apartment with perfect location in the unique Latin Quarter in the Inner City. Perfect for singles or a couple - also if you are travelling with a younger child.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '178 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.67811, 12.56886, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.562165, 55.676957), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 1850.5, 257.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (283, 279, 'Skøn lejlighed i København Ø.', 'The apartment, located on the 4th floor without elevator, is a private home of 130 m2 with balcony, located on inner Østerbro 250 m from Trianglen Metro. A cozy area with many lovely restaurants and wine bars.
The apartment is not child-friendly', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'sterbro', '3 Demo Street, sterbro, Copenhagen', 55.70193, 12.5804, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.585121, 55.702431), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 2089.0, 656.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (284, 280, 'Your own townhouse with garden in exclusive area', 'Perfect oasis with private garden and roof top terrace for couples and small families looking for a beautiful, green and quiet neighborhood in biking distance from downtown Copenhagen. 
 
Within walking distance you have several parks, lots of shopping, Copenhagen ZOO and the Metro that takes you to downtown in 5 minutes.

Frederiksberg is Copenhagen’s green heart. The food scene is amazing - from cool street food to Michelin. One of Europe’s coolest shopping streets is also at Frederiksberg.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '95 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.67814, 12.51013, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.512568, 55.679174), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 3, 3, 1.5, 3024.67, 542.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (285, 281, 'Two room city apartment for rent', 'You are looking at a two room apartment near city center in Frederiksberg area. 

Bakery, Grocery and convenient shops nearby as well as take out places and restaurants. Bus 2A (direction kastrup ) airport stops in front of the door and will take you directly to City Hall or the main station (10 minutes)

Parking in front of the building is free after 7 pm and otherwise it is free to park for 3 hours and after that there is a fee.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vanlse', '158 Demo Street, Vanlse, Copenhagen', 55.69114, 12.51607, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.52268, 55.691585), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1100.0, 221.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (286, 282, 'Room in a cozy apartment', 'Room with access to kitchen and balcony in copenhagen south, close to the city and a metro line. 
5min bike ride to the beach. 
Possibility to borrow a bike. 

I will be in the other room, excellent roomie that very much respects your privacy. 
I’m usually working long hours and hardly ever home. 

This is my primary residence so the closets have stuff in them. I can have a clothing rack available for you if requested. 

I will gladly give tips on fun stuff to do in Copenhagen if wanted.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '71 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.66437, 12.60954, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.610693, 55.665076), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 760.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (287, 283, 'København V / Vesterbro', 'Your family will be close to everything when you stay in this centrally located apartment. It is close to the city, the sea and a lot of delicious restaurants', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '32 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66614, 12.5548, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.557231, 55.66347), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1283.5, 392.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (288, 284, 'Lys & stilfuld lejlighed med altan på Nørrebro', '🌱 On the edge of Nørrebro, you''ll find the perfect combination of vibrant city life and peaceful surroundings.

This bright and well-appointed 3-room apartment measuring 70 m² (750 sq. ft.) allows you to enjoy Nørrebro''s authentic culture and vibrant atmosphere—while also having your own peaceful retreat. 

The apartment has a spacious living room with large windows, a kitchen, two bedrooms and a bathroom. 

🌇 With a sunny balcony and close proximity to both the metro and bus, you have the whole of Copenhagen at your fingertips.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Bispebjerg', '127 Demo Street, Bispebjerg, Copenhagen', 55.70245, 12.53483, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.531201, 55.705493), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 1589.25, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (289, 285, 'Townhouse close to beach and with private parking', 'A unique townhouse in the posh Islands Brygge - just a few meters from Islands Brygge beach, a 7-minute bike ride from City Hall Square, and very close to the beautiful natural surroundings of Amager Fælled.

There are good shopping opportunities and many cozy cafes and eateries.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager Vest', '40 Demo Street, Amager Vest, Copenhagen', 55.6551965, 12.566607, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.568297, 55.654385), 4326)::geography, 6, true, 2, 4, 4, 2.0, 4775.0, 1072.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (290, 286, 'The Superior Room for 4', 'Located next to the famous Copenhagen Lakes in the city centre, this modern hotel is a hidden gem offering comfort, space, and a central location. The hotel combines a peaceful atmosphere with easy access to the main attractions of Copenhagen.

The property features 38 spacious double rooms with comfortable double beds and a work desk, ideal for both leisure and business travellers. In addition, the hotel offers 6 family rooms for up to four guests, each equipped with two double beds and a dinin', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '76 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.67769, 12.55024, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.550982, 55.681202), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1900.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (291, 287, 'Wonderful. Vesterbro. Everything within reach.', '>> Suitable for up to 2 adults and 2 children (ages 4–12) <<

Here you are. 

In a home equipped with everything you need. With a park and a back yard on either side of your walls, and the metro only 50 meters from your doorstep.

Vesterbro is vibrant.

Playgrounds, parks, shops, bars, cafés and restaurants all within a couple of steps.

We are sure families (ground floor) and couples will like it. Single people too, of course.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '114 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66686, 12.54638, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.54832, 55.665977), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 1895.6, 409.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (292, 288, 'Charming 1870s Duplex on Colorful Olufsvej', 'Olufsvej is just 100 meters long, a colorful street filled with history, atmosphere, and a rare calmness in the city. The old houses, built in the 1870s is still full of poetry in every brick and detail. 

This unique two-story apartment is not about modern luxury or new construction, but about a home with soul, quirks, and stories in the walls. 

The apartment has its peculiarities and character, which is exactly what makes the experience so special.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'sterbro', '167 Demo Street, sterbro, Copenhagen', 55.70179, 12.57749, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.58152, 55.701596), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 2590.6, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (293, 289, 'Lejlighed på vesterbro', 'cozy 2-room apartment on beautiful Vesterbro, close to cafes, restaurants and the Central Station. Perfect for couples or solo travelers who want a local experience in the heart of Copenhagen.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '59 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66588037742093, 12.550022788345814, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.552039, 55.665362), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1150.0, 133.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (294, 290, 'To-værelses lejlighed centralt på Nørrebro.', 'Enjoy life in this centrally located two-bedroom apartment in Nørrebro, located by Nørrebroparken/Stefansgade with good public transportation.

The apartment has a sofa bed in the living/dining room, and the other room is a proper children''s room for our 2-year-old. If you don''t have children, there''s also a large folding mattress in the children''s room.

The bathroom is a Copenhagen-style toilet. 

The apartment is on the ground floor, and we have a fantastic yard with a playground, green space, and free use of toys and furniture.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '118 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.69364, 12.53968, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.543968, 55.692422), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 3, 1.0, 950.0, 295.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (295, 291, 'Smuk lejlighed på livlige Nørrebro', 'My apartment is located in Nørrebro in the Stefansgade quarter, which is known for its local character, pop-up environments, specialty stores, wine and beer bars, and a great atmosphere. The apartment is in a peaceful location, but you only have to go around the corner to find local life, sidewalk cafes and Nørrebro Park. 

The neighborhood is bordered by Nørrebro Park and the historic Assistens Cemetery, which is a beautiful and atmospheric breathing space in the city. H.C. Andersen and Søren Kierkegaard, among others, are buried here.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '116 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.6939929, 12.5441279, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.543545, 55.696769), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1383.33, 275.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (296, 292, 'Luksusbolig ved Grøbrødretorv', 'Experience an unforgettable stay in the heart of Copenhagen with this spacious and stylish apartment that offers comfort and functionality. The apartment is 204 sqm spread over two floors with a beautiful view of the square. Perfect for families, groups or business travelers.

Here you get a unique combination of tranquility and convenience, as the square is surrounded by cafes, wine bars and restaurants. Whether you want to enjoy a good dinner at a vegan Italian or a steak at a French restaurant', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '97 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.6797729, 12.5763865, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.575028, 55.679236), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 4, 5, 1.0, 5300.0, 862.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (297, 293, 'Dejlig Københavner-lejlighed på Islands Brygge.', 'Beautiful apartment on Islands Brygge in Copenhagen. Close to Havnebadet, Amager Fælled, Indre By and metro station. The apartment consists of a large bedroom with a double bed and a guest/children''s room with a 3/4 bed. We can also provide an extra double air mattress in the bedroom. There is a fully functional kitchen and living room. The apartment has a small bathroom with shower and toilet. Please note that the bathroom is small. See pictures before you book, so it doesn''t come as a surprise.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager Vest', '122 Demo Street, Amager Vest, Copenhagen', 55.66484, 12.58119, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.578763, 55.667362), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 1338.5, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (298, 294, 'Charmerede rolig lejlighed', 'Enjoy a wonderful weekend at this peaceful and centrally-located place.
Super cozy apartment suitable for a weekend if you want a quiet and peaceful stay in a family-friendly stairwell.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '14 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.66193, 12.62351, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.624256, 55.659254), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1621.5, 337.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (299, 295, 'Stuelejlighed med gårdhave', 'Relax with the whole family in this peaceful home. Here, there is access to a private patio and to a beautiful common yard area, where there is a large swimming pool and a pool for children. In the apartment, there is a bedroom with a double bed and a room with a bunk bed (168 cm). There is also a large sofa that can sleep one or two people, as well as a fold-out mattress. The apartment is close to the beach, S-train station and metro station, as well as very close to a delicious Italian bakery.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'sterbro', '46 Demo Street, sterbro, Copenhagen', 55.7132932829785, 12.570598348975182, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.566891, 55.712301), 4326)::geography, 5, true, 2, 2, 3, 1.0, 1304.8, 301.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (300, 296, 'Værelse / Suite med ejet bad & toilet på Østerbro', 'Large bright Suite of 25 m ² with its own toilet and shower in a stately apartment of 200 m ². You will live in your own section of the apartment and will have access to a large living room with fantastic views, as well as a dedicated office space.
The location is unique – in the quiet embassy neighborhood of Østerbro, just 450 meters from Østerport Station with Metro, S trains and Regional trains.
Few minutes walk to the Little Mermaid, Langelinie, Kongens Have and Statens Museum for Kunst. 
Elevator in the property.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '38 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.69645, 12.59127, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.586644, 55.693044), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1370.0, 372.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01')
) AS v(id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city, neighborhood, address, latitude,
  longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms,
  price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
JOIN cities c ON c.name = v.city;

INSERT INTO listings (id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city_id, neighborhood, address,
  latitude, longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds,
  bathrooms, price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE
SELECT v.id, v.host_id, v.title, v.description, v.property_type, c.id, v.neighborhood, v.address,
  v.latitude, v.longitude, v.public_location, v.max_guests, v.pets_allowed, v.max_pets, v.bedrooms,
  v.beds, v.bathrooms, v.price_per_night, v.cleaning_fee, v.currency, v.created_at::timestamptz
FROM (VALUES
  (301, 297, '"Hyggelig" apartment near city, metro and nature', 'Our apartment is suitable for couples, families, businesstravelers and solotravelers. It is located close to beautiful areas such as Valbyparken and the childrens culturehouse with a free minizoo. 
You will be 300 from the metro at Mozarts Plads and 350 meters from Sjælør station, a direct S-line in to Copenhagen Central Station and Nørreport Station. The many experiences in Copenhagen are therefore only a few minutes away.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '81 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.64972, 12.52823, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.520684, 55.650436), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1273.67, 270.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (302, 298, 'Bright 3 room apt w/Green space, Balcony & Terrace', 'This stylish place to stay is perfect for couples or small groups.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '119 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.69698, 12.54848, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.545877, 55.694833), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 2, 1, 1.0, 1540.67, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (303, 299, 'Central attic apartment', 'Enjoy the simplicity of life in this peaceful and centrally-located home. Quick access to public transport and parks no more than 5 min walk', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '135 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.67732, 12.5385, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.54558, 55.67754), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 1080.0, 266.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (304, 300, 'Modern Apartment with View, close to metro', 'This bright, modern apartment offers panoramic views of the city skyline and is located just a short walk from the metro, making it easy to explore all of Copenhagen. Situated on a high floor in a quiet, secure building

The apartment is fully equipped for a comfortable stay, with a cozy bedroom, well-appointed kitchen, fast Wi-Fi, and everything you need to feel at home.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '46 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.68722, 12.53322, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.538869, 55.688712), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1384.67, 184.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (305, 301, 'Lækker lejlighed på Østerbro lige ved metro', 'Welcome to my centrally located home in the beautiful neighborhood of Østerbro right by the Trianglen M3 metro stop. Just outside the door you will find Copenhagen''s lakes and the beautiful Park, Fælledparken.

The Østerbro district has many cool bars, delicious restaurants, hip bakers and you are within walking distance of both the inner city and the hip Nørrebro. 
There are endless possibilities for experiences, supermarkets, restaurants and tourist attractions, all of which are close by.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'sterbro', '126 Demo Street, sterbro, Copenhagen', 55.69773, 12.57393, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.568327, 55.695473), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1701.0, 526.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (306, 302, 'Lys og lækker lejlighed med to altaner på Nørrebro', 'Beautiful, bright apartment in lively and diverse Nørrebro. 

Super nice 2-room apartment located in the middle of Haraldsgade, quite close to Nørrebroparken. There are shopping opportunities nearby. 

The apartment is relatively newly renovated and with two nice balconies where you can sit and enjoy your breakfast, lunch or dinner.

The apartment has a functional kitchen, large living room with TV and sofa, a separate bedroom and one larger bathroom with separate shower.

In addition, there is free Wi-Fi.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '140 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.70614, 12.55058, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.55607, 55.708169), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1050.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (307, 303, 'Familiebyhus på stranden og tæt på centrum', 'The home has a unique location for a townhouse in Copenhagen - namely in the first row down to the beach. The house consists of 4 half floors, which house a kitchen, living room, bedroom, guest room as well as toilet and bath. In addition, the home offers beautiful outdoor areas in the form of a south-facing roof terrace, courtyard, balcony and front yard.

The home is close to the scenic Amager Fælled, Kødbyen and the city center. Groceries, bakery, cafés and restaurants are within 300 meters. 

Private parking space in the basement.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager Vest', '109 Demo Street, Amager Vest, Copenhagen', 55.65466219817152, 12.565933652222157, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.564469, 55.65675), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.5, 3408.17, 539.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (308, 304, 'Amager Strand Townhouse B&W next to beach', 'Modern and spacious townhouse next to Amager Strand beach with nearby grocery and eating out possibilities. Space for up to 5 adults and 2x extra beds for young kids up to age of 12. Small terrasse with garden and BBQ grill on roof top.
10 minutes from airport by metro and 5 stops by metro from city center. Free parking on main road or to-pay just in front of the door.

Option to use Stand-Up-Paddle for free for a ride on the water :).', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '146 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.65988989128052, 12.6327689343933, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.63419, 55.658568), 4326)::geography, 5, true, 2, 3, 3, 2.5, 2524.25, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (309, 305, 'Private Room in Copenhagen SV', 'Apart from the room you will have access to bathroom and kitchen, and you are welcome to do light cooking in the kitchen.

Cosy room for your disposal.In a green aarea close to Valby parc and the city.Kitchen and bathroom to share...Apartment ( and a room ) is on the 3rd floor / without elevator...Kitchen is just being renovated.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '140 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.64443, 12.52773, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.530281, 55.648029), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 2, 1, 1.0, 457.0, 76.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (310, 306, 'Hyggelig lejlighed på Nørrebro', 'Stay in a cozy apartment in the heart of vibrant Nørrebro while enjoying the tranquility of the shared courtyard.
The apartment consists of: a bedroom with a double bed; a bathroom with a spacious shower; and a combined kitchen and living room filled with light coming in through the large window.
The kitchen is equipped with an electric stove, oven, dishwasher, and various kitchen appliances (mixer, toaster, etc.). In the living room, the sofa can easily be converted into a bed for two!
You can also enjoy the sun until evening on our small balcony, which is furnished with a bench and a table.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '21 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.698437, 12.545799, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.53879, 55.699893), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1400.0, 406.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (311, 307, 'Moderne lejlighed i grønt kvarter', 'Have a wonderful holiday in this stylish private home with a balcony and access to green common areas. The apartment is 103 m² (1,108 sq. ft.), and there are 3 bedrooms with double beds. The bed sizes are 160 x 200 cm, 120 x 200 cm, and 140 x 200 cm. 
Very quiet neighborhood with many trees and green areas.

On the common green areas there are tables and benches, petanque, playground with swings and slide and football field. Just opposite the apartment there is a public park with, among other things, a training station and popular playground.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '48 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.69194, 12.52076, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.52403, 55.692561), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 3, 3, 1.0, 3092.33, 1037.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (312, 308, 'Privat værelse på Nørrebro', '"Welcome! I''m renting out one of the cozy rooms in my apartment. It''s just a short 3-minute stroll from the train, metro, and bus stops, and a mere 20 minutes from the vibrant city center. While there''s no kitchen access, we can definitely chat about it. The bathroom is shared, but don''t worry, I''m a friendly and social person, so feel free to strike up a conversation, ask questions, or simply enjoy your own quiet time. The bed is a queen-size futon. Looking forward to meeting you!"', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '145 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.69967, 12.54095, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.543539, 55.695946), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 730.0, 229.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (313, 309, 'Spacious apartment in central Vesterbro', 'Spacious apartment located in the center of hip Vesterbro. 8 minute walk from Central station and ideal for two couples, or one couple traveling with or without children, who wants be close to everything. 

Besides the master bedroom, the children’s room has an extendable queensize double bed used by our 4 year old, but can be used by two adults. The baby’s room has a crib. 

Surrounded by a ton of bars, cafes and restaurants including the Meatpacking district, you''ll find most needs met.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '102 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66902, 12.55309, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.551933, 55.667453), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 3, 2, 1.0, 2348.5, 238.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (314, 310, 'Dejlig lejlighed med skøn udsigt', 'Beautiful two-bedroom apartment in a quiet neighborhood. There is public transport, including bus, S-train and Metro, a short distance from the apartment. Bus 19A, Metro Mozarts Plads and S-train Sjælør and Copenhagen. The apartment is located at the top of the 3rd floor with stunning views. 
The area is cozy and is located right next to Valby Park, where there is a beach. Supermarkets SuperBrugsen and 365 are close by. The nature area Tippen, Kulturhuset Karens Minde and Valby Vandkulturhuset are within walking distance.
The apartment is smoke-free.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '179 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.64613261007935, 12.52545140683651, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.532466, 55.644114), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1008.43, 255.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (315, 311, 'Hyggelig lejlighed i livligt kvarter tæt på alt!', 'Cozy, central apartment with everything you could want nearby. 
In our lovely apartment, there is air, light and lots of color. 
We live right by Kødbyen, which has a lot of lovely places to eat, 2 min. Walking distance to train, 8 min. Walking distance to subway and 15 min. Walking to the city center. In the summer you can see the fireworks from Tivoli from our window.
100 meters away there is a shopping center, IKEA and a lot of lovely coffee shops, etc. right nearby. 
The apartment is located on the 3rd floor without an elevator', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '23 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66678, 12.55525, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.554046, 55.664197), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 1407.67, 490.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (316, 312, 'Seas of Copenhagen - Family x6 - Luxury - Central', 'Newly renovated Family friendly luxury apartment in the charming Østerbro quarter right next to the center of Copenhagen and the Seas of Copenhagen at groundfloor(9 steps).

The apartment is a 10 minut walk to the metro. 15 minuts to Kongens Garden. 20 minuts to the center of Cph. 

At your disposal, there is beer (w/w-out alcohol), olive oil, coffee, tea and bottled water and more.

The apartment is always cleaned by professionals.

Ideal for a noise-free, family, relaxing Copenhagen experience', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '110 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.69558, 12.57894, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.575919, 55.691521), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 3, 4, 1.0, 1973.5, 221.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (317, 313, 'Heart of Copenhagen', 'Christianshavn is located in the heart of Copenhagen.
The apartment is one bedroom ,one dinning room and one toilet/shower.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '142 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.67425, 12.59669, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.594653, 55.675238), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1650.0, 302.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (318, 314, 'Bohemian Bedroom central Cph', 'Enjoy the happy life in this peaceful and centrally-located place. Wake up to birdsong and do your yoga in the courtyard.
You will have peace and quiet to yourself, the opportunity to cook in the kitchen and of course wash away the day''s stress in the Bali-inspired bathroom.
If you want to talk and eat together one evening, we can - I am very active and out so often, you can be here all alone. 
Good WiFi if you need to watch a movie, work, or call home!', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '1 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.67019, 12.54832, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.549101, 55.673163), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 0.5, 687.0, 197.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (319, 315, 'Central apartment near the lakes', 'Enjoy the simple life in this peaceful and centrally located home.
A stone''s throw from the lakes, the King''s Garden, & Botanical Garden. All of Copenhagen''s major attractions can be reached on foot. Nørreport and Østerport station take 10 minutes. 
Many good restaurants, cafes, bakeries are less than 5 minutes away. 
If you want to experience Copenhagen, my home is an obvious choice. 
Welcome to Copenhagen K.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '106 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.6896754, 12.5722047, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.575799, 55.687925), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 2567.0, 525.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (320, 316, 'Big, cosy and family friendly w. 4 large balconies', 'Fully equipped spacious flat with six rooms and Four balconies, at the heart of vibrant Nørrebro, 2 min walk to Nørrebro Parken, 5 min walk to Jægersborggade and Stefansgade, 7 min walk to Nørrebro metro/train station.

Large closed yard, with two playgrounds, pétanque court, barbecue area and cellar to park your pram or bikes.

Good cafes, restaurants and lots of activities for everyone.

three double beds, one of which is a sofa bed and a junior bed and a baby bed.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '44 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.695936766117924, 12.538983073016356, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.534638, 55.697543), 4326)::geography, 7, false, 0, 3, 3, 1.0, 3440.2, 1137.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (321, 317, 'Cosy apptm with balcony in Vesterbro, Copenhagen.', 'The apartment is conveniently located about 1 km from Copenhagen city center and is well-connected to various public transport options, including bus and metro (just 1 stop from Copenhagen Central Station).

You''ll also meet Manfred, my resident feline companion.

The bedroom is your private space, while I stay in the living room. The toilet, living room, and balcony are shared, and I’m sure we’ll make the arrangement work if we maintain a considerate atmosphere. ((:', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '9 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.67102, 12.54809, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.555284, 55.671321), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 709.67, 239.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (322, 318, 'Private House Close To City Center', 'A charming, well-equipped private house in a quiet residential neighbourhood on Amager, Mei S, just minutes from the city by metro or bike. Enjoy a sun-drenched conservatory living room, a fully equipped kitchen with gas stove, and a lovely garden with terrace and trampoline. Sleeps up to 5 guests across 3 sleeping arrangements.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager Vest', '64 Demo Street, Amager Vest, Copenhagen', 55.63535, 12.59066, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.589971, 55.636759), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 2000.0, 287.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (323, 319, 'Spacious Apartment in Østerbro with Balcony', 'Bright and spacious apartment located in central Østerbro. It is a two-minute walk from Nordhavn St, which will take you to the city centre in less than 5 minutes, and only a couple of kilometres from buzzing Nørrebro. The apartment is located close to great restaurants, green oases, and cozy squares. It is also within walking distance from the little main attractions. The apartment is ideal for a romantic getaway in lovely Copenhagen with a small undisturbed balcony. Recently renovated.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'sterbro', '167 Demo Street, sterbro, Copenhagen', 55.7038, 12.58647, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.5883, 55.702779), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1331.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (324, 320, 'Spacious appartment with garden', 'three bedroom appartment with spacious living room and kitchen. Located close to the airport.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '175 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.6555, 12.61659, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.619886, 55.6545), 4326)::geography, 12, false, 0, 6, 7, 2.5, 3757.0, 588.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (325, 321, 'Hyggelig lejlighed på Nørrebro', 'Hyggelig and spacious 2-storey apartment centrally located in wonderful Nørrebro. 

The apartment features two bedrooms, a living room, a kitchen-dining area, a large bathroom, and access to a delightful green courtyard where you can relax and enjoy the sun. 

The apartment is located just 2 minutes away from the metro station Skjolds Plads, which provides direct access to Kongens Nytorv and Copenhagen Central Station.

We hope you will enjoy!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '160 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.70136, 12.54833, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.544994, 55.70176), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 2, 1, 1.0, 1910.0, 577.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (326, 322, 'Privat værelse med egen indgang', 'Private room in the sought-after part of Frederiksberg C, very close to Værnedamsvej . The room has a private entrance from enclosed small and quiet courtyard with cozy sunny garden. The room has a 90x200 bed, tea kitchen with small fridge, hot plate and sink. There is direct access to a lovely bathroom with a bathtub. 
The room is located at one end of a 156 m2 mansion isolated from the rest of the home.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '2 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.67576720110101, 12.550017065081791, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.551187, 55.674437), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1074.0, 213.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (327, 323, 'Riverside Retreat in the Heart of Copenhagen', 'Explore Copenhagen from Our 84m² Apartment

Our new 84m² apartment in the heart of Copenhagen offers the perfect base for your city adventure. Enjoy canal views from the balcony and easy access to a nearby sandy beach.

This cozy and secure neighborhood is just 2km from the city center at Rådhuspladsen, with excellent public transportation options. You''re also close to the vibrant Vesterbro district with its many restaurants.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager Vest', '69 Demo Street, Amager Vest, Copenhagen', 55.6590576171875, 12.569479942321777, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.573446, 55.661368), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 3423.67, 803.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (328, 324, 'Bright and cosy apartment', 'The apartment consists of a bedroom, a living room, a kitchen and a toilet. NOTE that there is shared bath in the basement. In addition, there is a lovely yard, which is for free use.

The apartment is located in an attractive area close to 
supermarkets, metro and within walking distance to Copenhagen Central Station.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '157 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66836, 12.54504, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.550027, 55.667183), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1173.33, 215.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (329, 325, 'In the middle of Østerbro`s culinary street', 'In the middle of Østerbro''s culinary main artery, Nordre Frihavnsgade, is this beautiful apartment of 136 m2, which can be rented for your next city break in Copenhagen. 
Close to city attractions such as Nyhavn, the lakes, the Little Mermaid Park and Market Halls. On foot, by bus or metro coming, you are within the whole of Copenhagen neighborhoods in minutes.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'sterbro', '72 Demo Street, sterbro, Copenhagen', 55.70283, 12.58212, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.579743, 55.70066), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 2113.33, 251.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (330, 326, 'Between airport and city centre', 'Top-floor apartment in majestic building. 80 square meters. 1 minute walking to metrostation and busses. 1 minute walking to shoppingcenter. 20 minutes walking to city. No elevator! Bright light apartment with morning sun. Some traffic noice during daytime. Apartment in sidestreet to mainstreet.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager Vest', '115 Demo Street, Amager Vest, Copenhagen', 55.664222717285156, 12.600005149841309, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.602096, 55.66458), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 1, 2, 1.0, 1432.33, 239.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (331, 327, 'Awesome , Cosy, Rentandstay dk 2', 'Copenhagen / Frederiksberg , clean, quiet and cosy room, in one of the most attractive locations in Frederiksberg. 
Very close to Carlsberg, restaurants, cafes, The Central Station, Copenhagen business school, Zoo, Frederiksberg parks.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '26 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.66889, 12.53458, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.530336, 55.668162), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 312.47, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (332, 328, 'Bright, Spacious & Cozy Stay', 'Welcome to our 72 m² apartment in a vibrant area filled with great dining, bars, shopping, and galleries. Some of the city''s best bakeries are just a short walk away! The apartment is newly renovated with a fully equipped kitchen and is close to the metro and public transport. In early November, a new large balcony will be added for an even better experience. 
Upon booking, you''ll receive a guide on how to find the apartment and tips for our favorite local spots.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '171 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.69798, 12.54756, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.550597, 55.697194), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1512.5, 475.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (333, 329, 'Homely 2 room Apartment close to Cph. city center', 'Cosy, small 2 room apartment, near the centre of Copenhagen, in our lovely house. The apartment has a king-size bed which can be used as 2 singles and is decorated in a cosy homely stile. Located in a calm, quiet area with a lot of green parks and a lake nearby, sports facilities (Telia-Parken), grocery shopping around the corner, close to the beach and UN city (3km). Copenhagen centre is just 15 minutes away (bicycle, train, bus). Our lovely garden in front of the house can be used as well.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Bispebjerg', '159 Demo Street, Bispebjerg, Copenhagen', 55.71949, 12.55305, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.546021, 55.718237), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 3, 1.0, 1242.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (334, 330, 'Spacious apartment in lovely Nørrebro', 'Let''s make one thing clear - life is good in Copenhagen (and in Nørrebro especially), and our cosy, plant-filled four room apartment is the perfect base for you to explore!

The apartment sleeps two people (+ single mattress available upon request) and the cosy kitchen, balcony and living room provide ample space to hang out when you''re not busy shopping, having drinks or dining in the many bars and restaurants that the area offers.

Don''t hesitate - get in touch and let''s plan your stay :)', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '137 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.69148, 12.5453, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.540765, 55.689854), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1769.67, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (335, 331, 'Charmerende lejlighed i København.', 'Charming apartment in the heart of Vesterbro. Your family will be close to cafes, restaurants, playgrounds, shopping. Close to Tivoli and the Zoo with metro and bus 

The home:
There are three bedrooms in the apartment. One room with a king-size bed and two rooms with single beds.

The kitchen is well equipped with a regular oven, refrigerator, freezer, induction stove and dishwasher.

Our apartment has a sunny balcony, and there is a large child-friendly yard with swings, a ball court and a large lawn.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '177 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.6699094, 12.5446812, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.54702, 55.673078), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 3, 3, 1.0, 2954.33, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (336, 332, 'cosy with shared sunny backyard', 'The space
Cosy little place in the center of Valby, close to Frederiksberg, nørrebro and vesterbro. Many cute little local shops and a mall 10 min away called spinderiet. Grocerystores also just around the corner.
Also 10 min. away is søndermarken. A huge beautiful park. 
Close to the Copenhagen zoo.

Guest access
A lovely courtyard with many garden furniture and where there is room for barbecues.

Other things to note
Some people have commented on my interior design. So i just want to let you know before you book. I redecorate and rearrange once in a while, because i like the change, so the couch might be different or put somewhere else than you can see on the pictures. And there might be new plankets and a new lamp or something.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Valby', '27 Demo Street, Valby, Copenhagen', 55.66032, 12.51787, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.516649, 55.659101), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1074.0, 301.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (337, 333, 'Big appartement In Valby', 'Stay in our warm, welcoming home in Valby, designed for families and groups. Three bedrooms upstairs (2 doubles + children’s bunk + pull-out bed), bright living room, open kitchen/dining, bathroom on the ground floor. A home for families – kids can be kids without worry to much - thanks to family-friendly furnishings. Dining table seats 8–10, sofa doubles as extra bed. High chair & baby essentials upon request. Easy access to public transportation. Check my reviews.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Valby', '155 Demo Street, Valby, Copenhagen', 55.66031, 12.50199, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.507631, 55.660091), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 1015.75, 252.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (338, 334, '2-værelses ved metroen, tæt ved Fælledparken', 'Stay high and quiet on the 6th floor (with elevator) with fantastic views of Copenhagen.

☀️ West-facing balcony with sun all afternoon - and a beautiful sunset
🍳 Open kitchen-living room with all appliances
🚿 Bathroom with sink
🌏 Located close to Fælledparken, Jyllandsgadekvarteret and Nordhavn', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'sterbro', '66 Demo Street, sterbro, Copenhagen', 55.70833, 12.57383, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.573216, 55.707146), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1552.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (339, 335, 'Spaciuos apart., quiet neighborhood', 'In the heart of Frederiksberg, one of the most attractive districts of Copenhagen, you''ll find my spaciuos and bright apartment, 100 m2. Close to the Metro, Frederiksberg Garden, Zoo, downtown Cph and the hip neighborhoods Vesterbro and Nørrebro. You will have the apartment all to your self. Very quit and safe neighborhood. Smoking is allowed in the kitchen, with closed door and open window.The bathroom is small, the shower cabin is raised 45 cm, you have to use a small stool to step up into it', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '139 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.67734, 12.53571, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.54306, 55.675921), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1751.0, 497.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (340, 336, 'Havneudsigt og havnebad', 'Centrally located, beautiful apartment in unique building in the harbor, elevator and cheap parking outside. Quiet area. 
Metro 5 min from the door.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '44 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66164, 12.56369, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.5666, 55.661801), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1426.5, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (341, 337, 'Hyggelig 2-værelses lejlighed i hjertet af Valby', 'Welcome to Valby! 

This charming neighborhood in Copenhagen offers a wonderful mix of cozy cafes, good restaurants, green areas and easy access to public transport. 

Close to the apartment you will find lovely natural areas such as KBH Zoo, Søndermarken and Frederiksberg Have, as well as a sea of shops, cafes and grocery stores. And with only a 1-minute walk to Valby st, you''ll be in the inner city in a split second. 

Here you will find everything you need to have a pleasant stay in Copenhagen.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Valby', '139 Demo Street, Valby, Copenhagen', 55.66281249999999, 12.5145211, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.516171, 55.662219), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1155.33, 294.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (342, 338, 'Frederiksberg', 'Enjoy the simplicity of life in this peaceful and centrally-located home. Close to the S-train, metro, parks, and the zoo
There has previously been a dog in the apartment.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '136 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.68118, 12.50376, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.497196, 55.680836), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1604.6, 362.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (343, 339, 'Cozy modern "Loft XL" apartment in Ørestad', 'Discover a new kind of business hotel in Mina. 

Located next to DR Koncerthuset & 1-min from the metro, Mina is designed for professionals, business travelers, and remote workers who are on the lookout for a trendy & sustainable apartment hotel for 1 day, to 1 month, to 1 year. 

When you feel like leaving your private Loft to socialize, the rooftop Social Spaces are open 24/7 and cater to your fun, practical, and professional needs - all while providing amazing views!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager Vest', '5 Demo Street, Amager Vest, Copenhagen', 55.65657, 12.59177, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.58939, 55.656902), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1989.0, 594.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (344, 340, 'Two room snug apartment downtown', 'The flat is located downtown hipster Vesterbro . It is on the 1st floor. Each of 2 rooms has a very good futon sofa, which opens up to become a bed 140 cm wide with a layer of top mattresses under the sheets. If you come two wanting to share a room you can decide yourself which of the rooms you want to sleep in - or split.
A baby cot can be made available. Kindly see photos', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '164 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66609, 12.55009, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.55355, 55.666504), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 913.0, 130.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (345, 341, 'Modern and Cosy Copenhagen', 'Beautiful and cosy loft-style apartment, in a lovely area of Central Copenhagen.

Located in Østerbro, on Amerika Plads, the apartment is right at the crossroads of the city center, the Lakes, and Nordhavn.

Consisting of a big common area and modular sleeping arrangements, it is ideal for couples or families travelling together.

Located close to both metro and s-train stations.
Paid parking is available right in the basement.

We''ll do our best to make your stay a wonderful one :)', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'sterbro', '90 Demo Street, sterbro, Copenhagen', 55.70014, 12.59548, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.597864, 55.700736), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 2043.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (346, 342, 'Lejlighed med udsigt over Marmorkirken og Nyboder', 'Enjoy your vacation in this peaceful and centrally-located place. Overlooking the Marble Church and Nyboder, and a stone''s throw from Amalienborg, Kastellet, The Little Mermaid and Kongens Nytorv, this gem is perfect for both short and long stays in Copenhagen.

This is my private home, so I hope you will take good care of it and enjoy the homely atmosphere. The home is suitable for everything from focused telecommuting to families with children to friends who want to create memories for life together in Copenhagen!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '77 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.68705, 12.59031, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.586134, 55.687153), 4326)::geography, 4, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 2317.0, 773.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (347, 343, 'Charming villa close to city center', 'Architect designed 50s villa close to the city. Located only 100 meters from nature reserve and beautiful lake.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Bispebjerg', '42 Demo Street, Bispebjerg, Copenhagen', 55.72504, 12.52447, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.523744, 55.726194), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 4, 5, 2.0, 2443.8, 639.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (348, 344, 'Beautiful apartment, big balcony', 'Welcome to our beautiful home - located in Nørrebro, a creative, vibrant and diverse part of Copenhagen. 

The apartment is 106m2, perfect for a family, a couple and/or friends. 
The apartment consists of a big balcony, two living rooms, two bathrooms (one toilet) and two bedrooms with adult sized beds for four persons (one kingsize bed 180x200 + an adult sized bunk bed in the kids room 2x80x200). 

5min from the CPH-metro, 10min from the city center and 30min from airport. 

Enjoy your stay!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '180 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.7011604309082, 12.550759315490723, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.5509, 55.702097), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 2490.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (349, 345, 'Dejlig lejlighed med en fantastisk placering', 'This special home is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit. The apartment is 200 meters away from Nuuks Plads metro and fantastic Rantzausgade and walking distance to Copenhagen K, Frederiksberg, Østerbro, Vesterbro etc. 

In general, the apartment of 52 sqm. is very cozy with a fantastic light. The courtyard area is incredibly quiet and there is very little noise from the city outside.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '88 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.6876092, 12.5438381, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.54796, 55.68743), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1491.33, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (350, 346, 'Skøn lejlighed på Frederiksberg!', 'Your family will be close to everything when you live in this centrally located home. Metro, bus will get you around quickly. Walking distance to Frederiksberg Have and a sea of supermarkets are close by. At the same time, the apartment is located in a nice, enclosed, quiet area.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '166 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.680146781173555, 12.516643956097425, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.514913, 55.680732), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 3, 3, 1.0, 1671.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01')
) AS v(id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city, neighborhood, address, latitude,
  longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms,
  price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
JOIN cities c ON c.name = v.city;

INSERT INTO listings (id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city_id, neighborhood, address,
  latitude, longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds,
  bathrooms, price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE
SELECT v.id, v.host_id, v.title, v.description, v.property_type, c.id, v.neighborhood, v.address,
  v.latitude, v.longitude, v.public_location, v.max_guests, v.pets_allowed, v.max_pets, v.bedrooms,
  v.beds, v.bathrooms, v.price_per_night, v.cleaning_fee, v.currency, v.created_at::timestamptz
FROM (VALUES
  (351, 347, 'Inner city apartment', 'Stay in the heart of Copenhagen, just behind Magasin du Nord at Kongens Nytorv, in the historic city center. Bright and cozy 49 m² apartment with a comfortable bedroom, fold-out bed, modern kitchen, and bathroom with bathtub and heated floor. Excellent shower pressure. Enjoy a stylish living area and all the essentials for a comfortable stay. Steps from Nyhavn and Strøget, with easy metro access and under 18 minutes to the airport. WiFi, self check-in, towels, and toiletries included.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '52 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.67716, 12.58365, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.585822, 55.675999), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1826.0, 221.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (352, 348, 'Skøn gammel Villa tæt på metro', 'Family-friendly villa close to metro and shopping outside Copenhagen. Ground floor with bathroom, kitchen-living room, living room and large bathroom with bath. 
1st floor with large bedroom, 2 children''s rooms where one has a crib and the other has a junior bed, but with the possibility of extra beds. In addition, a small guest toilet on the 1st floor. The house is located on a quiet residential street within walking distance of the metro and shopping.
Perfect opportunity to combine city life with family life.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vanlse', '2 Demo Street, Vanlse, Copenhagen', 55.69003, 12.48403, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.491561, 55.690779), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 3, 2, 2.0, 1792.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (353, 349, 'Cozy & Historic Apartment in Inner City Copenhagen', 'Super central, charming older apartment. Recently renovated.
The apartment retains original details but has been updated to suit modern living.
Comfortable temperature year-round and low noise levels, even on weekends.
Located on a cozy, quiet street with small cafés and vintage shops. Extremely central – everything is close by.
Ørsted Park is just across the street.
The King''s Garden, the Round Tower, Tivoli Gardens, Strøget, and City Hall Square are all within a 10-minute walk.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '29 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.6799602, 12.5680414, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.571608, 55.679564), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 2698.33, 714.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (354, 350, 'Spacious and central designer home with fireplace', 'Classic spacious 150m2 private city appartment in quiet residential area just 15 minutes walking distance from Tivoli and city center, as well as the pulsating areas of Vesterbro and Nørrebro. 
Metrostation FORUM at 5 minutes walking - 17 minutes ride from airport 24/7.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '135 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.68151, 12.5462, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.550205, 55.681964), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 2600.0, 826.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (355, 351, 'Double-room in cozy bright apartment near Nørrebro', 'Large double-room in light and cozy 3rd floor apartment with two balconies. Big kitchen with dining table and access to balcony overlooking the green yard. The bathroom has a little bathtub and washing machine. The apartment is a 10 minute walk from Nørrebro station, 2 minute walk from popular café/bar Fovl and just a 5 minute walk from popular bakery Flere Fugle and café Kaffedepartementet.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Bispebjerg', '24 Demo Street, Bispebjerg, Copenhagen', 55.70329, 12.52553, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.528206, 55.703086), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 1354.5, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (356, 352, 'Frederiksstadens Perle', 'A 93 m2 gem on the 4th floor with elevator, two small balconies and a beautiful shared roof terrace. The apartment has three large south-facing rooms en-suite + one room facing east. Here, it is furnished with a mix of antiques and modern comforts, everything is unique and the location is not better in Copenhagen. Look forward to an unforgettable stay in our wonderful neighborhood with Amalienborg Castle just around the corner and the entire waterfront overlooking the Opera House as well as Nyhavn and Strøget within walking distance. 
Metro 120 meters.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '106 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.686196, 12.589479, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.596228, 55.687479), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 2420.0, 366.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (357, 353, 'Design apartment with terrace in the heart of Cph', 'Design apartment in the heart of Copenhagen. It is placed in a cosy and quite backyard. The apartment has a unique terrace.

One primary bedroom for two adults and two teenage bedrooms. The two teenage rooms extends into the other. One of the teen rooms has a glass wall which can be closed off with a curtain. 

Baby crib, chair and tub on request.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '52 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.68522, 12.58802, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.591336, 55.686822), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 3, 3, 1.0, 4516.67, 557.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (358, 354, 'Cosy room in copenhagen center', 'It is a nice small apartment in a quiet neighborhood in Amager. It is a cozy room with a single size bed and the other one is a sofa bed that can be made into a couch in the room. It also has a dining table with space for 2 people and a large mirror as accessories', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '100 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.65844, 12.60984, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.610354, 55.656927), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 926.0, 138.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (359, 355, 'Hyggelig 2-værelses lejlighed i København', 'This apartment is located in "Nordvest" - an upcoming area in Copenhagen with a lot of nice and hidden places to explore. It is close to Nørrebro, which is a district that''s very hip and filled with a lot of cool outside areas, bars and restaurants. Personally, one of my favourite areas to hang out. 

The apartment is only 300 meters from Nørrebro station where you can both take the s-train and the metro to visit other places in and around Copenhagen.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Bispebjerg', '47 Demo Street, Bispebjerg, Copenhagen', 55.70343, 12.5331, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.529055, 55.700469), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1253.0, 342.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (360, 356, 'Charming Big close to Metro', 'clean comfortable full furnitured big bathroom lovely kitchen 2 small fllower balkons. Especialle childrenfamily can enjoy lot of toys. 10 minute to center, near acces to bus, train, taxi, eassy connection to shopping places, beach, restaurants parks', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '6 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.70303, 12.54875, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.548054, 55.701835), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 989.0, 311.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (361, 357, 'Sailor’s Designer Suite', 'Welcome to our apartment situated in Copenhagen''s biggest attraction, Nyhavn. Immerse yourself in the vibrant tapestry of 17th-century facades, enjoy the bustling waterfront atmosphere, and savor a variety of Danish culinary delights right at your doorstep. With its dynamic views and convenient access to the city''s core and main attractions, our apartment serves as the perfect base for any purpose you have in mind.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '44 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.680355139066734, 12.589830793440342, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.591375, 55.683646), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1430.0, 205.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (362, 358, 'Lovely apartment close to Copenhagen city centre', 'Simple, peaceful and cozy apartment with all amenities included and close to Copenhagen city centre and airport.

This residence has the following:

- 44 m2 and has most amenities included.
- Free parking 24/7.
- 2 minute walk to transportation.
- No traffic noise at night.
- Clean and simple apartment.
- Big 65” inch smart TV with all streaming apps.
- Green surroundings.
- Family friendly.
- Comfy bed and big closet to store your clothes.
- As your host I will help you during your stay.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '89 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.64689680000001, 12.6176602, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.622322, 55.647415), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1459.2, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (363, 359, 'Lejlighed i hjertet af Kbh', 'Enjoy our little home in the heart of Copenhagen. 

We are a quiet and calm couple who rent out our apartment. But what can we offer besides views of the lakes and a charming and personal home? 

Within a radius of 500 meters you will find: 
Cafes and restaurants 
Museums
Shopping opportunities
Green spaces
Public transport 

From our home, you can get anywhere in 15 minutes by bike. You can go to the King''s Garden and enjoy the sunset by the Copenhagen lakes. What''s not to like?', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '92 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.69151, 12.57386, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.574296, 55.695134), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1100.0, 233.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (364, 360, 'Cozy central 4-bedroom apartment near metro', 'You will be comfortable and well connected to everything when you stay at this centrally-located place.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'sterbro', '177 Demo Street, sterbro, Copenhagen', 55.69768, 12.58353, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.584859, 55.70049), 4326)::geography, 7, false, 0, 4, 4, 1.5, 3464.0, 465.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (365, 361, 'Spacious 3-Bedroom Nørrebro Apartment for 8', 'This charming 3-bedroom Nørrebro apartment sleeps up to 8, blending modern comfort with warm Scandinavian touches. The living room features two cozy sofas and a daybed for extra guests, while upstairs bedrooms each offer double beds and skylights. Enjoy cooking in the fully equipped kitchen and dining together at the large table. With free Wi-Fi, fresh linens, and towels provided, it’s an ideal home for families or groups exploring Copenhagen.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '129 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.6906928, 12.5639958, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.565365, 55.690211), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 3, 4, 1.0, 2092.5, 722.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (366, 362, 'Close to the airport. Flat with private rooftop.', 'The apartment is 10 minutes from the airport with the metro. Enjoy a simple life with only 10 minutes to central Copenhagen. The apartment is close to the beach, restaurants, bakeries and grocery stores.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '83 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.66723, 12.62822, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.632237, 55.666819), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1350.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (367, 363, 'Taglejlighed 15 min fra centrum', 'Loft apartment in Nørrebro. Wooden beams and a cozy loft with stairs and a railing. Large bathroom with shower. Balcony where you can sit on the roof and have your coffee. 
The apartment has an open kitchen to the living room with a dining area and sloping walls. Open from the living room up to the loft, where 2 people can sleep, with stairs and a handrail. 

No elevator. 

Close to a café, bakery, restaurants, bus and metro. 10 minutes to the city center by bike. 

1) This is a no-smoking home.
2) Please do not wear shoes inside.
3) 1 bed.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '110 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.7004385, 12.552705, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.557688, 55.700229), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1659.4, 257.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (368, 364, 'City apartment', 'This unique home is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Valby', '71 Demo Street, Valby, Copenhagen', 55.66324, 12.519, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.517915, 55.658949), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1209.0, 259.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (369, 365, 'Grand Heritage next to park - 3 Bedrooms', 'Grand Heritage by the Royal Residence
Set in a stately building beside Churchill Park and just steps from Amalienborg Palace, Churchill Manor is a rare 170 m² apartment that blends historical elegance with playful modern eclecticism. 
The interiors burst with bright colors, bold details, and a confident mix of old and new—bringing vibrant energy into a grand, manor-like setting.

Occupying the entire first floor, the apartment features 3 stylish bedrooms and 1.5 bathrooms.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '107 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.68745, 12.59573, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.591213, 55.689454), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 3, 4, 1.5, 3982.0, 848.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (370, 366, 'Roligt værelse 2 km fra Rådhuspladsen', 'My place is good for couples, solo adventurers, and business travelers. the bed not so big and only for one person:)', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '18 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.692411, 12.5416439, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.539742, 55.694503), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 0, 2, 2.0, 418.0, 121.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (371, 367, 'Hyggelig lejlighed på Frederiksberg', 'Enjoy your time in a peaceful and centrally located home. Right by the M3 metro, cafes, restaurants, shopping, Frederiksberg Gardens and much more', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '16 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.68715, 12.53049, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.531636, 55.690168), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1447.25, 332.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (372, 368, 'Spacious 2 room apartment', 'Welcome to our centrally located Østerbro apartment near Langelinie, central Copenhagen, and Østerport station and metro. Enjoy strong WiFi, TV the living room, washer and dryer, a fully equipped kitchen, and a large bathroom. Explore the city''s attractions with ease from this convenient location. Experience Copenhagen in our welcoming and well-equipped apartment.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '179 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.69734, 12.59117, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.595387, 55.695944), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1319.33, 136.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (373, 369, 'Entire Apartment, big balcony.', 'Entire apartment with a big balcony in central Copenhagen

Lovely and newly renovated apartment in Amagerbro. 
The apartment has a big livingroom, a big bedroom, kitchen, bathroom and a sunny balcony.

The apartment has access to a big private backyard with grill.

The apartment has a TV with chromecast, unlimited Wifi and free parking

1 minute walk to groceries, restaurants, bars.

2 minute walk to bus and 7 minute walk to the metro.

10 minutes to the beach and 10 minutes to Kongens Nytorv.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '9 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.65626899999999, 12.610085, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.607244, 55.658026), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1050.0, 167.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (374, 370, '222m2 Penthouse på Christianshavn i København', 'Stay in the middle of beautiful, historic Christianshavn, with easy access to the metro and everything Copenhagen has to offer and tempt. 
This large and spacious penthouse apartment is located in one of Copenhagen''s most sought-after neighborhoods and has a fantastic location with a unique view over the Christianshavn Canal.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '102 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.6729178, 12.5908574, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.595552, 55.673575), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 3, 3, 1.0, 3100.33, 639.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (375, 371, 'Nørrebro St. apartment', 'Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place close to Nørrebro Metro and station. Remember - This is a private home before booking. Some of the pictures might be a bit outdated but only small changes to the home 💌🏠', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Bispebjerg', '35 Demo Street, Bispebjerg, Copenhagen', 55.70235, 12.53325, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.531063, 55.698388), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 1705.29, 508.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (376, 372, 'Superior Studio with Sofa Bed', 'These modern apartments in the newly built area of Stockholm are suitable for 4 adults and feature a fully equipped kitchen with a stove, microwave, fridge, electric kettle, coffee maker and a dining area. A comfortable seating area with a flat-screen TV and French balcony. A tiled bathroom with a shower. 

Garage parking is available for a fee.
A baby crib can be provided for a fee.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '11 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.301509857177734, 18.10618019104004, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.107867, 59.301119), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1209.6, 203.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (377, 373, 'Charming 4-bedroom apt Sthlm City', 'Gourgeous apt 5 min walking distance from Central Station/Express train to Arlanda airport/Metro. 
Close to all that happens in Stockholm - still calm area. 
160 m². Huge kitchen, 2 bathrooms (shower/tub), 2 WC. 
4 bedrooms. Free Internet.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '83 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.33725, 18.05207, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.052836, 59.34163), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 4, 5, 2.0, 4323.83, 1500.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (378, 374, 'Cozy apartment at prime location in Old Town', 'A unique apartment in the heart of Stockholm’s Old Town. Located in a peaceful area just steps from the lively Stora Nygatan, this apartment offers the perfect balance of tranquility and convenience. Set in a 15th-century building, the home blends historic charm with modern design. Beautifully decorated, it features views of the German Church and provides a memorable stay for families, business travelers, or a city getaway.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '111 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32364, 18.07088, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.075221, 59.325464), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 2228.2, 573.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (379, 375, 'Large One Bedroom Apartment', 'Welcome to our spacious one-bedroom apartment nestled in the heart of Old Town Stockholm!

This serviced apartment offers ample space and can accommodate comfortably up to 5 guests. Whether you''re traveling with family or friends, there''s plenty of room for everyone to unwind after a day of exploring.

The sitting area is generously sized, making it the perfect spot to gather and share your impressions from the day''s adventures.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '36 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32492, 18.06846, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.067599, 59.32769), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 1, 3, 1.0, 1868.58, 352.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (380, 376, 'Shared 6 Bed Female Dorm Room', 'Emil Emil Gärdet is a premium hostel for backpackers and travelers. Your quiet, comfortable oasis, just a step away from the city buzz.

The hostel was just renovated in the Scandinavian nomad design style theme, so everything is brand new and fresh.

Each room has a private bathroom.

All the beds come with privacy curtains, shelve, lamp and electrical plugs.

The hostel is perfect for groups large and small, with a nice mix of 6-bed and private and family rooms.', 'shared_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Östermalms', '113 Demo Street, Östermalms, Stockholm', 59.34315, 18.11275, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.111443, 59.34157), 4326)::geography, 12, false, 0, 1, 6, 2.0, 599.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (381, 375, '2 Bedroom Apartment', 'Welcome to our cozy 2 Bedroom Apartment in Old Town Stockholm!

Discover a blend of modern style and historic charm as you step into our inviting retreat. With two bedrooms, it''s ideal for a relaxing getaway.

Situated in the heart of Old Town, you''ll find yourself amidst cobblestone streets, quaint cafes, and famous landmarks. Immerse yourself in the neighborhood''s rich history and lively atmosphere.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '30 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32492, 18.06846, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.065279, 59.32295), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 1, 1, 0.0, 2377.9, 554.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (382, 377, 'Modern lägenhet vid vattnet', 'Welcome to our spacious and modern apartment in the heart of Stockholm, at Liljeholmen!

Our apartment is perfect for those looking for comfortable and stylish accommodation in the city. With generous spaces and a modern decor, we offer everything you need for a fabulous stay.

Liljeholmen is a cozy area with a wide range of restaurants, shops and green spaces. With proximity to the subway, commuter trains and buses, it''s easy to get around and discover all that Stockholm has to offer.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '129 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.3068, 18.02587, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.032394, 59.307848), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 4, 1.0, 4655.67, 1265.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (383, 378, 'Unikt läge i Stockholm! Lugnt och nära till allt!', 'Spacious and stylish four-room apartment on the nicest part of Kungsholmen. Fully equipped with three bedrooms (up to 5 sleeping places) and two toilets. Child-friendly floor and quiet lush area with close proximity to water, cafes and restaurants. Walking distances from Stockholm''s central shopping streets and sights. Opposite is one of Stockholm''s best-stocked cheese and delicatessen stores, and around the corner are fruit and meat stores.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '41 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.3298, 18.04492, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.043329, 59.328091), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 3, 4, 1.5, 6566.0, 1980.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (384, 379, 'Sunlit Apartment near Södermalm | Calm & Minimal', 'Stylish Scandinavian apartment 1 min from Midsommarkransen metro and 10 mins to Södermalm. Open kitchen, calm bedroom, modern bathroom, and a single loft bed (150cm height) for a child. Enjoy local favourites Café AB, Tre Vänner, Gaia, 800 Grader Pizza and Un Pezzo. just steps away. Ideal for couples or small families wanting comfort and great city access.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '72 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.30174862600592, 18.011038899421692, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.005542, 59.301148), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 2592.0, 493.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (385, 380, 'Fräscht rum i lägenheten vid Gullmarsplan!', 'Private room in our apartment at Gullmarsplan. 2 min to subway, 13 min walk to Avicii Arena and Tele 2 Arena. 10 min to Stockholm Central by public transport. Close to shops, bars and service. Welcome to Erik and Kristofer!

Own room in out apartment at Gullmarsplan, Stockholm. 2 min walk from the subway, 13 min walk to Avicii Arena and Tele 2 Arena. 15 min by subway to Stockholm Central. Close to shops, bars, restaurants and service. Erik and Kristofer wish you welcome!', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '1 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.2979577, 18.0839638, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.092075, 59.299524), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 891.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (386, 381, 'Mysig villalägenhet i Bromma, 19min till City.', 'The space
The larger room is bedroom /livingroom. Large smart-TV, large sofa and a sofa-bed (140cm). Kitchen includes a table with 4 chairs. One bathroom with a shower and a toilet. If you need a working place (small table and a chair) - please ask and we´ll it there for you.

Guest access
The apartment is a part of a villa with a separate entrance. You enter a hall, then a cosy living room/bedroom with large sofa, double bed 140 cm, wardrobe and a large TV. The nice kitchen has got room for 4 people, fridge, freezer, micro/oven. The apartment has a nice bathroom with WC and shower. We will be near by if you need our assistance, kitchen tools, toys...', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Bromma', '136 Demo Street, Bromma, Stockholm', 59.3238403, 17.9375234, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.942262, 59.321526), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 1328.0, 346.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (387, 382, 'Twin Room - No Window @ Stockholm Hostel', 'Stockholm Hostel is an Airbnb hostel that offers accommodation in private rooms with private shower and toilet. There''s also a shared kitchen where guests can cook with other guests. Bed linens and towels are included in the price.

This windowless room features free WiFi, a flat-screen TV as well as an en-suite shower with a hair-dryer available. 
Bedding and towels are included. For your comfort, bring your own shampoo and shower gel.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '93 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.33497, 18.03206, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.033954, 59.333922), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 0.0, 909.0, 158.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (388, 383, 'Mysig 4-rumslägenhet i hjärtat av Vasastan, 100 m2', 'Charming turn-of-the-century apartment nicely located on a quiet street in lovely Vasastan, neighboring restaurants, bars and overlooking a cozy park. Subway, commuter trains and buses are just around the corner.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '40 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.3440934915735, 18.04124351163942, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.042167, 59.343231), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 3, 3, 1.5, 3701.2, 919.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (389, 384, 'Own room in 2-bedroom flat', 'Flat in charming area 10 min from the city centre. good transport; busor train.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '39 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.30232, 18.04689, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.044359, 59.299944), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 782.0, 166.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (390, 385, 'One bedroom apartment, in trendy Södermalm', 'Welcome to live like a local in this modern Södermalm apartment. Perfect for a couple or a small group traveling together. 

Lots of restaurants and shops in the neighborhood and walking distance to many of Stockholm''s top attractions.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '110 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31344, 18.07598, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.069519, 59.314434), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 1, 4, 1.0, 2317.0, 264.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (391, 386, 'Light-Filled Apartment Overlooking Hornstull', 'Welcome to a bright apartment with beautiful views over Hornstull! Perfect for couples, families, or small groups who want to stay in one of Stockholm’s most vibrant neighborhoods.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '120 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.315, 18.03249, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.040359, 59.314219), 4326)::geography, 7, false, 0, 1, 6, 1.0, 3222.2, 367.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (392, 387, 'spacious renovated 4 room apartment', 'The flat is situated the center of Stockholm on the island called Södermalm very close to many restaurants and bars as well as beatiful nature.The flat has spacious living room/ kitchen area, master bedroom and 2 smaller bedroom, 2 wc.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '152 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31723, 18.03132, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.036158, 59.316182), 4326)::geography, 6, true, 2, 3, 6, 3.0, 3222.33, 681.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (393, 388, 'Cosy apartment in the heart of Old Town, Stockholm', 'Stay in a gem from 1556 in Stockholm’s Old Town, just 50 m from vibrant Västerlånggatan. This cozy ground-floor apartment features charming wooden beams, new hardwood floors, and centuries of character. Low light creates a warm, intimate atmosphere - perfect for relaxing after exploring nearby cafés, shops, and landmarks. A unique, romantic escape in the heart of Gamla Stan.

Do not hesitate to contact me if you have any questions about the apartment or Gamla Stan in general.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '132 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32356, 18.06786, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.072653, 59.324186), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1653.0, 182.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
