Best suited to a solo guest staying minimum 18 days or longer, especially someone looking for a calm, home-like, shared stay.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '112 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31691, 18.06119, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.060609, 59.312769), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 639.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (402, 396, 'Trädgårdsvillan', 'A family-friendly villa in the middle of Älvsjö''s cozy villa idyll. Here you will find everything you can imagine for a lovely vacation relaxation such as a swimming pool, greenhouse, cultivation, lovely patios for dinners and barbecue evenings. Centrally located within walking distance to Älvsjö train station, only 10 minutes to Stockholm City. As well as walking distance to forest and swimming lake, cafes and good restaurants.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Älvsjö', '84 Demo Street, Älvsjö, Stockholm', 59.27258, 17.98986, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.991762, 59.270793), 4326)::geography, 5, true, 2, 4, 4, 2.0, 2945.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
