(10 minutes to Södermalm and 15 minutes to T-centralen
and Old Town).', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Farsta', '169 Demo Street, Farsta, Stockholm', 59.27551, 18.07335, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.075523, 59.276113), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.5, 1100.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
