Welcome to our bright and charming apartment at Rudammen – just 7 minutes from Östermalm, Odenplan and central Stockholm! Here you live in one of the city''s most sought-after areas, with both pulse and tranquility right at your doorstep. Kungliga Djurgården is just around the corner, Hagaparken is 10 minutes away, and several lakes and swimming areas are quickly accessible.

Stay comfortably in Stockholm''s best location!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Östermalms', '9 Demo Street, Östermalms, Stockholm', 59.35463, 18.05879, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.061432, 59.35123), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 3, 1.0, 1611.5, 436.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
