  (407, 400, 'Central Stockholm – where the locals want to live', 'A nice and cozy private room with a big comfortable bed and a balcony in one of Stockholm’s most vibrant and sought-after neighborhoods. Surrounded by green parks, and just steps away from buzzing city life. Scenic streets with waterfront views and ferry connections nearby.
Excellent public transport: bus stop right outside, several central bus lines within a few minutes’ walk, and subway about 10 minutes away.
Friendly, large and well behaved dog is living in the apartment.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '124 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31236850924967, 18.095303624328597, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.096201, 59.313448), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 0.5, 646.0, 82.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
