  (410, 403, 'Beautiful twin room with private bathroom', 'Enjoy easy access to popular shops and restaurants from this charming place to stay.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '164 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31823, 18.05816, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.064324, 59.320762), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 833.0, 195.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (411, 404, 'Elegant Apartment in Stockholm City', 'Welcome to this stylish apartment located in the heart of Kungsholmen. Enjoy a peaceful and attractive neighborhood with easy access to restaurants, cafés, shops, and beautiful waterfront walking paths. The apartment features a fully equipped kitchen, a comfortable bedroom, a modern bathroom, and a bright living room. Excellent public transportation connections make it easy to explore Stockholm. Perfect for both business travelers and vacation guests.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '76 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.33181227832483, 18.015302941203117, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.016089, 59.329468), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1906.0, 330.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (412, 394, 'Two-Story Comfort in Prime Location', 'Located in the heart of Östermalm—Stockholm’s most elegant and central neighborhood—this spacious two-story apartment offers the perfect base for your stay. Enjoy charming streets, beautiful architecture, and walking distance to Strandvägen, Djurgården, top restaurants, cafés, and shops. With excellent public transport nearby, you’ll have the whole city within easy reach.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Östermalms', '110 Demo Street, Östermalms, Stockholm', 59.33205, 18.08248, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.075363, 59.33149), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 2, 5, 3.0, 4704.5, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (413, 405, 'Sleek studio w/ balcony in new building', 'Enjoy contemporary living in this sleek studio, part of a modern residential building completed in 2022. Situated just north of central Stockholm, the location offers easy access to both the Karolinska University Hospital and the lush surroundings of Hagaparken. Whether you''re looking to relax in nature or stay close to the city, it’s a well-placed spot. 

Spend sunny afternoons on the balcony, or visit Boulebar Haga nearby for casual drinks and a round of pétanque.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '130 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.34822, 18.0382, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.033064, 59.348358), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 0, 2, 1.0, 2307.5, 584.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (414, 406, 'Private bunk bed room with a toilet', 'Nomad City Hostel is in the immediate city center, just a five minutes’ walk across the bridge from the central station, close to everything.

The hostel reception is in the Nomad City Bar, right next to the hostel. The bar is open only for the guests of the Nomad Hostels and hosts pub nights, karaoke nights and other events for our guests regularly.

The hostel is perfect for anyone who wants to experience Stockholm’s city life being in the middle of where everything happens.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '172 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.33208, 18.04729, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.045742, 59.333324), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 3.0, 810.0, 224.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (415, 407, 'Central Mysig lägenhet', 'Forget your worries in this spacious and serene space.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '145 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.29671, 18.04934, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.050098, 59.298311), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 3325.0, 976.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (416, 408, 'Big Villa Room Near Stockholm City (Free Parking)', 'Welcome to our cozy private room in a peaceful villa, perfect for up to 2 guests. Only 2 guest allowed Enjoy a clean bathroom, free parking, high-speed Wi-Fi, and a warm, family-friendly atmosphere. Located just minutes from central Stockholm with easy access by metro. Close to Avicii Arena (Globen),Stockholmsmässan Stockholm city attractions, and Karolinska University making it ideal for tourists, business travelers, conferences, seminars,host live downstairs portion and this room is upstairs', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '77 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.2797995, 18.039649, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.047106, 59.280363), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 725.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (417, 409, 'Gamla Stan Town House', 'This Airbnb is located in the heart of the Old Town of Stockholm, just a stone''s throw from charming restaurants and exciting attractions. The accommodation is housed in a beautiful old house with a unique atmosphere. With five bedrooms and three bathrooms, there is plenty of room for a large group or family to relax and enjoy the city. The proximity to Old Town''s charming alleys and historic sites makes it a perfect place to explore the city from. In addition, it is just a stone''s throw from the royal castle.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '111 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32578179999999, 18.0740272, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.077579, 59.325811), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 5, 5, 3.0, 5478.0, 1406.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (418, 410, 'Duplex apartment in serene area', 'Duplex apartment situated in a serene and calm archipelago-like neighborhood. The apartment offers two balconies and direct access to a garden and own private entrance. Inside, you''ll find a renovated kitchen, two bathrooms, three bedrooms and a open floor plan that connects bright and spacious social areas. Enjoy the perfect blend of modern comfort and a tranquil atmosphere.

Good transport to city center, close to convenience store, swimming area, coffee shops and a Italian bistro. 

Welcome!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '46 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.32037, 17.98623, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.991305, 59.320295), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 3, 3, 2.0, 4336.5, 850.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (419, 411, 'House with garden in lovely Enskede', 'Located in trendy Hornstull, close to swimming areas, fantastic sea, playgrounds, green areas, bars, restaurants and plenty of cafés. Everything in Stockholm is within reach, either by foot or public transport. Children and grown-up people-friendly!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Farsta', '157 Demo Street, Farsta, Stockholm', 59.26879, 18.07823, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.078899, 59.264594), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 4, 4, 2.0, 3233.5, 849.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (420, 412, 'Central, mysig lägenhet med balkong', 'You can easily get to everything from this perfectly located accommodation. Skärmarbrink subway station is just outside the house and you can get to the south in 5 minutes or to the central station in 10. Walking distance to Avicii arena, hovet, annexet, fryshuset and slakthusområdet so perfect if you''re going to a concert! 
Bedroom with large double bed and sofa bed that can be extended to another double bed, toilet and kitchen fully equipped and large smart TV if it''s a cozy home evening!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Skarpnäcks', '104 Demo Street, Skarpnäcks, Stockholm', 59.29621083923831, 18.08951253016359, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.087537, 59.295609), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 1, 2, 1.0, 837.15, 272.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (421, 413, 'Nice apartment in Stockholm', '3 room and kitchen, bright, open and located a few steps from the lake Mälaren and the natural tight around the corner, close to the subway (10 minutes to Stockholm City). Several grocery stores around but also some bistros! Free Wifi.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '171 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.30449, 17.96172, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.955645, 59.306398), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 1609.5, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (422, 414, 'Cozy Private Room near Kista Metro Private Toilet', 'Bright and comfortable private room in our spacious apartment, just a 5–10 minute walk from Kista Metro Station. 

Kista Galleria, with restaurants, cafés, supermarkets, pharmacies, and shops.

Arlanda Airport is about 30 minutes away by car. 

Guests have a private toilet, access to the shared shower and kitchen. 

We are committed to providing a clean, comfortable, and welcoming stay.

Easy access to central Stockholm by metro in about 18 minutes.

We look forward to hosting you!', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Rinkeby-Tensta', '7 Demo Street, Rinkeby-Tensta, Stockholm', 59.40088, 17.94141, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.943025, 59.398363), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1253.0, 189.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (423, 415, 'Amazing, child friendly house with large garden', 'Beautiful house, in a totally quiet and safe area. Free parking just beside the house. 2min to Tele2 Arena/Avicii Arena. 5min to the Fairs, 10min to citycentre. 5min walk to the metro. Family friendly. Sunny garden and loads of toys for kids. There is a swing in the garden, summer time. For older kids there is a XBOX in the basement room with lots of games. Again very welcome,', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '62 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.28009, 18.06047, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.057598, 59.278828), 4326)::geography, 6, true, 2, 3, 3, 2.0, 8000.0, 1872.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (424, 416, 'Walking distance to commuter train. 10 min 2 city.', 'Private entrance and room in basement. Low ceiling height, max 1,8 meters. Private bathroom. Shared laundry in basement. Small pentry (partly shared, we will cross by) with fridge, stove and microwave (no oven).
We live upstairs and if you are easily disturbed by noises we recommend earplugs just in case. We charge no cleaning fee but expect in return you leave the place (almost) as you found it. Supermarkets very close nearby as well as take-aways and restaurants. We have cats (3).', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Älvsjö', '148 Demo Street, Älvsjö, Stockholm', 59.27694, 18.00316, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.994585, 59.276915), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 456.6, 118.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (425, 417, 'A bedroom in the heart of Söder.', 'Center in the middle of Söder. You can basically walk the entire city from my place plus busses, train station, restaurant are pretty near here. 

Note: 
. it’s a share room. 
. It’s my home where I live so don’t get an idea that you rent the whole apartment without no human lives here. 
. No cooking in the kitchen! But are allowed to use the utilities otherwise.', 'shared_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '116 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31611, 18.0623, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.066362, 59.312574), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.5, 1373.0, 177.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (426, 418, 'Studio at amazing location', 'A lovely apartment with a fantastic location close to Östermalm, Grocery store just across the street and subway station right outside. With high-speed internet and a fully equipped kitchen. Linens and towels are of course provided, . You''re also conveniently close to a nice grocery store, restaurants, cafés, and shops.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Östermalms', '101 Demo Street, Östermalms, Stockholm', 59.34611, 18.10002, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.099991, 59.347014), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1060.43, 359.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (427, 419, 'Cosy flat in quiet area, center of Stockholm.', 'The apartment is located in a quiet environment in Vasastan in central Stockholm, 15 minutes'' walk from the city. Adjacent are parks, proximity to grocery store, pharmacy, and restaurants. 

The room you rent is 1 of the 4 rooms in the home and is located in the farthest part of the home, so you will live undisturbed. The room faces the courtyard and is undisturbed from traffic. 

You also have access to the room next door where you have an armchair, desk and space to put your luggage. 

Breakfast is included on the 1st day.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '57 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.33818, 18.05039, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.047825, 59.337745), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 3, 1.0, 836.0, 259.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (428, 420, 'Garden City House', 'This is our home. A charming house in a beautiful garden area. Close to the subway, grocery stores, restaurants, Globen Avicii Arena and Tele2 Arena. 5 beds, 3 toilets and 1 bathroom with sauna (not during summer time Jun-Aug.)', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '109 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.2812576, 18.0857395, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.077133, 59.280567), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 3, 5, 1.5, 3461.5, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (429, 421, 'Litet rum nära Årsta, Gullmarsplan, Globen .', 'You''ll have a great time at this comfortable place to stay. Close to Årsta city center, Gullmarsplan, Södermalm, Årstaberg, Tvärbanna, Commuter train and Subway. Close to "Valla torg" station. Large room with desk and wardrobe. Wi-Fi and kitchen are available. Washing machine available. Bed linen and towel included. Kitchen and bathroom are shared with other guests. The room has a lock. 2 minutes from grocery store and several restaurants. Good communication to central Stockholm.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '84 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.29604, 18.05486, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.049702, 59.293025), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 435.8, 54.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (430, 422, 'Attefallshus', 'Attefallshus of 25 sqm + sleeping loft. Complete kitchen with oven, microwave, dishwasher, fridge/freezer and induction hob. Toilet/shower with washing machine. Sleeping loft with a single bed. Living room with sofa bed, TV and dining area. Wood deck outside the entrance.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hässelby-Vällingby', '90 Demo Street, Hässelby-Vällingby, Stockholm', 59.37758, 17.82053, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.823451, 59.377624), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 752.5, 80.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (431, 418, 'Modern & fully furnished studio', 'Modern fully furnished studio with all ameneties in Telefonplan - only 13 minutes from Stockholm city center. The studio has its own modern kitchenette and bathroom with washer and dryer. 

There is one single bed (90cm) and a sofa in the studio. The flat is 25sqm. 

To fully explore the area the apartments comes with a city bike free to use during your stay. 

The area has cafes, supermarkets, public parking and restaurants within walking distance.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '97 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.29786, 17.99765, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.00379, 59.30045), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 0, 1, 1.0, 795.67, 151.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (432, 423, 'Lakeview Villa Hot tub & Grand Piano. Sleeps 10+3', 'California-inspired luxury villa by Stockholm’s Lake Mälaren, fitting 12-15 (Note! Please read below for details). Enjoy stunning lake views, a private hot tub, and a creative space with a grand piano, and rare guitars. Great for families and musicians, with fast WiFi, a large premium kitchen, and city access. Feel the warmth and inspiration in this California-inspired home!

Normal beds sleep 12.
Sofa bed in one of the bedrooms: +2.
Penthouse (Must be booked separately): +3', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Bromma', '92 Demo Street, Bromma, Stockholm', 59.3202817, 17.9408394, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.93971, 59.319301), 4326)::geography, 15, false, 0, 5, 8, 2.0, 14745.0, 2874.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (433, 424, 'Big cosy room in Odenplan. Close to everything.', 'Welcome to rent this big cosy room (30 sq.m) on the 4th floor (no elevator) in the city centre of Stockholm.

Close to everything:
200 m Shopping areas
5 min (walk) Central station
300 m Airport buses to Arlanda
15 min (walk) Royal park Haga
15 min (walk) Old Town

Restaurants, coffee shops and metro station are around the corner.

The bed is 140 cm.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '176 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.33995, 18.0484, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.051021, 59.340551), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1684.0, 414.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (434, 425, 'Design apartment by the water', 'Discover our cozy apartment in Kungsholmen, perfect for couples and small families. 
Centrally located yet nestled in nature, this full apartment features 2 bedrooms, 2 toilets, a fully equipped kitchen, and a serene balcony with green views. 
Enjoy easy access to the central station and metro lines, all while being steps away from a charming lakeside walk. 
Experience the perfect mix of city convenience and natural tranquility. Book now for a memorable stay!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '141 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.33741, 18.02538, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.022826, 59.338464), 4326)::geography, 4, true, 2, 2, 2, 1.5, 3683.6, 410.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (435, 426, 'Wevio Stockholm Garden home | King Bed, Sleeps 4', 'Cosy cottage style rowhouse, conviently located with easy commuting to Stockholm city. Independent check-in and check-out! The area is very peaceful and family friendly, it sits on the edge of huge nature reserve and in the vicinity there are small forests, parks, a great urban village with mini golf, café, plunge pool for kids and superb free outdoor gym!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Rinkeby-Tensta', '70 Demo Street, Rinkeby-Tensta, Stockholm', 59.41336, 17.90313, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.90976, 59.414265), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 2007.6, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (436, 427, 'Unique cellar unit in Old Town w/ private entrance', 'Interested in Old Town? Picture yourself waking up in this rather unique abode in a historic building just off the district''s main street. Located in one of the iconic alleys of Old Town with your own private entrance, it''s like you''ve traveled back to medieval times. Perfect for couples on weekend visits.

Just around the corner you''ll find top attractions like the Royal Castle and the Nobel Prize Museum.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '1 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32583, 18.07486, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.082962, 59.326387), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 2181.54, 317.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (437, 382, 'Classic Twin Room in Stockholm City', 'Stockholm Hostel is an Airbnb hostel that offers accommodation in private rooms with private shower and toilet. There''s also a shared kitchen where guests can cook with other guests. Bed linens and towels are included in the price. There is also a hairdryer and hand soap in the room.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '179 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.33524, 18.02982, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.037989, 59.334553), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 0.0, 1009.0, 118.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (438, 428, 'Cozy apt, idyllic neighbourhood and 3min to subway', 'In the trendy Midsommarkransen, you find this charming apartment of 40 sqm with a dining area.

The apartment is in very good condition, with newly renovated tiled bathroom, French balcony, good light emitting, original wood flooring.

Stay in a peaceful and undisturbed idyllic neighborhood with small town feel, yet at short distances and great communications to the city. Just around the corner there are cozy boutiques, restaurants, grocery store and 1 minute walk to the metro Midsommarkransen.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '179 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.29986, 18.01318, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.015997, 59.301503), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1074.0, 161.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (439, 429, 'Retro city apartment in the heart of the old town', 'Retro apartment in the absolute center of Old Town. Interior that combines 400-year-old woodwork with modern design.

The neighbors around the corner include the Royal Palace, the Nobel Museum and lots of extraordinary restaurants and bars.

Here you get absolutely the most out of your stay in Stockholm. Suitable for families, business trips or an exclusive stay alone!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '75 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.3245, 18.07311, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.070607, 59.323978), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.5, 1368.5, 210.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (440, 430, 'Spacious house with panoramic view of Lake Mälaren', 'Spacious 8-bed house with panoramic view over Lake Mälaren and Stockholm. Situated 130 m from the lake and 15 min with subway from Stockholm City and with an idyllic garden directly adjacent to the woods, this is the ideal place for one or several families. From the pier 400 m away, ferries depart to Stockholm city and to the Castle Drottningholm. Lots of excursions to do in the neighbouring natural reserve area or along the lake.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '136 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.30135, 17.94566, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.947378, 59.303951), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 4, 5, 2.0, 5395.5, 1113.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (441, 418, 'Comfy studio at Telefonplan', 'Cozy little apartment with a nice kitchen. Excellent location, slose to restaurants, shops and Subway station', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '63 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.2989731, 17.9970139, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.995482, 59.295565), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 0, 1, 1.0, 1010.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (442, 431, 'Artistic & light 2 room apartment in SoFo, 65sqm', 'The apartment is on the 1st floor in a beautiful building from 1880 situated in the heart of the trendy area called SoFo at Södermalm. It is a large, light, airy and very stylish 2 room apartment with all the rooms facing a wonderful park giving you a nice view to look at and great privacy. The apartment can easily and very comfortably host 2 guests. The area is one of the popular places in Stockholm with a great variaty of restaurants, bars, cafees and shops.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '162 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31458, 18.08008, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.082769, 59.312339), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.5, 2000.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (443, 432, 'Trevligt och centralt minihus, nära Älvsjömässan.', 'Welcome to a detached mini-house located in Älvsjö. From here, you have walking distance to the Älvsjö Fair and to buses and commuter trains that take you into Stockholm city in ten minutes. 

The house is furnished with a 120 cm bed. Kitchenette with stove, microwave and refrigerator. Basic kitchen equipment/porcelain. Toilet/shower. 

There is access to a washing machine during longer stays, by agreement.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '135 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.27082, 18.02197, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.025377, 59.268245), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 805.5, 100.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (444, 433, 'Taklägenhet med stor balkong', 'Very centrally located penthouse apartment in exclusive Lärkstan in Östermalm/Vasastan. Just a three-minute walk to the subway, and you''ll find plenty of buses right around the corner.

This is like a secret oasis at the top of the house. Only 15-20 minutes walk to central Stockholm through cozy residential area and the centrally located park Humlegården. Many restaurants and cafes around the corner.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Östermalms', '110 Demo Street, Östermalms, Stockholm', 59.34573469999999, 18.0688009, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.074793, 59.348173), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 2, 2, 1.0, 3043.33, 721.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (445, 394, 'Bright Flat w/ Balcony in Quiet, Central District', 'Make the most of your Stockholm stay from this bright and homey apartment. Located in an upscale, peaceful neighborhood, it’s the ideal starting point for city adventures and relaxed strolls through nearby green fields. With excellent public transport connections, you’re never far from cultural landmarks, waterfront promenades, and vibrant shopping streets. Whether you''re visiting for work or a weekend getaway, this apartment offers the perfect mix of comfort and convenience.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Östermalms', '68 Demo Street, Östermalms, Stockholm', 59.34583, 18.09532, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.098586, 59.34925), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 2949.97, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (446, 434, 'Tyst och nära till centrala Stockholm och skogen', 'Here you live in a quiet room in a quiet and safe area, with the public transports you get into central Stockholm in just 20 minutes. In the neighborhood, there are several grocery stores, cozy cafes and restaurants. The area also borders the appreciated outdoor area Nackareservatet. 

The host is a high school teacher and is not home often. You have free access to the kitchen, kitchen equipment and washing machine. If you come by car, you can park for free a bit away.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Skarpnäcks', '129 Demo Street, Skarpnäcks, Stockholm', 59.26644, 18.13284, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.135713, 59.267075), 4326)::geography, 1, true, 2, 1, 1, 0.5, 657.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (447, 435, 'Long stay rental in the heart of Stockholm', 'Nice Cozy place with great Location !', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '44 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.34182, 18.04786, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.044312, 59.342829), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 859.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (448, 436, 'Unique homestay, close to sub and beautiful nature', 'My place is next to a Nature Reserve (Rågsveds Nature Reserve), close to public transport, parks, art and culture and Rågsved''s city center. You''ll love my place because it''s homey, has a comfy bed, is bright, has a garden and nice people live there. My place is good for couples, solo adventurers, business travelers, and families (with kids).', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '81 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.25047, 18.02749, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.028547, 59.252775), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.5, 360.0, 38.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (449, 437, 'Room in Hagsätra, Stockholm', 'Room for rent in a cozy apartment in Hagsätra, Stockholm . Located in a quiet area. Close to public transport and shops. Five minute walk to Hagsätra metro station. Twelve minutes to Älvsjö commuter train station by bus.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '109 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.26506, 18.01873, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.016858, 59.265851), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 0.5, 414.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (450, 438, 'Modern villa nära city och bad', 'Modern villa with four bedrooms and large open living room, kitchen and patio in a south-facing location with a natural plot in beautiful Mälarhöjden near the city, swimming area and nature. Newly renovated to a high standard. Large bathroom with sauna, shower and bathtub. 

Entry floor
Bedroom with 160 cm bed and workplace
Bathrooms

2nd floor
Bedroom with 210x210 bed, TV
Bedroom with 180 cm bed
Bedroom with 120 cm bed, space for extra bed
Toilet
Kitchen
Living room, 55" TV, large sofa, dining area

Other
WiFi 1000 mbit, three parking spaces. Contact us for more info', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '9 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.30056, 17.94617, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.953814, 59.299869), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 4, 4, 1.5, 5400.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01')
) AS v(id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city, neighborhood, address, latitude,
  longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms,
  price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
JOIN cities c ON c.name = v.city;

INSERT INTO listings (id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city_id, neighborhood, address,
  latitude, longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds,
  bathrooms, price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE
SELECT v.id, v.host_id, v.title, v.description, v.property_type, c.id, v.neighborhood, v.address,
  v.latitude, v.longitude, v.public_location, v.max_guests, v.pets_allowed, v.max_pets, v.bedrooms,
  v.beds, v.bathrooms, v.price_per_night, v.cleaning_fee, v.currency, v.created_at::timestamptz
FROM (VALUES
  (451, 439, '#17 Studiolägenhet utan fönster(no window)', 'Niro Hotel Apartments offers studio apartments on Fridhemsplan in central Stockholm with kitchenettes and spacious bathrooms and equipped kitchenettes for cooking. In addition to Swedish and international TV channels, we also offer Chromecast so you can easily connect Netflix and Spotify to your TV. Niro Hotel Apartments is a semi-automated apart-hotel where our basic idea is that you should not have to pay for anything other than your accommodation. However, we are always a call or email away if you need any help!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '25 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.3343, 18.02556, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.021902, 59.333032), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1061.22, 119.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (452, 440, 'Spacious apartment in cent. Stockholm w terrace', 'Artistic and spacious two-room apartment with private patio, in the center of Stockholm. Close to both the city''s pulse and municipal transportation such as buses, commuter trains and subway. Some of the city''s best restaurants are just a few minutes'' walk from the apartment!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '54 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.34348, 18.0455, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.044812, 59.341873), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.5, 3661.33, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (453, 389, 'Cozy newly renovated studio', 'This newly renovated 20 SQM single studio is located in between the Old Town and the vibrant district of Södermalm. The apartment offers free Wi-Fi, a flat-screen TV and a fully equipped kitchenette. You live just a minute from restaurants, shops and public transport. The apartment are located in a building from the 1650s. The apartment have high ceiling and stucco. There is also a bar table and a modern bathroom with a shower.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '97 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.319, 18.07042, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.073136, 59.319636), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1455.67, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (454, 382, 'Classic Twin Room Private located in Kungsholmen', 'Stockholm Hostel is an Airbnb hostel that offers accommodation in private rooms with private shower and toilet. There''s also a shared kitchen where guests can cook with other guests. Bed linens and towels are included in the price. There is also a hairdryer and hand soap in the room.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '86 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.33507, 18.03169, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.029688, 59.333621), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 979.5, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (455, 441, 'Independent Cozy apartment in husby', 'Independent apartment: fitted kitchen with basic cooking facilities, microwave, fridge, hot water kettle, egg cooker, slow cooker, capsule coffee maker. 
cozy room with blanket,table fan,heater, air cooler,Tv chrome-cast
A dedicated work station.
A tiled bathroom with shower.
Cutlery and crockery provided. So are the basics oil, salt, pepper and sugar.
Shared Laundry once a week for free for booking more than a week along with washing liquid and comfort.For below a week at 100sek.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Rinkeby-Tensta', '77 Demo Street, Rinkeby-Tensta, Stockholm', 59.41274753477256, 17.923999205231667, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.923985, 59.410756), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1458.5, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (456, 442, 'Live close to the royal castle', 'In the center of Stockholm you get to experience calmness in one of the nicest neighborhoods there is. The cozy flat is located close to amazing restaurants, nature, city lights and shopping. You never get bored of Östermalm and Stockholm!', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Östermalms', '14 Demo Street, Östermalms, Stockholm', 59.33574, 18.08207, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.086827, 59.33547), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1042.4, 238.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (457, 394, 'Scandinavian Gem in the heart of SoFo', 'Elias is solely responsible for offering this listing on Airbnb, and they host as a business. For more legal information, visit our Help Center.

Business name: Guestit AB
Business registry: Swedish Trade and Industry Register
Registration number: 5591192678
Email: guest@guestit.se
Phone: +46 8 35 65 64
Address: Lützengatan 12A, 115 20, Östermalm, Sweden
To help protect yourself from fraud, always use Airbnb to send money and communicate with hosts.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '172 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31239, 18.07781, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.079194, 59.310024), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 3554.7, 672.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (458, 418, 'Nice studio at Telefonplan', 'Modern fully furnished studio with all ameneties at Telefonplan - only 1 minutes walk from the Subway and 13 min from Stockholm city center. The studio has its own modern kitchen and there is a supermarket in the same block

The area has cafes, supermarkets, public parking and restaurants within walking distance.

The studio has one large single bed, 120 cm.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '93 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.2989731, 17.9970139, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.992623, 59.297045), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 0, 1, 1.0, 772.33, 131.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (459, 443, 'Cozy one room apartment at Södermalm', '"Feel at home in Stockholm"
Central location in the middle of Stockholm on Södermalm. A perfect base for day and evening activities.
Here you are close to bars, restaurants, parks, beaches, museums, galleries, boutiques and shops. The best Stockholm Island to live on!

P.S. DEAR GUESTS IF YOU NEED WASHING MACHINE PLEASE LET US KNOW IN ADVANCE THAT WE COULD LEAVE KEY AND INSTRUCTIONS.
P.S. WASHING MACHINES ARE AT COMMON LAUNDRY ROOMS IN BUILDING', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '86 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31424, 18.06227, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.067177, 59.31059), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1700.0, 594.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (460, 427, 'Cozy studio in charming suburb', NULL, 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Skarpnäcks', '64 Demo Street, Skarpnäcks, Stockholm', 59.27866, 18.1278, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.134016, 59.275688), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 0, 2, 1.0, 1075.9, 349.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (461, 444, 'Stylish apartment in the heart of Södermalm.', 'This cozy, luxuries and amazing apartment is located in the heart of södermalm, an area that has a relaxed, creative vibe, with artsy shops and cafe''s and with only a two minute walk to the underground station giving you easy access to the whole of Stockholm. The apartment itself is open plan with a modern sense of style. It consists of one kitchen filled with plenty of space, perfect for food lovers, a bathroom, a bedroom with a balcony and a cosy living room.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '64 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31477, 18.07898, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.084297, 59.312239), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 2049.29, 342.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (462, 445, 'Lägenhet i centrala Stockholm', 'Apartment in the best possible location in the middle of central Stockholm. From here, it is within walking distance to most of Stockholm''s main attractions. The apartment is well-planned and has a lovely ceiling height and light. The apartment is 100 sqm and has three large bedrooms, a toilet, a shower room and a kitchenette. In total, there are 8 beds and it is easy to adapt for families or friends. Walking distance to restaurants and cafés.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Östermalms', '101 Demo Street, Östermalms, Stockholm', 59.3332, 18.08125, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.077359, 59.337024), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 3, 5, 1.0, 5770.0, 1698.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (463, 446, 'Small apartment in central Stockholm', 'A small one room apartment/studio (17 m2) on Mariaberget, Stockholm’s equivalent of Paris’ Montmartre, close to Old town. Situated in a house built around 1905 in historical neighborhoods, close to the scenic path where you have a view of central Stockholm. Plenty of restaurants, cafés, boutiques and supermarkets within a few hundred meters. Italian and Japanese restaurants in the house.
Kitchen, shower, wc, wifi and a 140 cm bed for 1 or 2 people.
Silent. Window against a court yard.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '163 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31979, 18.05931, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.062974, 59.316935), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 1210.0, 332.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (464, 447, 'Refurbished Old Town Charm - FLORY', 'Prime location in the heart of Stockholm''s Old Town, around the corner from the Royal Palace, Nobel Museum, world class restaurants, and the Djurgården ferry.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '100 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32497, 18.07437, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.072675, 59.326347), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 2676.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (465, 448, 'Söderstudion', 'A modern and stylish studio apartment on charming Södermalm.

Smartly designed to maximize space and functionality, giving a feeling of space and comfort. Fresh, minimalist surfaces with carefully selected details that create a stylish and homely atmosphere.

Close to cafés, restaurants, shops and public transport. Despite its central location, the apartment is quiet and peaceful. Short distance to parks and green areas, which provides the opportunity for lovely walks and outdoor activities.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '108 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31937, 18.04863, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.044695, 59.31781), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 3492.25, 486.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (466, 394, 'Convenient SoFo Flat – Walk to Old Town', 'Located in the heart of SoFo, this flat boasts high speed wifi and offers a comfortable home base for a weekend in Stockholm. Surrounded by vintage boutiques and an abundance of unique eateries, the area buzzes with personality and charm. A laid-back spot where artists, locals, and travelers naturally come together. 

With Old Town just a short walk away, this is an ideal location for those who appreciate vibrant, character-filled neighborhoods with an authentic edge.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '74 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31286, 18.07608, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.074732, 59.314603), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 3420.6, 534.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (467, 449, 'Beautiful, large house close to city centre', 'The perfect base to explore Stockholm. Our house is from 1927 and located in the friendly neighborhood Stureby / Enskede, a quiet area yet close to the city centre. The metro is a 5 min walk away and will take you to the city centre in 10 minutes. Our house has 4 bedrooms (one in basement), lots of space, a beautiful kitchen, a lovely garden, and a sauna.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '138 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.27663, 18.06024, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.064762, 59.273717), 4326)::geography, 6, true, 2, 4, 3, 2.5, 3504.0, 373.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (468, 450, 'Stockholm Central penthouse-feeling retreat', 'Welcome to your stylish urban retreat in central Stockholm! This 51 sqm, 2-room apartment on vibrant Södermalm offers modern comfort with a touch of penthouse-feeling from its stunning city views. Relax on the sunny balcony and enjoy panoramic sights of the Stockholm skyline, or take a short stroll to the nearby beach. Ideally located close to cafes, shops, and top attractions, this apartment is perfect for couples or friends seeking a central Stockholm getaway.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '107 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.3101, 18.05303, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.048348, 59.308526), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 2134.5, 688.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (469, 451, 'Large 2BR in Central Gamla Stan', 'Stay in our beautiful and amazingly located, 2 bedroom home in Gamla Stan (Old Town), overlooking the iconic St. George & the Dragon statue. Just 150m from the water, this bright, spacious home features two fireplaces, a large kitchen with modern appliances, a dining table for eight, two bathrooms, and a private entrance. Enjoy a well-insulated retreat with a library and charming square views, and classic large windows that fill with stunning natural light.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '51 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.325059870093206, 18.07332875767214, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.072555, 59.320958), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 2.0, 3941.3, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (470, 452, 'The Architect’s apartment', 'Newly renovated (May 2023) apartment in the heart of Gamla Stan (Old town). This modern space in our 18th century house is a real gem. A perfect place to spend your Stockholm weekend as a couple. Carefully selected furniture and details in a historic environment with original materials form the early 1800s.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '43 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32382832108653, 18.0713069490738, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.072096, 59.321602), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 2429.5, 531.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (471, 453, 'Waterfront house - 4 km from Stockholm city center', 'Great house with a fantastic view over Lake Mälaren, situated on Stora Essingen, a beautiful area only a few kilometers from Stockholm city center. 
Have a morning swim in the lake followed by breakfast on one of the terraces overlooking the water. 
Take a bicycle ride to Stockholm city center to explore a beautiful and exciting town with excellent restaurants and night life. 
Enjoy a barbecue and watch the sunset from the house.
Park your car just outside the house (free of charge).', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '5 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.3175517, 17.9821824, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.977346, 59.321127), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 3, 3, 2.0, 5114.45, 1553.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (472, 454, 'Bright apartment close to Old Town', 'Newly refurbished apartment in the heart of Södermalm, very close to Old Town. The 50-sqm-two-roomer is light and located on the 3rd floor in a quite neighbourhood with the Subway/Metro just around the corner. Many nice restaurants and grocery stores in the area.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '74 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31913, 18.05877, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.060641, 59.320115), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.5, 1783.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (473, 455, 'Fint rum mitt i stan nära till allt känslan av lyx', 'This special room is located in a 3-room apartment close to everything, making it easy to plan your stay. In addition, the windows face a lush green courtyard and it is quiet at night. The bed is soft and comfortable and 120 cm wide. There is a large closet and a desk in case you need to answer any emails or the like. Two towels are provided. Bed linens are also included, of course. Coffee and tea are included and available in the room. The apartment is centrally located on Södermalm. Hope to see you :) NOTE: No check-in after midnight.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '149 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.310401409779026, 18.074493929743767, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.077419, 59.311572), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 750.0, 136.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (474, 456, 'Old Town flat with a view', 'This special place is close to everything, making it easy to plan your stay. Roof terrace with amazing view.

The apartment is located on the second floor. The apartment has three levels. 
First floor: Kitchen, dining room and toilet.
Second floor: Two bedrooms and bathroom. 
Third floor: Living room. 
Top floor: Roof terrace. 

There is no elevator.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '49 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32525740000001, 18.0698949, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.076664, 59.326258), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.5, 5051.0, 880.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (475, 457, 'Cozy Nice Room With Nice Wiew', 'Very close to both the Metro and the Commuter train!
Only 15 minutes ride to Stockholm Central!

Just a few minutes walk to Farsta Centrum where u have about 200 stores for all kinds of shopping!

Long-term stays are welcomed at a discount.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Farsta', '68 Demo Street, Farsta, Stockholm', 59.23962, 18.10708, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.104128, 59.240338), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 448.0, 78.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (476, 458, 'Stay Inn: Top Floor apartment on Sveavägen', 'Welcome to Eva In Eva Stockholm, where historic elegance meets modern luxury. Step into this charming apartment featuring high ceilings, vintage long doors, and elegant wooden floors juxtaposed with contemporary furnishings and a fully renovated kitchen. Experience a unique blend of Scandinavian design in every corner. This apartment features one cozy bed and one comfortable sofa bed, ensuring a delightful stay for up to 4 guests.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '99 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.34226, 18.0562, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.050192, 59.341318), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1452.04, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (477, 459, 'Nice room in Kista Centrum', 'The room is located near Kista Galleria, 5 min walk.
The room is located just left to the entrance door and the bathroom is just across.

The galleria is open until 8pm every day, there is a big food court with food from all over the world and lots of shopping. The subway station and bus station is also located at the galleria.

Internet is stable and fast.

The bed is 140cm wide + dark drapes for the windows, shown in the photos.

The blue sofa is a bed sofa, 120cm wide.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Rinkeby-Tensta', '56 Demo Street, Rinkeby-Tensta, Stockholm', 59.4002, 17.94578, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.94372, 59.39702), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 430.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (478, 460, 'Villa i centrala Stockholm', 'Private villa on Stora Essingen. Everything is newly renovated and in excellent condition. Large spaces over 3 floors with 5-6 bedrooms. Patio with 3 different grills. Within the city limits. Perfect for a large group. Stay in the countryside in the middle of the big city. Welcome!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '147 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.32102, 17.9951, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.999045, 59.32213), 4326)::geography, 10, false, 0, 5, 6, 2.5, 8790.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (479, 447, 'Large Old Town Apt with terrace - CARL', 'Excellent location in the heart of Stockholm''s Old Town, around the corner from the Royal Palace, Nobel Museum, world class restaurants, and the Djurgården ferry.

Multi-level, private terrace, dining room, living room and 2 bedrooms in style. 

N.B. this is a private residence and not meant for events or parties, such activities will result in immediate eviction.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '21 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32497, 18.07437, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.072496, 59.323356), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 4212.0, 1019.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (480, 439, '# 5 Studiolägenhet', 'Niro Hotel Apartments offers studio apartments on Fridhemsplan in central Stockholm with kitchenettes and spacious bathrooms and equipped kitchenettes for cooking. In addition to Swedish and international TV channels, we also offer Chromecast so you can easily connect Netflix and Spotify to your TV. 

Niro Hotel Apartments is a semi-automatic apart-hotel where our basic idea is that you should not have to pay for anything other than your accommodation. However, we are always a call or email away if you need help!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '124 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.33257, 18.02428, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.028276, 59.328903), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1084.71, 167.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (481, 461, 'Cozy studio apartment on St Eriksplan', 'Stay in a comfortable and thoughtfully designed apartment on St. Eriksgatan, perfectly situated in central Stockholm. Within easy walking distance of St. Eriksplan and the waterfront areas of Kungsholmen, this inviting home offers a single bed, a fully equipped kitchen, and a cozy living area. Ideal for solo travelers, the apartment combines practicality and comfort, providing an excellent base for exploring the city and its many attractions.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '177 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.33785, 18.03423, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.032093, 59.334142), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1013.33, 173.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (482, 462, 'Flat - heart of the Old Town', 'Welcome to your private getaway in the heart of Stockholm’s Old Town.

Just steps from cozy cafés, boutique shops, the Royal Palace, and the waterfront.

Perfect for couples or smaller groups, you’ll love the peaceful vibe, soft light, and unbeatable location, everything you need is right outside your door.

-Prime location in Gamla Stan
-Fully equipped kitchen
-Fast Wi-Fi & 4K LED TV

Book your stay and experience Stockholm’s most iconic neighborhood — like a local.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '24 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32497, 18.07061, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.065855, 59.328725), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 2, 5, 1.0, 5872.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (483, 463, 'A room in the middle of Södermalm, SOFO, Stockholm', 'The bedroom you rent has a comfortable bed.
you are off course welcome to use the kitchen, toilet and the shower room. 

My home is in an old building in the heart of Södermalm (Sofo) 
The flat is cosy & bright. And the room you are going to rent has a nice big bed (180)

Södermalm is the biggest island in 
Stockholm, mostly residential & very trendy now.
The apartment is surrounded by some of the best restaurants & bars in Stockholm. 
Gamla stan (Old town) is within walking distance', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '80 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31151, 18.07976, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.080126, 59.312692), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.5, 1671.0, 444.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (484, 464, '2 room Super cozy and central Stockholm', 'The best Airbnb host in Stockholm! + 400 five star so we got one more!

Right in the heart of Stockholm city! Your own apartment.

Close to; Stureplan (1 min Walk), city (3 min Walk), gamla stan (7 min Walk) and Humlegarden (central park, 2 min Walk) is this well-appointed accommodation. 

Large and spacious bedroom. 

Open floor plan between a functional kitchen and living room with, sofa and dining area. 

Live in an 100 year old building.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '107 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.337411, 18.0681387, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.064268, 59.339559), 4326)::geography, 4, true, 2, 1, 2, 1.0, 2640.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (485, 465, 'Liten nyrenoverad villa nära tunnelbana', 'Welcome to this villa suitable for couples or families. Max. 10-minute walk to the subway station Telefonplan, which takes 12 minutes to T-centralen.

The house is a total of 110 sqm on 2 floors. On the entrance level there is a kitchen, guest toilet, living room and guest room with pull-out bed (160 cm).
 
 On the lower floor/basement there are 2 bedrooms. One with a large double bed (180 cm) and one with a pull-out bed (160 cm). 
There is a bathroom with bathtub/shower, toilet and 2 sinks. 
Laundry room with combined washing machine/dryer.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '52 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.2942251, 17.990424, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.993176, 59.295324), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 3, 3, 1.5, 2898.0, 726.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (486, 466, 'Spacious & cozy, near the water.', 'Located on the Södermalm island in central Stockholm the apartment is both in the midst of the vibrant streets of Hornstull and at the same time surrounded by some of the largest parks in Stockholm.
With less than 5 minutes by foot from the water there is always time for a swim at one of the beaches or jetties close by.
The area is very family friendly with multiple playgrounds, football pithes and other spots open to the public.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '51 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31687, 18.03622, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.044714, 59.317997), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 4, 6, 2.0, 4745.75, 1528.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (487, 374, 'Charming penthouse in central Old Town', 'A unique penthouse in the heart of Stockholm’s Old Town. Located on a quiet street just steps from lively Stora Nygatan, this apartment is set in a 15th-century building that blends historic charm with modern comfort. Spread across two levels, it offers beautiful views over Old Town and a memorable stay in one of the city’s most iconic areas.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '152 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32509, 18.07139, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.06931, 59.325739), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 2671.67, 925.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (488, 467, 'A house with a sea view, only for women', 'Forget your worries in this spacious and serene space. Close to the woods and sea.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Skärholmens', '35 Demo Street, Skärholmens, Stockholm', 59.27357, 17.87077, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.875645, 59.276359), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 0, 1, 0.5, 487.0, 156.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (489, 468, 'Cozy studio apartment', 'In the heart of trendy Sofo, Södermalm.
Here you find lots av cool stores, bars, coffee shops and restaurants just round the corner.
Welcome!

The building has a digital passing system, you need a charged smartphone to enter.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '42 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31309251882092, 18.077081590890884, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.073362, 59.314818), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 2336.0, 411.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (490, 469, 'By the Centralstation in Stockholm', '“For women’s only” 
This is a Women’s safe space 

In the heart of Stockholm, close to everything by walk, 5 min to Arlanda express, busses to the airport and the central station and city hall. 
The room is a tiny room but with everything you need.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '77 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.33262, 18.04756, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.043116, 59.334291), 4326)::geography, 1, true, 2, 0, 1, 1.0, 913.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (491, 470, 'Vivan - ett ställe att trivas på!', 'You will be close to everything when you stay in this centrally-located villa in Mälarhöjden. Just 16 minutes by subway to T-Centralen and a 10-minute walk to the nearest swimming area. Here you will find everything to enjoy a lovely vacation with family and friends. Barbecue and chill for the adults on one of the patios while the children jump on the trampoline, swing or play in the playhouse. After the evening swim, you can warm up in the sauna. Parking is free, three cars can fit in the driveway. WELCOME!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '112 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.30376539239104, 17.965207993984222, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.973288, 59.304738), 4326)::geography, 9, false, 0, 5, 5, 3.0, 4990.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (492, 471, 'Bright beautiful apartment on Stora Essingen', 'My apartment is a very beautiful and bright place right in the centre of Stora Essingen - an city island that belongs to the area of Kungsholmen. It is on the top floor on the corner of the building with mostly families with children as neighbour. The afternoon/evening sun will mesmerize you in the living room and kitchen and in the morning through the bedroom windows. Stora Essingen is sometimes called the Sthlm French qvarter due to the large inhabitants of French & the French school here...', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '164 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.32185, 17.99124, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.994751, 59.325124), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 2, 2, 1.0, 1791.0, 286.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (493, 472, '125 sqm family friendly penthouse on Södermalm', 'Welcome to our brand new 125 square meter flat located in the charming Mariatorget area! This stunning space boasts a modern kitchen, two luxurious bathrooms, a cozy fireplace, and a stunning 3+m ceiling height. Relax in your own private sauna, or take in the beautiful views from the lovely balcony. Perfect for families. Located near several parks and playgrounds. Plus, you''ll have easy access to the area''s fantastic restaurants and cafes.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '31 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31608573731055, 18.066221326589584, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.06393, 59.315136), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 2, 5, 2.0, 7195.0, 2516.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (494, 418, 'Modern studio at Telefonplan', 'Beautiful modern self contained studio at Telefonplan. Only 1 minute walk to the subway Telefonplan. The studio is fully equipped with everything you may need for a comfortable stay. The studio has small double bed that sleeps on person. 

The bathroom has a laundry machine and a dryer. The studio has Wi-Fi access.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '56 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.29768, 17.99744, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.995789, 59.299215), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 0, 1, 1.0, 1363.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (495, 473, 'Retro room- longterm from 26/8', 'Simple accommodation in a house with a large plot, close to the city. In winter, we rent out this room for SEK 9,000 per month. Contact us for more info.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '89 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.27918, 18.03474, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.034081, 59.278094), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 413.64, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (496, 474, 'Modern 2BR apartment with balcony', 'A perfect spot to explore Stockholm! This neighborhood is new, safe and quiet, just on verge of the inner city. 15 minutes walk to subway, 10 minutes ride to city. 

Swim directly below the house from a very nice ponton. Great views from your private balcony. You’ll also have access to the common roof terrace with views of Stockholm. 

The apartment is decorated in a creative, quirky vintage decor. We love our home, and hope you will too!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '94 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.30492, 18.0351, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.036853, 59.305671), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 2119.33, 377.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (497, 475, 'Cozy bright apartment next to avicci- & 3Arena', '• 🚇 8 min to Gamla Stan (Old Town)
• 🚉 10 min to Stockholm Central Station
• 🎤 Walking distance to Avicii Arena, 3Arena & Globen

Welcome to this bright, cozy and thoughtfully designed studio apartment, just south of Stockholm. With close proximity to excellent public transport, all of Stockholm is within your reach. Beautifully furnished in a modern Scandinavian style, it offers a double bed and a single sofa bed, fully equipped kitchen, stylish bathroom and private balcony.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '57 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.29489969999999, 18.0900289, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.088233, 59.297701), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 963.0, 164.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (498, 476, 'Exklusiv våning i city – plats för många', 'Experience an exclusive turn-of-the-century apartment of 120 sqm, located at one of Stockholm''s most attractive addresses. This elegant residence offers five rooms, including three bedrooms, with room for up to 10 people. The apartment is characterized by period details such as high ceilings, large windows and beautiful wooden floors, combined with a tasteful and luxurious interior. Here you live close to the city''s best restaurants, shopping and culture – the perfect place for an unforgettable stay in the heart of Stockholm.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '94 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.3502254, 18.0564858, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.06443, 59.351314), 4326)::geography, 10, false, 0, 3, 10, 1.0, 5017.0, 1680.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (499, 477, 'Konstnärshem på Södermalm', 'Welcome! Here there is lots of art, a creative home and toys for the children. Central location. Comfortable beds, two spacious sofas and a large dining area. 2 minutes from a well-stocked grocery store and playgrounds. 

Welcome! Here there is lots of art, a creative home and toys for the children. You can reach the commuter train and subway in just a few minutes. Comfortable beds, two spacious sofas and a large dining area. 2 minutes from a well-stocked grocery store and playgrounds.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '168 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31168, 18.06504, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.066659, 59.310477), 4326)::geography, 5, true, 2, 3, 4, 1.0, 3701.5, 450.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (500, 478, 'Bright top floor SOFO Apartment - Prime Location', 'This spacious apartment is situated on the top floor of a charming 5 story building. There are 2 Juliette balconies, one in the living room with large south facing windows that let in all the afternoon and evening light. Prime location in Stockholm''s happening Sofo neighborhood. Minutes walk to many shops, cafes and restaurants, and a 2 minute bus ride to the nearest metro station. This space is our home, we only ask that our guests to treat it with care and respect.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '168 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31444, 18.08765, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.085834, 59.315197), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 2695.6, 717.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01')
) AS v(id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city, neighborhood, address, latitude,
  longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms,
  price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
JOIN cities c ON c.name = v.city;

INSERT INTO listings (id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city_id, neighborhood, address,
  latitude, longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds,
  bathrooms, price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE
SELECT v.id, v.host_id, v.title, v.description, v.property_type, c.id, v.neighborhood, v.address,
  v.latitude, v.longitude, v.public_location, v.max_guests, v.pets_allowed, v.max_pets, v.bedrooms,
  v.beds, v.bathrooms, v.price_per_night, v.cleaning_fee, v.currency, v.created_at::timestamptz
FROM (VALUES
  (501, 479, 'Boutique flat with office & private garden', 'Elegantly designed 1-Bed flat nestled in the vibrant heart of Highbury with a office with work space. A stone''s throw from both Arsenal & Highbury stations, your London escape assures convenience & tranquility. Revel in a private garden, a comfortable bedroom (with Hastens duvet), and bath. Walk to Emirates Stadium, delve into the lively spirit of Highbury & Islington, and relax in nearby parks. Your stylish, connected, and peaceful London haven!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Islington', '11 Demo Street, Islington, London', 51.55653, -0.09975, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.093539, 51.555506), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 350.0, 102.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (502, 480, 'Bed in a 24 Person Shared Dorm', 'Whether you''re a backpacker, flash-packer or a budget traveller, Palmers Lodge has everything you need for one of the most unique experiences in London! Combining the grand charm of our historic Victorian Mansion built in 1882, our friendly team and accessible location, Palmers has it all. Swiss Cottage boasts not only a fantastic London city location but our services are unbeatable! You can meet other like-minded travellers at Swiss Bar taking advantage of our selections of drinks and snacks.', 'shared_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Camden', '152 Demo Street, Camden, London', 51.54438, -0.1754, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.172525, 51.545508), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 24, 10.0, 20.0, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (503, 481, 'Boutique one bedroom in South Kensington.', 'Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place of 1 bed 1 bathroom situated in the heart of Kensington, which offers our guests space to work and relax. Kensington offers a great selection of restaurants, bars and are close to all of London’s great tourist sights including Buckingham Palace, Royal Albert Hall, Knightsbridge, Hyde Park are just 10 minutes walk. We offer high standard service to all our guests. Quality is assured though! We would love to host you in our apartment.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Kensington and Chelsea', '57 Demo Street, Kensington and Chelsea, London', 51.49312, -0.18618, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.190355, 51.491104), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 220.0, 23.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (504, 482, 'London''s best transport hub 5 mins walk! Safe too!', '5 -7 mins walk from King''s Cross/St Pancras station. Direct to all airports. I can only ever accommodate ONE person. The bedroom is very quiet. Although my set check-in time is 4-10pm I always try and allow guests arriving earlier than 4 to drop baggage off and collect a set of keys. If this isn''t possible, 1 minute from my home is a Premier Inn HUB hotel with luggage store STASHER. Register, pre-book your luggage. Look at my Guidebook for food and sight-seeing recommendations.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Islington', '49 Demo Street, Islington, London', 51.53411, -0.11984, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.123411, 51.531546), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 79.0, 26.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (505, 483, 'Luxury In2 London Apartment', 'Luxury In2 London Apartment situated in an impressive new development in central London. It''s just a few minutes walk from the apartment and can be linked directly to from major stations such as London Bridge, London Cannon Street, etc. It comes fully furnished and free WiFi is provided throughout the property. The kitchen is complete with cooking facilities and everything you need for a comfortable stay; such as a dishwasher, microwave, washing machine etc. Towels and bed linen are provided.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Lewisham', '60 Demo Street, Lewisham, London', 51.44879, -0.02496, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.028058, 51.449684), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 3040.0, 454.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (506, 484, 'Designer 6 Bedrooms Wembley +Free Parking', 'This stylish & comfy 6-bedroom, 7-bed semi-detached home is perfect for families, groups, contractors, or staycations. The open-plan kitchen & lounge make it easy to cook, dine, and relaxation, extendable dining table & large private garden.

All essentials are just a short walk away – Local shops, and Sudbury Town Station (5 minutes) for quick access into Central London. Set in a peaceful neighborhood with pubs, & restaurants nearby, this home offers the perfect mix of comfort & convenient.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Brent', '6 Demo Street, Brent, London', 51.55076, -0.31194, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.314926, 51.554474), 4326)::geography, 16, true, 2, 6, 7, 3.5, 483.0, 58.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (507, 485, 'Large family house - Near Hampton Court', 'A family home, looking for families to stay during school holidays. Suitable for up to 2 adults and 4 children or similar combination.. The house has a large kitchen and dining room, astroturf, 3 bathrooms, BBQ area and outdoor seating and fire area. The property has 4 bedrooms, 3 with double beds and 1 with a bunk bed.

Within 15 min walk to trains to Waterloo (30 mins), Hampton Court Palace, Twickenham and Richmond. Making it ideal for day trips to London.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Richmond upon Thames', '48 Demo Street, Richmond upon Thames, London', 51.42656, -0.36577, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.365959, 51.424423), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 4, 5, 3.0, 258.57, 49.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (508, 486, 'Spacious Room with 1 x Double and 1 x Single Beds', 'A home away from home while you visit London!

A warm and friendly traditional English house featuring a large bedroom with 1 Double and 1 Single beds. Perfect for UP TO 3 PEOPLE looking to share. Continental breakfast is included.

Stroll to the River Thames, eat at great local restaurants/pubs or whizz to the centre of town in no time with Putney''s excellent transport links - train, underground and buses 10 minutes from the house. Quiet.
 
I look forward to welcoming you! Minimum 2 nights.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Wandsworth', '18 Demo Street, Wandsworth, London', 51.46339, -0.225, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.224304, 51.462585), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 2, 2.0, 118.0, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (509, 487, 'Stunning Shoreditch High Street Studio', 'An amazing studio apartment in the heart of the action! Shoreditch boasts an array of colour and flare with plenty of street art, interesting shops, restaurants, bars. The famous Brick Lane Market; Columbia Road Flower Market and Spitalfields Market that attract tourists from around the world are all within 10 minutes walk.
You won’t be short of places to see and do in East London or jump on a train or bus into the centre to visit the West End, Oxford Circus, River Thames and Buckingham Palace.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Hackney', '162 Demo Street, Hackney, London', 51.52622, -0.07718, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.076325, 51.523738), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 0, 2, 1.0, 122.0, 24.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (510, 488, 'The Contemporary Apartment', 'This is a bright and nice studio flat located at the top floor of a Victorian Building near Portobello Rd
The Contemporary Apartment includes a double bed for a peaceful night sleeping, a living area, dining area, bathroom and kitchen. 
The kitchen features a gas hob, oven, fridge/freezer, washer/dryer, toaster and kettle. 
The black and white tiled bathroom has a bathtub/shower, WC and basin.
Westbourne Park Station (Circle, Hammersmith and City lines) is five-minutes'' walk from the apartment.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Westminster', '93 Demo Street, Westminster, London', 51.51787, -0.19789, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.193157, 51.514701), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 156.43, 45.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (511, 489, 'Cosy and tranquil room in Brixton', 'Lovely boutique style bedroom with own identity, furnished with Victorian pine furniture and antique Indian textiles. Located in central Brixton but in a quiet and peaceful location. Offering a cosy retreat from the rigours of London life.
This room is carpeted and is positioned to the rear of the house, providing a lovely garden view retreat. Located in central Brixton 5 mins from tube.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Lambeth', '170 Demo Street, Lambeth, London', 51.46039, -0.11267, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.117417, 51.462982), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 2.5, 72.0, 10.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (512, 490, 'Great Location! Tower Bridge 1888 Historic W/House', '*Large 2 Bedroom Historic Victorian Warehouse Conversion
*Conservation Area 
*Borough Market & Maltby Street Market
*Tower Bridge
*London Bridge
