  (514, 492, 'Comfortable Stay by Regent’s Park & St John’s Wood', 'FREE PARKING AVAILABLE 

Relax in a stylish apartment in St John’s Wood, moments from Regent’s Park and Central Elias. Enjoy a peaceful yet prime location with excellent transport links, ideal for sightseeing or business stays. Surrounded by leafy streets, cafés, and local shops, this comfortable retreat offers the perfect balance of calm and convenience, just minutes from Elias’s top attractions.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Westminster', '10 Demo Street, Westminster, London', 51.5333, -0.17094, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.166465, 51.532352), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 4, 5, 2.5, 498.0, 142.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (515, 493, 'Cozy room ONLY FOR WOMEN in lovely Wimblendon.', 'Familiar atmosphere, lovely room in a charming neighborhood of London.
Wimblendon is a safe and lovely place.
Near the bus stop and supermarket.
We have a lovely kitten!', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Merton', '7 Demo Street, Merton, London', 51.41061, -0.21056, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.213083, 51.41026), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 32.0, 6.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (516, 494, 'Lovely Flat -Super travel connections! (4)', 'Renovated July 2026. Key free access.

We love the flat. A really spacious 1 four-poster bed flat. Big lounge with comfy sofa-bed. Nice kitchen with breakfast bar.

Great location for exploring London. 1min walk to Victoria and main line station Seven Sisters. Kings Cross 15mins Oxford Circus 20mins.

Lovely garden views and quiet to the rear, some traffic noise to the front but not major for a city.

1 king, 1 dbl sofa, 2 singles. Flexibility for families or friends not wanted to share beds.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Haringey', '16 Demo Street, Haringey, London', 51.58276, -0.07281, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.069712, 51.583119), 4326)::geography, 7, false, 0, 1, 4, 1.0, 139.1, 36.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (517, 495, '2 bedroom modern flat with London skyline views', '2 bedroom 26th floor appartment with unparalleled views to London''s Skyline and Canary Wharf. Extremelly modern and tastefully decorated.

