  (519, 497, 'Self Contained Property', 'The property is ideal for single professionals or couples looking to enjoy the surrounding areas of this wonderful location. Fully equipped offering a peaceful stay close to the amenities of access to the City of London via Mortlake Station or quick routes to Richmond Town Centre and Putney/Fulham.
Three minutes walk from Richmond Park Sheen Gates', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Richmond upon Thames', '151 Demo Street, Richmond upon Thames, London', 51.46153, -0.26746, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.263758, 51.458276), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 154.0, 22.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (520, 498, 'Comfortable single Room', 'Spacious single room recently renovated available in family home. Shops and restaurants within walking distance from our house. Transport services a few minutes walk to the buses and the underground Station which is on the Metropolitan line. Central London is within 30 minutes by underground train. Around 15/20 mins walk to Wembley Stadium, OVO Wembley Arena, Brent Civic Centre and the London Designer Outlet. (Which has the biggest Nike discount outlet in Europe)', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Brent', '130 Demo Street, Brent, London', 51.5713005065918, -0.2871659994125366, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.283589, 51.57085), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 104.0, 27.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (521, 499, 'Stylish family house near Park, sleeps 7, E London', 'Beautiful spacious house in Leafy Victoria Park. Amazing location ideal for families, with markets, coffee shops, hip East London eateries & boutiques & excellent public transport links to anywhere in London', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Hackney', '11 Demo Street, Hackney, London', 51.53622, -0.05241, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.052655, 51.535226), 4326)::geography, 7, false, 0, 4, 4, 2.5, 823.5, 218.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (522, 500, 'Green room Double bed & Private bathroom Battersea', 'Explore London with excellent transport links nearby. Come back to the green room to relax in this calm and charming space. We are located ten minutes walking distance from Clapham Junction in a quiet and safe neighbourhood, only ten minutes walk from the stunning Battersea Park.

The room overlooks a peaceful and pretty street. You will hear no noise at night, ensuring a restful night''s sleep. The room has a smart TV and amenities to make tea and coffee and a new hair dryer and fresh towels.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Wandsworth', '101 Demo Street, Wandsworth, London', 51.4693121, -0.1632181, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.162958, 51.472088), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 119.5, 41.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (523, 501, 'Broadway Market Canal-View Oasis', 'Welcome to our modern flat nestled along the picturesque Broadway Market Canal. 
This stylish retreat offers a bright and spacious escape reflecting the dynamic energy of the neighborhood.
With a prime location near Broadway Market, you''ll have easy access to trendy shops, vibrant markets, and a thriving local scene. 
Embrace the artistic spirit, savor diverse cuisine, and let the vibrant vibes of East London make your stay unforgettable in this urban oasis with a communal patio by the canal.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Hackney', '151 Demo Street, Hackney, London', 51.53538, -0.06093, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.056826, 51.534417), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 1, 3, 1.0, 218.75, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (524, 502, '(21/F19)New Central London Studio Hyde Park+Wi-fi', '🆕NEWLY RENOVATED, luxurious, modern fully self-contained studio in Central London, 3 mins walk to Bayswater Station (Zone 1: District & Circle Lines), 4 mins walk to Queensway Station (Zone 1: Central Line).

🚇Excellent transport links

