  (528, 506, 'Casa antigua, double bed. Zone 2, London UK', 'Enjoy the simplicity of this quiet and central accommodation. Old, simple, no luxuries but clean. Note:👁📍(If you need more than 6 days, please. Ask me to change to another room in the same house).📍', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Westminster', '134 Demo Street, Westminster, London', 51.52703, -0.1827, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.181293, 51.52801), 4326)::geography, 1, true, 2, 1, 2, 0.5, 66.6, 13.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (529, 507, 'Lower ground 2bed next to Marble Arch', 'Located on a quiet lower ground level just moments from Hyde Park, this bright two-bedroom two-bathroom apartment blends practical flexibility with urban convenience. 
*The second bedroom is accessible through an indoor connection via a building extension next to the terrace.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Westminster', '118 Demo Street, Westminster, London', 51.51496, -0.16013, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.162229, 51.514705), 4326)::geography, 7, false, 0, 2, 6, 2.5, 521.0, 126.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (530, 508, 'Studio Apartment | master St. Paul''s', 'Stay near St. Paul’s Cathedral and the River Thames in this smart, compact studio (18–22 sqm), ideal for up to two guests. Designed for short or extended stays, it features a fully equipped kitchen with stovetop and microwave-oven, coffee machine, Smart TV, and high-speed Wi-Fi. A comfortable base close to London’s top attractions, perfect for business or leisure travelers.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'City of London', '21 Demo Street, City of London, London', 51.51217, -0.10136, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.09649, 51.515311), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 220.93, 28.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (531, 509, 'Eight on Danvers - Designer Battersea.', 'Boasting modern open plan kitchen/ living area, our apartment provides 2 good sized double bedrooms, luxury bathroom, large balcony and all the essentials you need for a stress free stay. Including dishwasher, washer/ dryer & double sofa bed

The apartment is in an enviably position in a secluded quiet complex located a mere 3 minute walk from Clapham Junction station and moments from the amenities of the well known Northcote Road.
Secure parking is available for an additional £15.00 per night', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Wandsworth', '29 Demo Street, Wandsworth, London', 51.46072, -0.17063, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.167284, 51.461503), 4326)::geography, 6, true, 2, 2, 3, 1.0, 267.5, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (532, 510, '8 Bed Dorm Female Shared Bathroom', 'THIS IS A FEMALE-ONLY ROOM **18 to 40 years only**

With Chloe Station and Buckingham Palace a few minutes’ walk away, Chloe Chloe is the dream base in London! 24-hour transport to attractions, airports, coaches. The excellent local markets, restaurants, pubs, coffee shops and galleries, all within a 15-minute walk of Big Ben, will make you feel like a true Londoner! A knowledgeable staff who love the city and want it to share with you, there is no better place to stay in Central London!', 'shared_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Westminster', '128 Demo Street, Westminster, London', 51.49051, -0.13651, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.139266, 51.489923), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 18.0, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (533, 511, 'Gorgeous 2 bedroom apartment with garden', 'Gorgeous two bedroom apartment on the ground floor of a Victorian house, located on a desirable road right off Fulham Road and close to Parsons Green. 

There are excellent transport links, with just a short walk to Parsons Green station, Putney Bridge and Fulham Broadway underground stations.

The Fulham Road boasts a vast array of shops, cafes, restaurants and pubs.

This warm and cosy apartment is newly decorated with great care and love.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Hammersmith and Fulham', '128 Demo Street, Hammersmith and Fulham, London', 51.47649, -0.2073, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.207189, 51.473082), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 292.6, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
