  (536, 514, 'Modern Studio in Fitzrovia', 'Well located modern studio in Fitzrovia. Nestled conveniently between Oxford Street, Marylebone, Great Portland Street, and Bloomsbury, or in other words, in the middle of everything, this is the place to be. Equipped with modern amenities, it is nestled among traditional terraced houses in Kensington and Chelsea. Perfect for any length of stay, these apartments offer an affordable and comfortable home away from home in London.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Camden', '150 Demo Street, Camden, London', 51.52495, -0.13961, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.142094, 51.527881), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 194.6, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (537, 515, '2 Bedroom Luxury Flat in Centre of Muswell Hill', 'Luxury two bedroom apartment in the centre of Muswell Hill town centre.

Located in Muswell Hill, restaurants, cafes, independent shops, supermarkets, excellent bus services are all less than 1 minute walk away.

Close to Alexandra Palace, Crouch End and Highgate.

Approx 15 minute walk to Highgate tube (less by bus) with access to central London within 20 minutes.

It''s an excellent base for couples, families or groups to explore London.

Guests will enjoy exclusive access and use of the flat.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Haringey', '16 Demo Street, Haringey, London', 51.5887, -0.14288, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.137395, 51.588294), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 140.0, 47.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (538, 516, 'Lovely Rooms Available', 'Spacious room available in the heart of Ealing! A stones throw away from the trendy restaurants of Ealing Broadway. Walpole Park is 5 minutes away and you have the choice of South Ealing Tube Station or Ealing Broadway Tube Station to walk to. Well situated with supermarkets on your door step, this is a great little base for exploring! 3 shared bathrooms and a separate WC shared. Maximum 2 adults. NO CHILDREN OR INFANTS', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Ealing', '151 Demo Street, Ealing, London', 51.50301, -0.30636, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.30657, 51.506447), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 83.0, 18.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (539, 517, 'Flat near Westfield & Hammersmith', 'The flat is situated in Sheperd''s bush road close to 2 underground stations ( Hammersmith and Sheperd bush ) Westfield shopping centre which was once the biggest shopping center in Europe is 12 Minutes walking from the flat.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Hammersmith and Fulham', '152 Demo Street, Hammersmith and Fulham, London', 51.49864, -0.22196, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.22047, 51.500409), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 92.0, 29.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (540, 518, 'Cozy and modern flat in Victoria', 'Welcome to your London haven near Victoria Station! This remarkable property is tailor-made for your group of four. With two plush sofa beds, everyone sleeps soundly. The expansive kitchen is a culinary playground. Step onto the balcony, relish the Victoria district''s charm. Your London adventure starts here!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Westminster', '104 Demo Street, Westminster, London', 51.49438, -0.14073, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.139816, 51.496388), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 0, 2, 0.5, 184.0, 32.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
