★ Easily accessible to many of London’s attractions - theatres, museums and galleries', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Wandsworth', '112 Demo Street, Wandsworth, London', 51.46186, -0.16966, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.166641, 51.459475), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 155.43, 32.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (542, 520, 'The Hollies Haven & parking', 'The Hollies Haven is a lovely 3 bed house in ‘The Hollies’ quiet conservation area. Free parking for two cars. Suitable for up to 6 adults and one child.

The beds are
bedroom 1: double
bedroom 2: single
bedroom 3: single and toddler bed
living room: small double sofa bed

London stations 25 minutes away. 10 minutes walk to Sidcup station. O2 is near. Rose Bruford & Bird College is walking distance. 

NETFLIX only.

No noise after 11pm, no parties, no pets. Under 25s enquire first', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Bexley', '35 Demo Street, Bexley, London', 51.43929, 0.09691, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(0.095035, 51.43833), 4326)::geography, 7, false, 0, 3, 4, 1.0, 159.75, 54.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (543, 521, 'Bright & Airy Twin', 'Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place. perfectly positioned for exploring London, 7 minutes by foot from underground (Piccadilly line, District line, Hammersmith & City line)
 1 minute to bus stop.
