  (552, 530, 'Bright flat with patio 3 mins from Tube Wimbledon', 'The location of the property strikes the balance between being away from the hustle and bustle of more central London, yet you can be at these main tourist sites within 30 mins. Southfields station is the Gateway to the Wimbledon Tennis Championships and the pubs close by around Wimbledon common are as close to London, yet country life as you can get. The flat is tranquil and efficient use of space. 250 metres from the the station and 850m from No1 Court for tennis fans.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Wandsworth', '156 Demo Street, Wandsworth, London', 51.44303, -0.2073, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.205423, 51.446736), 4326)::geography, 7, false, 0, 2, 6, 1.0, 200.9, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (553, 531, 'Small Lovely Studio Apartment', 'Petite studio in an outstanding, central location; comes with a private entrance and the accommodation also has it''s own bathroom. Soho, Green Park, Harrods, Buckingham Palace, Hyde Park and a myriad of other famous sights are within walking distance. Ideal place for a short stay for 1 or 2 people in a private studio (with essentials)

