  (557, 535, 'Modern En-Suite Room with Private Bathroom. B', 'Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place. Modern en-suite room just steps from King’s Cross & St. Pancras. Private bathroom, fast Wi-Fi, shared kitchen. Ideal for solo travellers or couples. Clean, safe, and central London location.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Islington', '24 Demo Street, Islington, London', 51.53666, -0.12185, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.116899, 51.536912), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 83.0, 19.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (558, 536, 'Local Room near Tate/London Eye/Borough Mrkt', 'Large double room in a spacious, modern flat in SE1. Located just a short walk from the South Bank and within reach of the West End, it''s an ideal base for exploring all that London has to offer and has access to a roof terrace with stunning views. Within a 30 minute walk: London Eye, Houses of Parliament, Big Ben, Borough market, Leicester Square, National Gallery, China Town, West End, Covent Garden, the Tate Modern, the Shard, Tower Bridge, the Tower of London.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Southwark', '113 Demo Street, Southwark, London', 51.49992, -0.10175, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.10146, 51.498607), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 155.67, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (559, 537, 'Lovely one bedroom duplex in earls court', 'Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Kensington and Chelsea', '51 Demo Street, Kensington and Chelsea, London', 51.48993, -0.19471, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.198046, 51.488249), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 229.25, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (560, 538, 'Tooting Studios Penthouse, 5 mins from Station!', 'Perfect for these types of guests:
✪ Groups
✪ Business travellers
✪ Contractors
 
Each studio is modern and spacious, offering a private kitchenette, ensuite bathroom and cozy living space. Enjoy self-check-in, high-speed WiFi and easy access to trendy cafés, parks, and central London. Exploring is made effortless by links. Book your stay for a comfy, convenient, and unforgettable London experience!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Wandsworth', '83 Demo Street, Wandsworth, London', 51.42734, -0.16594, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.163962, 51.427945), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 138.5, 37.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (561, 539, 'Lovely 4 bedroom family house in Barnes village', 'Enjoy a relaxing retreat at our stylish Little Chelsea railway cottage in Barnes. A leafy, upmarket West London village with incredible pubs and family restaurants, a village pond and a weekend Farmers Market. Situated on the River Thames for bike rides and weekend meanders, our home is close to the wilds of Richmond Park and within easy reach of central London. But with gourmet coffee shops, chic boutiques and a unique and friendly atmosphere right on your doorstep you will feel right at home.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Richmond upon Thames', '55 Demo Street, Richmond upon Thames, London', 51.46855, -0.25073, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.25202, 51.467156), 4326)::geography, 6, true, 2, 4, 5, 1.5, 479.67, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (562, 525, 'Candid Small Room in Vauxhall - SLRC', 'This small bedroom is one of three rooms in a converted victorian apartment nestled just shy from Vauxhall and Nine Elms.

The apartment is approximately 15 minutes walk from the River Thames, Vauxhall and Embassy Gardens (US Embassy). Closest Underground stations are Vauxhall, Stockwell and Nine Elms - all of which provides easy access to the heart of Central London within minutes.

The apartment has three bedrooms. One of which can be occupied by you.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Lambeth', '95 Demo Street, Lambeth, London', 51.4762945, -0.1230871, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.121943, 51.472288), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 56.0, 18.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (563, 540, 'Beautiful 2BR flat next to Wembley Stadium!', '2 -bedroom modern apartment next to Wembley Stadium, 7 minutes walk. FREE PARKING!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Brent', '127 Demo Street, Brent, London', 51.55362, -0.28567, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.286298, 51.556871), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 4, 1.0, 290.0, 47.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (564, 541, 'Framery 7 Entire studio apartment hosted by Andy', 'Small & compact flat which is ideal for a city break . Designed to utilise the small space into a quirky self contained apartment within an old framery. It has everything you need for your stay including a lovely little back balcony. The apartment is close to the vibrant night life of Shoreditch, Hoxton, Brick Lane and Spitalfields . Old street and Hoxton stations are a short walking distance with great transport links into central London.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Hackney', '7 Demo Street, Hackney, London', 51.53017, -0.08207, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.080935, 51.532615), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 127.27, 18.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (565, 542, 'Modern, fully-equipped one bed London flat', 'Enjoy a relaxing, peaceful stay in this one bedroom flat in Finchley, where you can easily reach all amenities, as well as beautiful nature trails. The nearest tube station (West Finchley) is a 10 minute walk and then it''s 20-30 minutes to reach central London. The flat itself can accommodate 2 people, with one available double bedroom. The kitchen is equipped with everything you need, and the living room has a TV and a space to work. And for musicians, there''s even an electric piano!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Barnet', '2 Demo Street, Barnet, London', 51.6126247, -0.1831668, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.188009, 51.613648), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 113.0, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (566, 543, 'Stunning Family Home in Tulse Hill', 'Welcome to this stunning family home in a serene residential area near Tulse Hill. 
- Five bedrooms and two bathrooms 
