- Brockwell Park is a 13-minute walk away, perfect for picnics 
Ideal for business travel, leisurely vacations, or groups of any size.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Lambeth', '119 Demo Street, Lambeth, London', 51.4399075, -0.112433, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.111603, 51.443228), 4326)::geography, 10, false, 0, 5, 7, 2.0, 368.25, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (567, 544, 'Whole & exclusive use of beautifully designed home', 'Exclusive use of the apartment including:
- Bedroom & en-suite bathroom
