  (568, 545, 'Cheerful Room Excellent Transport Links', 'This Private Room has a single bed, the room has a lock on the door for privacy, a desk for working from home and plenty of storage space for clothes. There is a large fully equipped kitchen and two modern bathrooms which are shared in the house.
Excellent Transport links with Willesden Junction station just 5min walk from the house, which will connect you to Central and most of London in 20min.
There are also plenty of shops and amenities on the main road which is 2 min walk from the house.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Brent', '103 Demo Street, Brent, London', 51.53583, -0.24525, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.247991, 51.534912), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 2.0, 50.0, 15.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (569, 546, 'One bed house w/ free parking, garden, pet frndly', 'A perfect 5-star getaway! Enjoy a quiet, fully private house, minutes from Twickenham Stadium. Features highly-sought-after FREE off-street parking, large secure garden, 100% pet-friendly and close to public transport.. Ideal for London visits, event guests or long-term relocation.

