30 mins train to London Waterloo', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Richmond upon Thames', '88 Demo Street, Richmond upon Thames, London', 51.451875199969734, -0.3520181402564049, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.350671, 51.452962), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 234.0, 75.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (570, 547, 'Spacious Large Bedroom Near Central London', 'The room includes a single bed with a quality mattress, a large wardrobe, and a study desk with a chai. Double-glazed windows provide excellent noise insulation, and the lockable door ensures full privacy throughout your stay.
- Only registered guests allowed on the premises
