  (571, 548, 'Stay at the Piazza! 1 Bed Covent Garden Gem!', 'Ravi to our charming one-bedroom apartment nestled in the heart of Covent Garden Piazza, where the vibrant energy of Ravi comes alive right outside your doorstep. Immerse yourself in the bustling atmosphere of Covent Garden, where you''ll find an array of charming cafes, restaurants, shops, and street performers. Explore the nearby attractions, including the Royal Opera House, West End theatres, and iconic landmarks like Trafalgar Square and Leicester Square, all within easy reach.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Westminster', '130 Demo Street, Westminster, London', 51.51244, -0.12498, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.121737, 51.510206), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 507.9, 141.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (572, 549, 'GuestReady - Stylish Top-Floor Camden Apartment', 'GuestReady is solely responsible for offering this listing on Airbnb, and they host as a business. For more legal information, visit our Help Center.

To help protect yourself from fraud, always use Airbnb to send money and communicate with hosts.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Camden', '71 Demo Street, Camden, London', 51.54066, -0.14107, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.139423, 51.537522), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 196.0, 61.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (573, 550, 'Flat on Regents Canal by Victoria Park in London', 'Modern apartment with every amenity overlooking beautiful Regents canal. 5 minute walk from Victoria park and the center of hipster life in East London. Return home to a quiet and beautiful apartment with everything you could ever need and a huge outdoor area where you can enjoy your breakfast or just chill sipping a drink on a lazy afternoon.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Tower Hamlets', '106 Demo Street, Tower Hamlets, London', 51.52798, -0.04125, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.042837, 51.525314), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 141.63, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (574, 551, 'Large, sunny room, Victoria Park.', 'I have a lovely Victorian house, right near the park, full of character and good vibes.
There are 2 spare rooms, both with a double bed but I don’t host couples as it changes the dynamics. 
I’m an artist, working between home and my studio. I''ve mostly had long stays as it’s a great place to feel settled.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Hackney', '166 Demo Street, Hackney, London', 51.54486, -0.03708, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.03984, 51.545089), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.5, 76.0, 16.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
