The apartment is perfect for exploring all over London as Clapham Common is on the Northern Line. It''s also an ideal location for events such as Wimbledon!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Lambeth', '79 Demo Street, Lambeth, London', 51.46439, -0.13601, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.13482, 51.460772), 4326)::geography, 4, true, 2, 1, 2, 1.0, 213.0, 39.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
