  (577, 554, 'Charming 2 Bedroom Near Kings Cross Central Zone 1', 'Well-located cosy flat in Clerkenwell, right next to Exmouth Market - a pedestrianised street of independent cafes, restaurants and bars in the heart of central London. Two double bedrooms, 1 bathroom, compact and well equipped.

Walk to Angel, Farringdon and King''s Cross in under 15 minutes. Buses on the doorstep. Islington, the City and Sadler''s Wells all nearby.

