This open-plan space features a comfortable double bed, a fully equipped kitchenette, and a bathroom with a walk-in shower. Enjoy a smart TV and all the essentials for a relaxing stay.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Newham', '97 Demo Street, Newham, London', 51.50125, 0.06987, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(0.07188, 51.50326), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 86.0, 29.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (579, 556, 'Stylish 2 bedroom London flat', 'The space
Stylish 2 double-bedroom Victorian Mansion flat located next to leafy Battersea Park in a smart and safe neighbourhood (zone 2). Ideally located with many great links to several parts of central London.

The flat is located on the third floor and is secure with an audio/buzzer system and is tastefully furnished with large windows and tall ceilings. 
