-Cellar storage for bicycles and free car parking at rear of building. 
 

AMENITIES:
Lovely local cafes, bars delicatessens and shops just around the cor', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Wandsworth', '95 Demo Street, Wandsworth, London', 51.47565, -0.15073, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.146724, 51.47801), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 213.0, 57.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (580, 557, 'Spacious 1 bed w/ free parking and great amenities', 'Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space. High specifications throughout the home, with a large garden. This property is perfect for a relaxed stay, with shops and amenities near by.

Perfect for long weekends and more, this one bedroom home is a great option for a South London getaway, whilst being able to get to central London very quickly. Trains to London Bridge are frequent and take just 12 minutes. Gatwick airport is 30 minutes away.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Croydon', '161 Demo Street, Croydon, London', 51.39281, -0.06998, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.072726, 51.395773), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.5, 212.0, 39.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (581, 558, 'Elegant En-suite Room • Newly Upgraded', 'Comfortable double ensuite on the third floor, accessed by four long flights of stairs. Kitchenette for light meals, private bathroom, and shared kitchen access. Fantastic location near Finsbury Park & Arsenal.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Islington', '65 Demo Street, Islington, London', 51.56243, -0.10745, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.101238, 51.563725), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 119.82, 18.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
