  (587, 564, 'Double Room In Prime Location-Central London - 2', 'Welcome to your comfortable home! This private room is perfect for solo travelers, students, or professionals looking for a clean, secure, and convenient stay.

The room features a lock on the door, giving you privacy and peace of mind throughout your stay. 

