  (591, 568, 'Corner Apartment overlooking the city and Thames', 'This spacious two-bedroom, two-bathroom serviced apartment has been recently decorated with style and comfort in mind, offering everything you need for both short stays and extended visits
The fully fitted kitchen is equipped with all mod cons and all the kitchenware you could need – perfect for enjoying home-cooked meals or quick breakfasts before heading out to explore the city.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Tower Hamlets', '54 Demo Street, Tower Hamlets, London', 51.501079492325275, -0.018560215830802917, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.020665, 51.502145), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 3, 2.0, 300.0, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
