  (594, 571, 'Nice 3 bed warehouse apartment, Chiswick/London', 'This warehouse style apartment is beautiful, well decorated, comfortable and very clean. Very spacious with high ceiling accommodates 6 people and 2 more in the living room - 15 min from Heathrow Airport - Located on Power Road, close to Gunnersbury Station will take by train 20 min to Victoria, 30min to Oxford. Chiswick is an amazing part of London, an English village feeling with trendy coffee shops and restaurants on the busy Chiswick High Road for your indulgence', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Hounslow', '114 Demo Street, Hounslow, London', 51.49419, -0.2808, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.278133, 51.493107), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 3, 3, 2.0, 184.5, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (595, 572, 'Bright flat facing Finsbury Park', 'Bright fully furnished 1 bedroom flat situated directly opposite Finsbury Park with beautiful park views from the bedroom and a comfy sun filled lounge. 

The flat is conveniently located 3 minutes walk from Manor House tube, and 12 minutes walk from Finsbury Park station, with a bus stop situated directly outside. It''s a quick and easy commute to Central London on either the Victoria or Piccadilly Lines.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Hackney', '101 Demo Street, Hackney, London', 51.5679, -0.0994, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.095727, 51.56775), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 104.5, 12.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
