To help protect yourself from fraud, always use Airbnb to send money and communicate with hosts.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Lambeth', '161 Demo Street, Lambeth, London', 51.48855, -0.11005, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.11239, 51.487582), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 73.0, 14.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (603, 580, 'Large 4bed Home near ExCeL | Pool Table & Parking', 'Enjoy a spacious 4-bedroom home in East London, perfect for groups and families. Set up to 7 individual beds across 2 bathrooms for comfort and flexibility. Just minutes from ExCeL Centre, with quick links to central London for sightseeing or business trips. Relax with the pool table, modern interiors, and all the essentials you need. Free driveway parking for one car, with permits available for a small fee. Message us for more information', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Newham', '102 Demo Street, Newham, London', 51.518478, 0.025168, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(0.025379, 51.5144), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 4, 5, 2.0, 349.33, 64.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (604, 581, 'Central London 1 Bed Apt: Trendy and Stylish', 'Clean, modern, well-equipped space with free wifi in the heart of London, Fitzrovia, W1. The apartment is surrounded with desirable food, art, culture, universities, entertainment and night life. Walking distance to all major tourist locations, transport and is in the centre of all the famous London shopping streets i.e Oxford Street, Bond Street, Soho etc. Head in any direction for a great day out. Amazing choice of restaurants, clubs, pubs, shopping, supermarkets, museums at your doorstep.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Camden', '144 Demo Street, Camden, London', 51.52152, -0.13762, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.137173, 51.525478), 4326)::geography, 4, true, 2, 1, 2, 1.0, 192.5, 56.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (605, 582, 'Sunny Single Room Finsbury Park', 'Guests will enjoy the feeling of staying in a classic British house. Cosy and bright single bedroom. The room has a wardrobe, desk and use of bathroom only shared with other guests.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Islington', '38 Demo Street, Islington, London', 51.56736, -0.12011, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.122685, 51.569705), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 64.0, 10.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (606, 583, 'Detached S London Lodge, 45mins 2 city heart', 'Beautiful Eco-Lodge in SE London. You will have the entire cabin. Surrounded by oak trees and wildlife, set far back from a private unmade road. The lodge is totally detached, in the grounds of our Walter ssegal designed property, and backs on to the extensive grounds of the Bromley Court hotel; ancient oak trees and an abundance of wildlife can be appreciated via the huge skylights throughout the property. 
Close to central Bromley,good train links from nearby Ravensbourne station to the City', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Bromley', '167 Demo Street, Bromley, London', 51.41583, 0.00058, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(0.005964, 51.416183), 4326)::geography, 4, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 99.0, 19.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (607, 584, 'Artistic, 1930''s flat - 20 mins to Central London.', 'Large, fully-equiped, artistic and warm ground-floor studio with modern ''white-cube'' space feel. Secure, modern double-glazing windows look out onto the gardens. Three quality supermarkets within a few hundred yards as well as a number of pubs and family restaurants. 150m from railway station (Waterloo and Central London in 15 - 20 minutes and Wimbledon in 5) as well as bus-services.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Merton', '62 Demo Street, Merton, London', 51.41111, -0.22593, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.229057, 51.413745), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 115.5, 29.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (608, 585, 'Royal Kensington, in style', 'A spacious top floor flat in a historic Victorian building. For hundreds of years Holland Park has provided a comfortable safe haven for people who want to make a difference. You can find coffee shops, an underground station, a bus stop and rental bikes right by the house. Kensington Palace (if you happen to be visiting royalty), Holland Park with its famous Japanese garden, Portobello Road antiques market, the Design Museum and Westfield shopping centre are all within walking distance.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Kensington and Chelsea', '67 Demo Street, Kensington and Chelsea, London', 51.50661, -0.20619, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.206333, 51.509718), 4326)::geography, 9, false, 0, 3, 4, 2.0, 630.83, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (609, 586, 'Luxury Modern Studio Kensington King Bed Near Tube', 'New first floor studio apartment on Lillie Road, SW6, ideal for couples, solo travellers or business guests. Enjoy easy self check-in with smart locks, a comfortable king size bed, fully equipped kitchen and dining space for two. The large window brings in great natural light and fresh air. You''ll be within walking distance of local cafés, supermarkets, and restaurants. Thanks to it being close to Earl’s Court and West Kensington Underground Stations, all of London is within easy reach.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Hammersmith and Fulham', '159 Demo Street, Hammersmith and Fulham, London', 51.48736, -0.20018, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.203687, 51.489996), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 146.67, 34.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (610, 587, 'London Waterside premium room', 'Take a break and unwind at this wonderful place. Room in a modern well-equipped flat with shared kitchen and bathroom, in front of the beautiful Welsh harp lake. Free WIFI. Wonderful local shops / restaurants within 2 min walk. Easy access to city centre. A 7 min walk to Hendon rail station with direct trains to St. Pancras station (~15-min journey). A mile to Hendon central station on Northern line subway. If you are an Uber user, it is a 20-min or more drive to central London.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Barnet', '169 Demo Street, Barnet, London', 51.5776, -0.24208, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.247622, 51.579807), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 102.3, 20.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (611, 588, 'Luxury 2BR 2BA Riverside Flat w Balcony', 'Luxury 2BR 2BA riverside flat with a private balcony and beautiful Thames views. Bright, spacious and thoughtfully designed for a comfortable stay, with parking included.

Set in Wandsworth Town / Battersea, with excellent transport links and quick access across London.

Steps from the River Thames, surrounded by cafés, restaurants and local shops.

A calm, stylish retreat in one of South West London’s most desirable areas. Perfect for business stays, city breaks or longer visits.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Wandsworth', '22 Demo Street, Wandsworth, London', 51.46389, -0.18397, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.18545, 51.466347), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 3, 2.0, 292.67, 63.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (612, 589, 'Elegant Wandsworth Apartment', 'Set over three floors, the apartment offers two bedrooms with a king-size and a super king-size bed, a spacious bathroom and an additional WC, making it ideal for two couples, friends or business travellers.

The apartment is within easy reach of central London. Wandsworth Town station is a 10-minute walk away and Clapham Junction is around 15 minutes on foot.

Please note that, due to the layout over three floors, the apartment is not suitable for children.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Wandsworth', '122 Demo Street, Wandsworth, London', 51.454000010885125, -0.18299371004104614, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.18004, 51.452087), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.5, 270.33, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (613, 590, 'Beautiful Family Home in Wandsworth SW London', 'Welcome to your perfect getaway in the heart of Wandsworth! This beautifully designed and spacious house offers all the comforts and amenities you need for a relaxing and memorable stay.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Wandsworth', '56 Demo Street, Wandsworth, London', 51.46024, -0.19625, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.197449, 51.459621), 4326)::geography, 7, false, 0, 4, 4, 2.0, 373.0, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (614, 591, 'Loft w/ 100” Cinema, Premium Mattress & Hammock', 'Stay in a unique 18th-century Victorian school conversion in the heart of Shoreditch. This spacious private loft blends historic charm with modern comforts, featuring a bespoke cabin bedroom, a 100-inch projector, and a Brazilian hammock. 

Steps from Brick Lane, Spitalfields, and top restaurants, with Liverpool Street, Old Street, and Shoreditch High Street stations nearby for fast access to central London. Relax in the reading nook, unwind in the hammock, or cook in the fully equipped kitchen.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Hackney', '80 Demo Street, Hackney, London', 51.52796, -0.0771, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.074536, 51.524868), 4326)::geography, 4, true, 2, 1, 2, 1.0, 206.0, 65.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (615, 592, '4 Charming loft flat in artsy area near the centre', 'A charming compact one bedroom loft flat. The flat was created in 2021. The flat is in the 2nd floor/loft. It is a great place to explore London from. 
There is no door between the bedroom and the living room to give a more open contemporary feel. The area is one of London''s most artsy and trendy. There is a bus stop (343 and 136) just outside the flat and you can reach central London very easily. 

Burgess Park and a supermarket are minutes away.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Southwark', '20 Demo Street, Southwark, London', 51.47881, -0.08433, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.078356, 51.480786), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.5, 136.8, 30.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (616, 593, 'Single room in family home near Wimbledon tennis', 'My place is close to Wimbledon Tennis. This is a single room with a (sometimes) shared bathroom with a separate shower and bath. V comfortable 4’ wide bed. We are 7 minutes walk from Southfields tube station and village.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Wandsworth', '142 Demo Street, Wandsworth, London', 51.44127, -0.21699, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.220495, 51.439729), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 59.0, 8.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (617, 594, '3BR/3.5BA by Finchley Rd Tube | Sleeps 8', 'Moreno is solely responsible for offering this listing on Airbnb, and they host as a business. For more legal information, visit our Help Center.

To help protect yourself from fraud, always use Airbnb to send money and communicate with hosts.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Camden', '147 Demo Street, Camden, London', 51.54646, -0.17975, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.180355, 51.543292), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 3, 4, 3.5, 420.76, 89.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (618, 595, 'London Warehouse One Bedroom Apt', 'The London Warehouse is a great space comprising over 45 Square meters. The London Warehouse is newly renovated with brand new kitchen and bathrooms. The location is within the zone one station of Vauxhall which gives easy access to central London in one or two stops. If you are acouple or group of up to 4 wishing to stay in a One Bedroom apartment in Central London this is the choice for you. We have One bedrooms and a double sofa bed and kitchen area.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Lambeth', '153 Demo Street, Lambeth, London', 51.48721, -0.11459, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.114739, 51.491545), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 254.0, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (619, 596, 'G2 - Convenient Apartment with patio near Victoria', '★ One-bedroom flat in a quiet central location.
★ 2-minute walk to Pimlico tube station
★ Features a UK standard double bed & a double sofa bed & two single folding beds.
★ Luggage storage is arrangeable from 10:30 am to 2:30 pm
