★ Laptop-friendly with high-speed Wi-Fi (complementary)
★ Central Heating with a smart thermostat
★ Located on the lower ground floor - no lift facility.
★ Easy self-check-in with an electronic lock, keyless.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Westminster', '88 Demo Street, Westminster, London', 51.48909378051758, -0.13504000008106232, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.129125, 51.489345), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 1, 4, 1.0, 185.0, 22.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (620, 597, 'Stay London Private Apartment', 'Bright, self-contained studio ideal for solo travellers or couples. Features private comfortable double bed, private kitchen area with hob, washing machine, and a private modern shower room with WC and sink. Includes wardrobe, a cosy 2-seater table with chairs, full cutlery, Smart TV, and fast Wi-Fi. Just a 5-minute walk to Walthamstow Central Station, the famous market, and shopping mall, with excellent transport links to central London.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Waltham Forest', '29 Demo Street, Waltham Forest, London', 51.5829, -0.01786, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.016853, 51.584316), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 64.31, 9.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (621, 598, 'Stylish 2-Bed Fulham | Monthly Stay | 20% Off', '⭐️EXTENDED STAY & CONTRACTOR DISCOUNTS AVAILABLE! Ask about our special rates 💰

Ideal for couples, small families, contractors or friends looking for a comfortable and convenient London base. Enjoy the perfect blend of comfort, style, and location in one of London''s most desirable neighbourhoods!
Elin Highlights:
