- Smart TV
- Washing machine
- Close to local cafes, restaurants, and shops', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Hammersmith and Fulham', '171 Demo Street, Hammersmith and Fulham, London', 51.47973, -0.21219, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.215533, 51.478279), 4326)::geography, 7, true, 2, 2, 1, 1.0, 290.96, 31.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (622, 599, 'Loft studio retreat , Holistic Therapies available', 'Treat yourself to some time out in our peaceful self contained loft space and enjoy access to complementary therapies available on request in the adjoining therapy room with fantastic views over London . The loft has an on suite shower room and kitchen for your use only . The space is accessed via our family home .', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Greenwich', '42 Demo Street, Greenwich, London', 51.47649, 0.06779, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(0.066157, 51.477715), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 111.0, 26.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (623, 600, '4 Bedroom House - Free Parking EN3', '4 bedroom house with 2 full bathrooms and a large kitchen dining area, great for families and friends.
Good transport links into Central London and surrounding areas whether by public transport or car. 
Free off street parking up to 2 cars and free on street parking.

Easy access to M25, A10 and A406 North Circular.
Ponders end and Southbury road overground within walking distance.

Ponders end overground station 8mins walk
Southbury road station 5min walk', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Enfield', '45 Demo Street, Enfield, London', 51.64111219999999, -0.0528814, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.058333, 51.640851), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 4, 5, 2.0, 248.67, 0.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (624, 601, 'Overlooking Finsbury Park', 'Spacious double room in a shared apartment near excellent transport links. Perfect for a couple and 2 children. (Not 4 adults.)

Guests enjoy a Double ''Simba'' 2nd gen memory foam mattress & John Lewis Egyptian Cotton sheets. We also use non-fragranced & non-toxic laundry detergent.

8 min walk to Manor House tube. Shops and restaurants close by.

More rooms available.

Easy access to Heathrow, Stansted and City airport by tube and Gatwick by train. Close to Ally Pally & Finsbury Park.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'London', 'Haringey', '153 Demo Street, Haringey, London', 51.57373, -0.10299, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.107014, 51.574034), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 1, 2.0, 58.0, 16.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (625, 602, 'Quiet 1-Bed Retreat in Kensington AC', 'Bright and modern flat in the heart of Kensington, just minutes from High Street Kensington and Holland Park. Features a UK king-size bed, a comfy sofa bed, fully equipped kitchen, and sleek bathroom. Ideal for couples, families, or work trips. The apartment is located on the 2nd floor and is easily accessible via elevator.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'London', 'Kensington and Chelsea', '60 Demo Street, Kensington and Chelsea, London', 51.503775229854945, -0.19441312495166008, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-0.193368, 51.500217), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 252.0, 73.0, 'GBP', '2018-01-01'),
  (626, 603, '*BRAND NEW*4 BED DUPLX W PVT BCKYARD 15 MIN 2 CITY', 'This Duplex unit was just completed w/ all brand new finishes and all new furniture/bedding. It is a very comfortable and spacious unit. Everyone has their own room/space w/ flatscreens in every individual room. There is prvte outdoor space w/BBQ and seating for warm weather stays. The J subway line is a 2 min walk away & 15 min into the heart of Lower manhattan. The A & C subways are 10 min walk away. Bars, restaurants, cafes, shops, grocery stores all within walking distance of the townhouse.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Bedford-Stuyvesant', '42 Demo Street, Bedford-Stuyvesant, New York City', 40.68823, -73.92191, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.92049, 40.685566), 4326)::geography, 10, true, 2, 4, 4, 2.0, 318.38, 0.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (627, 604, 'Upper Westside Brownstone Garden Apartment', 'Garden apt. in quiet neighborhood off Central Park West. Spacious living room with fireplace. Guest bedroom is also spacious with an outdoor eating area just outside the bedroom in the garden area. The garden floor has two baths, living room, pantry and a washer dryer room, it''s own private entrance there is total privacy on this floor. The apartment is a duplex, the upper floor can be accessed by the staircase seen in the pictures there is a shared kitchen and dining room with host upstairs.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Upper West Side', '164 Demo Street, Upper West Side, New York City', 40.79148, -73.96978, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.974402, 40.792067), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 3.0, 290.0, 59.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (628, 605, 'Cozy 1 Bedroom Apt.. Just like home', 'My space is very cozy. I take pride in comfort so i hope my place will be as comfortable and inviting to you as it is to me.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Crown Heights', '175 Demo Street, Crown Heights, New York City', 40.66424, -73.94807, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.950767, 40.662075), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 125.84, 39.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (629, 606, 'Historic brownstone - Rm2', 'Welcome to 255 West Guesthouse, a quintessential brownstone in the heart of Harlem. Local amenities include a short walk to the vibrant shopping district of 125th St, Columbia University, and tons of independent restaurants, shops, galleries. Grab food from top-rated restaurants like Red Rooster or Clay. 3 blocks to A/C/B or 2/3 express Subway lines get you to Midtown in 15 minutes.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Harlem', '49 Demo Street, Harlem, New York City', 40.81318, -73.94632, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.945125, 40.811671), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 115.89, 40.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (630, 607, 'Fashionista King', 'Our Midtown hotel fuses contemporary-chic design with warm hospitality in a convenient location near the Theater District in the heart of Manhattan. Each room is cozy, colorful, and decked out with modern essentials. From complimentary refreshments and ultra-comfy beds to pet-friendly perks, every detail is crafted for your enjoyment.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Hell''s Kitchen', '131 Demo Street, Hell''s Kitchen, New York City', 40.75435, -73.99391, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.992842, 40.755204), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1005.0, 0.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (631, 608, 'Private Room Near JFK', 'Comfortable private room in a quiet home near JFK Airport with quality furniture, closet space, and a shared bathroom.

This stay is hosted within my unit, i.e., I will be present in the unit during your stay. Guests will be sharing certain common areas with the host, including the shared bathroom, dining area, and designated kitchen space for light use.

Ideal for a peaceful stay near JFK Airport with convenient access to public transportation, Manhattan, shopping, dining, and local parks.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Rosedale', '15 Demo Street, Rosedale, New York City', 40.66125, -73.73765, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.732858, 40.662994), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.5, 63.0, 0.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (632, 609, 'Traveling Nurses and Medical Professionals', 'Close to Times Square!!! Bars, bakeries, cafés, night life, upscale boutiques, restaurants, The Apollo Theatre, Museum Mile, Yankee Stadium, Central Park, and much more! 
Quiet, well equipped, well maintained, spacious apartment in historic, landmark property, in Historic Sugar Hill. 
Neighborhood is well appointed, within close proximity to the center and saturated with amenities. Serviced by three metro stations, total of six train lines; the main hub is less than a two minute walk away.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Harlem', '109 Demo Street, Harlem, New York City', 40.8238, -73.94444, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.943702, 40.826698), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.5, 53.47, 6.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (633, 610, '10 MINUTES CLOSE TO MIDTOWN MANHATTAN', 'Greeting guests! We would love to host your stay here in Astoria! Conveniently located by the N,W, R trains just 15 mins away from Midtown.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Astoria', '138 Demo Street, Astoria, New York City', 40.75792, -73.92852, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.928217, 40.756712), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 2.0, 61.23, 6.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (634, 611, 'Charming room in the heart ❤️ of Williamsburg!', 'Beautiful and spacious room with full bed .It has everything you need. There is a desk and closet. Tons of lights!
One bathroom, living room/ kitchen to your access.
Top location! just one stop to Manhattan and the subway is across the street. 
A lot of restaurants, bars, galleries and a park. The citybike is nearby, so you can rent a bicycle.
P.S. There is the subway under my house, that means sensitive people should be aware. So sometimes you can hear it.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Williamsburg', '125 Demo Street, Williamsburg, New York City', 40.71751, -73.95763, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.956482, 40.718416), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 385.67, 98.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (635, 612, 'West Village Wonder - Amazing Location', 'Welcome to the greatest neighborhood in the world! Nestled on 13th St.a tree-lined, brownstone-rowed block off of Hudson. This spacious studio offers the perfect blend of charm and style. You''ll be surrounded by unique boutiques, cozy cafes, and top-notch restaurants.

Whether you''re here for a short stay or an extended visit, this prime location provides the perfect backdrop for your NYC adventure. Book now and immerse yourself in the quintessential West Village experience!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Chelsea', '129 Demo Street, Chelsea, New York City', 40.7388672, -73.9997223, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-74.00236, 40.736981), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 499.0, 142.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (636, 613, 'Brooklyn Hideaway Close To Trains & JFK Airport', 'Discover this cozy one-bedroom garden level apartment in Brooklyn, featuring modern bathroom, fully-equipped kitchen, and inviting living room. Nestled in the vibrant Brooklyn neighborhood of East New York, it offers comfort and convenience for your stay, with easy and close access to the MTA trains & buses to bring you to local attractions.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'New York City', 'East New York', '90 Demo Street, East New York, New York City', 40.66874, -73.89143, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.891211, 40.670063), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 199.13, 66.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (637, 614, 'Studio631 In the heart of Midtown Manhattan', 'If you are planning to visit New York and want to try an alternative to hotels you have come to the right place. We offer self-catered vacation rentals located in an unbeatable area of Midtown Manhattan just two blocks away from the Empire State Building.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Midtown', '16 Demo Street, Midtown, New York City', 40.74815, -73.98892, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.991048, 40.748069), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 0, 3, 1.0, 365.1, 125.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (638, 615, 'Beautiful Studio with Patio in Midtown NYC! #2202', 'Beautifully Brownstone-designed Studio apartment features 1 Queen-size bed and a pullout sofa bed located right off Grand Central Metro Station. Walking distance to Times Square, Steps from Central Park & the Metropolitan Museum of Art. surrounded by cool bars, restaurants, and coffee places. Located next to the United Nations, therefore, one of the safest neighborhoods in NYC. The apartment is well-designed and features anything you need for your trip, linens, towels, pots, pans, fridge, etc.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Midtown', '66 Demo Street, Midtown, New York City', 40.75142288208008, -73.97050476074219, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.97407, 40.748091), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 550.0, 146.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (639, 616, 'Brooklyn At Its Best, Too!', 'Private room with unique sink area in Edwardian era townhouse, just off Prospect Park. Close to the subway (B, Q, 2, 5) to Manhattan (20 minutes) and elsewhere! Also, Brooklyn Botanic Garden, Brooklyn Museum, restaurants, bars, live music venues. Prospect Lefferts Gardens Historic District location. Park Slope adjacent

(If this room is booked, see our other one at Brooklyn At Its Best! (https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/13938420?s=51)', 'private_room'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Prospect-Lefferts Gardens', '66 Demo Street, Prospect-Lefferts Gardens, New York City', 40.6606, -73.95549, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.959033, 40.658897), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 193.0, 38.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (640, 617, 'Astoria Apt, steps away from NYC', 'Welcome to Astoria, Queens! This private apartment is located in a very safe, well maintained, elevator building in a desirable neighborhood. The apartment is located on the fifth floor, where a small balcony allows peaceful views of Astoria. Our place always receives abundance of natural light during the day and in the evenings, the place is quiet, warm and cozy!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Astoria', '2 Demo Street, Astoria, New York City', 40.7696, -73.92356, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.923372, 40.772309), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 232.37, 0.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (641, 618, 'Covid Clean since ''11!', 'Cleanliness is paramount! Guests that share my view on health and the home are ideal not those concerned most with my location. MY level of cleanliness has always been more stringent than Airbnb''s recommended COVID 19 protocols. I clean with everyone''s health in mind using steam, bleach & essential oils. Please be sure to read my listing in its entirety. Vaccinated guests only & those following CDC masking advice. It''s not fancy but I call it home and you are welcome.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Flatbush', '25 Demo Street, Flatbush, New York City', 40.65468, -73.95721, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.956964, 40.651953), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 58.16, 0.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (642, 619, 'Premium Queen C - Yotel Times Square', 'Located less than a mile from Times Square', 'private_room'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Hell''s Kitchen', '176 Demo Street, Hell''s Kitchen, New York City', 40.75956, -73.99645, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.998319, 40.763239), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 233.0, 32.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (643, 620, 'Lovely private bedroom in shared apt', 'Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place. Unwind in a peaceful, private bedroom with a queen bed and spacious closet. Enjoy meals in the full kitchen or in any of the delicious restaurants in the area.
There is a security camera at the entrance of the apartment for security.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Harlem', '69 Demo Street, Harlem, New York City', 40.81711, -73.94045, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.946268, 40.816289), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 56.85, 8.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (644, 621, 'Stunning Alcove Studio on Prime East Village Block', 'This huge alcove studio is brand new, equipped with everything to make your stay in New York City amazing. The apartment was just redecorated w/ a new full-sized bed, memory foam mattress, large sofa. Oversized desk with 32" monitor and high-speed Wi-Fi to do any work from home! Super quiet tree-lined block

The apartment has separate sleeping and living areas. Located in a prime East Village location near tons of great restaurants, bars, Wash Sq Park, NYU and most subways. 

90 night minimum', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'New York City', 'East Village', '138 Demo Street, East Village, New York City', 40.72757, -73.98685, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.984265, 40.725752), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 155.23, 0.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (645, 622, 'Manhattan Bridge-Fort Greene-UN Private Suite', '• Charming, historic Brooklyn building

• Steps from the Manhattan Bridge

• Easy access to Manhattan''s East Side and the United Nations

• Newly renovated space

• Extra-large guest room: 290 sq ft

• Everything needed for a comfortable, enjoyable stay

• Ideal for young and traveling professionals

• Perfect for work assignments or short-term vacations in NYC', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Downtown Brooklyn', '23 Demo Street, Downtown Brooklyn, New York City', 40.6964487, -73.9838654, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.982841, 40.695873), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 2, 1.0, 121.38, 14.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (646, 623, 'Boutique Midtown 2BR | Steps from Broadway', 'Situated in the heart of Midtown Manhattan, this apartment places you just steps from some of New York City’s most iconic landmarks. Bryant Park, Times Square, Grand Central Terminal, Fifth Avenue, and Broadway are all within easy walking distance, making it an ideal base for sightseeing, shopping, and theater.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Midtown', '56 Demo Street, Midtown, New York City', 40.75607, -73.98138, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.977318, 40.756288), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 834.5, 139.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (647, 624, '[Room 2] Private Room + Work Desk, 30 min from JFK', '➳ a deluxe private room with designer decor & beautiful views; 15 min to Beach 67th st. A train

➳ f e a t u r e s :
----------------
➳ Queen bed; percale cotton sheets; 100% cotton quilts; [mattress & pillow protectors washed/sanitized between all bookings]
➳ private designated workspace
➳ XL closet with lock = easily fits a surf board, guitar, luggage, etc. (closet locks for any valuables)
➳ toiletries - shampoo, conditioner, body wash, lotion; blow dryer
➳ towel service - both bath & beach!', 'private_room'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Arverne', '165 Demo Street, Arverne, New York City', 40.59658, -73.80315, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.80348, 40.597916), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 0.0, 163.0, 28.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (648, 625, 'Movie Theater + Hip Hop Getaway', 'This Hip Hop get away has a style all its own. Including a Movie Theater equipped with Netflix, Disney +, HBO MAX, YouTube, All Cable Channels, Internet ready to use. No need for an account on any of those its ready to go. 

In this spacious apartment you''ll find all your basic needs. Kitchen with granite counters, Toaster, Stove, Private Fridge in room. A record player with a box of records ready to use (Music All Genres). 

24/7 Security in area.

Located VERY close to train and shopping.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Parkchester', '135 Demo Street, Parkchester, New York City', 40.83673, -73.8599, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.857614, 40.835457), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 116.9, 40.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (649, 626, 'Urban Delight: Brooklyn Retreat', 'Nestled in the heart of a vibrant metropolis, this quaint and cozy apartment is ideal for your New York City trip! Located in the vibrant Caribbean community of East Flatbush in Brooklyn. While off the beaten path our place is still in close proximity to Manhattan with train and bus routes running through the area. Budget friendly considering its proximity to Manhattan and access to transit. Very happy to host you and to cater to your travel needs! Readily available because we live on premises.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'New York City', 'East Flatbush', '177 Demo Street, East Flatbush, New York City', 40.64236, -73.93087, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.928917, 40.644441), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 227.67, 67.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01'),
  (650, 627, 'Three bedroom upscale condo', 'The space
Three bedroom, 2 1/2 bathrooms. Sweeping views, Amenities include 24-hour concierge, Cybex fitness center, indoor pool, spa, private movie theater, roof. Only a Metro Card swipe from midtown and a mere 22 minutes to Grand Central.

3 bedroom, 2.5 bath with over 1,900 SF. Open chef''s style kitchen with Viking/Subzero appliances and laundry room. Master bedroom has an ensuite bathroom with Jacuzzi tub & shower. Lots of closet space. Sweeping views of the surrounding area. 

24 hr concierge, storage, children''s playroom, fitness center/sauna, steam room, year round indoor pool/ common roof deck. 

Two blocks away from main street (Johnson Avenue) where one can find a supermarket, Starbucks Coffee shop, banks, delis, etc. Lots of parks and playgrounds, all in 5 min walking distance.

Walking distance to subway (30 min to midtown on a local train), express buses, 22 min train to Grand Central. 

Free shuttle to Colum', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'New York City', 'Spuyten Duyvil', '71 Demo Street, Spuyten Duyvil, New York City', 40.88489, -73.91597, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.916986, 40.881692), 4326)::geography, 6, true, 2, 3, 1, 2.5, 261.23, 58.0, 'USD', '2018-01-01')
) AS v(id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city, neighborhood, address, latitude,
  longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms,
