  (8802, 702, 1755, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'We stayed At Omar''s sanctuary again. I was able to relax and the room is always clean, I adore the large size of the room for the ggues, and the privacy. 
I will definitely recommend and hope visit floras home again if I am visiting the city. Thanks!!', '2022-09-20 11:35:00+00'),
  (8803, 702, 1365, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'it''s a good place to stay. very much into budget. the host is very cooperative.', '2022-09-16 08:32:00+00'),
  (8804, 702, 1676, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 'Respond is very quick, Very thanks the host.
Room value is high to compare its price!', '2022-09-05 15:20:00+00'),
  (8805, 702, 1668, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 'Nice and clean Appartement, the house is a bit worn down. Street parking available. Omar was very responsive and quick to answer our questions', '2022-09-04 14:34:00+00'),
  (8806, 703, 1894, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'I had a great stay at John''s place.
The place provided me the best experience at Rockaway. Very close to the beach and the subway with everything I needed.
John was extremely helpful and responsive. Highly recommend his place', '2023-11-05 09:42:00+00'),
  (8807, 703, 1005, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'John was the perfect Airbnb host. He was there whenever we needed him (even late at night) and invisible when we didn’t. The place has a gorgeous view and John is truly an all star host', '2023-08-23 08:20:00+00'),
  (8808, 703, 1096, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'John greeted us upon arrival which was very warm and welcoming. John went out of his way to show us around and was very responsive. The place was clean and comfortable, would definitely book again!', '2023-08-12 16:12:00+00'),
  (8809, 703, 1785, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'The RV was awesome! John and his wife were so kind and responsive. They greeted us when we arrived and were always helpful whenever we had any questions. The RV is so cute and you can tell they put a lot of love and care into it. The jacuzzi was amazing and it was close to some local beach bars which was a blast! Such a fun experience - thanks for hosting!', '2023-08-06 14:01:00+00'),
  (8810, 703, 1182, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'John’s place is cozy and charming. John is a great host and very responsive. This is a great location with beautiful views of the Bay!', '2023-07-30 09:27:00+00'),
  (8811, 703, 1557, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'This place is amazing!! The place and the people are awesome. Thank you John', '2023-07-28 11:36:00+00'),
  (8812, 703, 1053, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'John was great. What a great little hideaway. Great hosts, great view and fire pit on top of it. Slept like a baby', '2023-07-24 08:25:00+00'),
  (8813, 703, 1149, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'EXCELLENT VIBE🌴 SURPRISE MY MAN WITH NYC GATEWAY🤣 WE HAD AN AMAZING VIEW🌊 WE RELAX IN THE JACUZZI & OMG THE RV WAS LIKE A MINI HOME🏠 WE HAD A BLAST🔥HOST & HIS FAMILY WAS SUPER WELCOMING😇', '2023-07-20 20:16:00+00'),
  (8814, 703, 1409, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Had a great time! It was a quick birthday getaway. Only thing that may bother some is there is a restaurant/bar about a quarter of a mile away. you can hear the music clearly at night. we enjoyed it. kind of our own party. John was very helpful and communicated well. very welcoming greeting. gave a brief tour and explanation of how thing operate. would definitely book again if in the area.', '2023-07-16 14:03:00+00'),
  (8815, 704, 1439, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Tub didn’t look clean and hot and cold water handles need to be fixed. I stood in the shower for 10 minutes trying to turn the water off with a wrench. Room was spacious and clean though. Good for 1 or 2 nights but not long term stay.', '2023-08-19 13:50:00+00'),
  (8816, 704, 1047, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'The host was very kind. And the room was exactly what the pictures showed however the bathroom was dirty and had mold. But for one day it was exactly what i needed.', '2023-07-30 22:55:00+00'),
  (8817, 704, 1101, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Great place. Good location, spacious room, and accommodating host. I’d recommend!', '2023-07-29 18:19:00+00'),
  (8818, 704, 1127, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 'I had a bad experience in which i didn’t even get to sleep at the Airbnb due to unclear listing. While I was there it was extremely hot and the fan didn’t do much. The bathroom didn’t have any toilet paper and the checking in experience was alright.', '2023-07-17 21:30:00+00'),
  (8819, 704, 1145, 3, 5, 3, 4, 4, 5, 4, 'David place was great ! Nice & quiet and the host was very respectful', '2023-06-19 08:53:00+00'),
  (8820, 704, 1276, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Worth the money, very nice host and neighborhood', '2023-06-11 19:49:00+00'),
  (8821, 704, 727, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, '+the room is quite nice ! Lots of space which is rare in that price bracket.
-the bathroom is not very clean and in a poor state. The shower was unsightly and there was no hot water when I arrived (David was efficient at offering a refund and said it would be repaired the next day which was appreciated)
- the kitchen is okay .
All in all you get what you pay for considering the prices of other places in the surrounding but don’t expect anything great.', '2023-05-22 14:34:00+00'),
  (8822, 704, 1030, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 'The place is good near metro 12 min about the host is good and no problems', '2023-05-20 19:52:00+00'),
  (8823, 704, 1799, 4, 3, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'When I checked in, there was dirt inside and outside the hallway. The room had hair everywhere, and the bathroom was extremely dirty (I attributed this to the other guest). I was fine with the conditions of the place since I assumed it was under construction, and it was decently cheap, but the ants and roaches on my things and food was my last straw. If you’re come to BedStuy, just find somewhere else or get a hotel, at least you’ll have ants in a place that doesn’t smell of cigarettes and weed 25/8. If you don’t mind these things, it’s somewhat close to the sub and the neighborhood didn’t give me any issues.', '2023-04-24 13:15:00+00'),
  (8824, 704, 1553, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 'Place was alright. I liked the room, but the bathroom definitely needed a cleaning - there was no hot water, a broken shower handle, no toilet paper, and really dirty walls.', '2023-04-16 21:12:00+00'),
  (8825, 704, 1812, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Grateful to you David for a wonderful stay. I really enjoyed the space and peace that the room provided! Thank you also for your flexibility and care .', '2023-03-26 20:51:00+00'),
  (8826, 704, 805, 3, 3, 5, 5, 5, 3, 4, 'Absolutely worth what I paid. Very comfortable, relaxing, serene space. The host seems like a really great person, loved his responsiveness, very clean and helpful. Would most definitely book again! I p.s I re-booked my original reservation twice during my stay so, there you have it. Lol Thanks David I really enjoyed my stay.', '2023-02-26 18:33:00+00'),
  (8827, 704, 955, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 'Great unit to stay in. Nice size room, and quiet area all together. House is under renovation but that don’t stop the comfort the room provides you with. Thanks for the stay. Will come again', '2023-02-12 18:36:00+00'),
  (8828, 704, 1120, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 3, 4, 'David is very nice. Everything is just like it looks & the bad reviews aren’t as true as you would think. If you’re an understanding person you’ll understand different situations. This place was peaceful and newly renovated. It was still renovation going on but it will be better than it is now! Thank you for having me!', '2023-01-26 13:15:00+00'),
  (8829, 705, 1077, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Kai was a charming, helpful, and kind host. She had thought of everything in advance—even the snacks in the kitchen! A complete set of towels, including slippers and makeup towels, a very comfortable bed, and a quiet, peaceful home. It was a wonderful experience!
Transportation from the neighborhood was also easy; access to the city center is excellent.
I definitely recommend it!', '2026-09-11 21:29:00+00'),
  (8830, 705, 833, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'The cameras everywhere made me a little uncomfortable I get to have cameras when people are staying at your place but idk it was excessive idk if their were cameras in the bathrooms & bedroom idk I felt like I was being watched & I didn’t know other people were gonna be there too that was a detail I guess that was left out . The complimentary breakfast wasn’t why I expected but the place was clean and she did have drinks and little snacks . Kai was nice just the camera thing a little creepy to me .', '2026-09-07 09:09:00+00'),
  (8831, 705, 1371, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'I had an amazing stay at elida’s beautiful home. from the moment i arrived, she made me feel right at home. she’s such a sweetheart, and her hospitality was truly spectacular. everything was spotless, comfortable, and so well organized that it honestly felt like staying at a hotel, but with a warm, personal touch. i couldn’t have asked for a better host, and i’d absolutely stay here again. thank you, elida!', '2026-08-03 20:58:00+00'),
  (8832, 705, 845, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Kai is a fantastic host. My son needed a place to stay while participating in a summer program in Manhattan. She was extremely helpful with subway routes and was a very accommodating host. She provided snacks and breakfast foods for the entirety of the stay. Takes about an hour to get into Manhattan via subway. Very close to LaGuardia.', '2026-07-31 17:37:00+00'),
  (8833, 705, 1777, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Absolutely loved staying with Kai! Her place was amazing and very accommodating. Easy access to mta and great restaurants. Kai is a wonderful host who’s super responsive and adds the little things to make you feel right at home. Would absolutely stay here again.', '2026-06-30 08:36:00+00'),
  (8834, 705, 1227, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'My stay was excellentand superb. Kai place is always perfect stay. The comfort the cleanliness and great appreciated! highly recommend, hope i come again', '2026-06-23 18:50:00+00'),
  (8835, 705, 1044, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I had an amazing stay at Kai’s place. She was great with communication, very hospital, and provided great complimentary services (coffee, pastries, snacks, towels, etc. The room, bathroom, and kitchen were very clean.', '2026-06-13 19:56:00+00'),
  (8836, 705, 1346, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Kai is a great host, very friendly and attentive and makes sure guests have anything they need, including drinks and snacks. The place is very well kept, very clean and in good condition. Easy commute to the city on the subway.', '2026-06-08 21:40:00+00'),
  (8837, 705, 1032, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'This was my second time staying with Ms.Kai. Not only was my second experience just as wonderful as the first but Ms. Kai took it upon herself to make things more exclusive for me. There were snacks just for me and extra bedding to accommodate my son who had then decided to stay as well. Ms. Kai went above and beyond my second time around to accommodate my son and make him even more comfortable. Not only did they provide extra bedding but added another small bed in the room to make everything more manageable. I cannot thank Ms. Kai enough for all her kindness. Her home is very clean, comfortable and quiet. I absolutely loved my stay at her home.', '2026-06-01 12:29:00+00'),
  (8838, 705, 826, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Kai was an amazing host throughout the whole process. The house is In a quiet neighborhood and room was very cozy and she made it feel right at home from the clean house to the warm welcome basket of drinks and snacks throughout your stay would definitely recommend here to anyone!!!!', '2026-05-24 10:53:00+00'),
  (8839, 705, 862, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I have no notes for Kai’s place. If you are considering taking a chance on a new listing DO IT! She communicates with kindness and is just a really thoughtful person. I would liken this accommodation to a hotel with a shared bathroom. Parking was easy. Everything is sanitary, there were shoe covers and slippers available. Very nice toiletries packages with loofahs, soap, toothbrush&paste you name it. The kitchen is equipped with so many generous offerings for us to enjoy which is truly appreciated from water, fresh fruit, pastries and chips. A few favorite things: the bathroom had dr Bronner’s soap, the closet space is huge and the luggage stand is a nice touch. I will definitely be staying here again. Thank you for a wonderful accommodation!', '2026-05-20 20:45:00+00'),
  (8840, 705, 1032, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'Ms. Kai is by far the best host I’ve come across. I booked with her super last minute. Not only was she responsive but was able to accommodate me within the hour. Check in was easy as the keys are left in a lock box with an easy entry and clear instructions . Not only was it so clean and comfortable. The room was perfect size for space and comfort. Spacious with a complete walk- in closet of space for my belongings. She stocked the kitchen fridge with drinks snacks, water and made coffee every morning. I saved so much money on having to purchase those items on an everyday basis. There was also breakfast items along with fresh danishes. I’m so grateful to Ms. Kai for hosting me. Her home is literally a 9 min walk to transit and made my commute to work such a breeze. I loved my stay so much that I booked with her for a future stay. 
Thanks Kai', '2026-05-17 08:37:00+00'),
  (8841, 705, 814, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Booking with her was good but if u are trying to book make sure u don''t play music or anything cause she likes it quiet but the place was very clean it was all good except the fact i didnt get my refund money from her because my guest left on the first day .', '2026-05-09 10:14:00+00'),
  (8842, 705, 1466, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'I had a wonderful stay here! The hosts were extremely welcoming and attentive, making sure everything was just right throughout my visit. The space itself was spotless and well maintained, with thoughtful touches that made it feel very comfortable. The location was also a big plus, close to public transit and main roads, which made commuting around the area quick and easy. Overall, it was a great experience, and I would definitely recommend this place to anyone looking for a clean, convenient, and friendly stay.', '2026-04-13 10:38:00+00'),
  (8843, 705, 1471, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'I only had a short stay but the place was clean and instructions were clear. I was able to connect the wifi and get my work done on time and sleep in peace.
Host was very responsive in accommodating.', '2026-04-06 08:16:00+00'),
  (8844, 706, 1835, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'As always, it was a comfortable stay. Everything was handled professionally.', '2026-03-14 10:57:00+00'),
  (8845, 706, 1423, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Great stay. It was exceptionally clean and the roommates were great. Truly can’t go wrong with kaz. They’re also extremely responsive via the Airbnb app and respond almost instantaneously. 
If you like cleanliness, quiet, and a comfortable room, this is it.', '2026-02-07 08:23:00+00'),
  (8846, 706, 1254, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Nice room in a convenient location. The host is very friendly and helpful throughout the time. As it is a townhouse near the road, sometimes it can be noisy (I am actually fine with it). Thanks to Omar and his team for being great hosts.', '2025-12-30 18:58:00+00'),
  (8847, 706, 1529, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Omar and his team are great! They are all very communicative and understanding. They did not have a problem with accommodating me. The room was a good size and having my own bathroom was a huge plus. The kitchen had the basic necessities and the bathroom stayed stocked with supplies. My roommates were great and kept the apartment clean. There are steps but it’s not too bad (good exercise). The neighborhood is quiet and in a convenient location to restaurants, grocery stores and there’s a 24 hour laundromat across the street. I would definitely rent from Omar and his team again.', '2025-05-01 16:39:00+00'),
  (8848, 706, 1835, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'This is my sixth long stay in Omar’ listings and as always, he and his staff were very hospitable and responsive to all my requests. Looking forward to the next!', '2025-03-22 11:08:00+00'),
  (8849, 706, 969, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Very great stay! Omar and team were responsive to everything I asked. I would recommend this place to anyone', '2025-02-06 16:20:00+00'),
  (8850, 706, 807, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'perfect apartment. and very quick response for any comments.
I like this place .', '2024-11-01 16:33:00+00'),
  (8851, 706, 1363, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'The entire team was extremely responsive, accommodating, polite, and considerate. A terrific experience for my long term stay. Highly, highly recommend!!', '2024-07-30 09:37:00+00'),
  (8852, 706, 975, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Great location, about 10 mins walk to the Jackson Heights station. Laundry is across the street, supermarket is not so far also.
The team is very helpful. If you have some questions or need something, they would answer it immediately.
Our room is big and bright. Even though the room door has no key, we still can put our valuables in the closet and lock it.
The kitchen area is not so clean, also those kitchenware. So I suggest that bring your own kitchen supplies if you will stay for a long time. We also found some small cockroaches in our room and the kitchen. 
There is also a strange smell in the house, but it doesn’t bother us too much. 
Overall, we had a great stay here and highly recommend this place.', '2021-11-20 17:31:00+00'),
  (8853, 706, 1308, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'The hosts were extremely responsive, and very understanding when I needed to extend my reservation. They were always willing to fix any small issues that may or may not have arose, and they were incredibly respectful. Would definitely recommend.', '2021-10-10 21:58:00+00'),
  (8854, 706, 1833, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'My husband and I stayed here for a month. Omar and Kayo were vey responsive, they communicated very well addressing all of our concerns. The entire apartment and room was exactly as pictured, the room did not have much furniture but was very comfortable. It is close to the train station, about a 9mins walk. The neighborhood is safe, you can walk around freely. There’s a laundromat across the street which was very convenient. 
One bad thing about the building and apartment is that it has a certain smell whenever you walk in. But other than that, we enjoyed our stay!', '2021-08-08 09:34:00+00'),
  (8855, 706, 955, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Book with Omar great locations and an even better host. You’ll leave him an awesome review as well', '2021-07-03 09:21:00+00'),
  (8856, 707, 920, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Very quick and responsive and accommodating to requests. It is a little bit worn out, chipped furniture and torn out wooden. The bathroom sink was also chipped and rusty, and I always had issues with moths. The furniture was definitely not bought to be durable and it shows. The place does look exactly as the photos, it’s just older and appears very worn out, so it needs a little bit of polishing and maintenance here and there. Despite all that, host was always responsive and quick to fixing any issues/accommodating requests like providing a mirror when asked or fixing the AC, etc. it does help make up for the mentioned things above, I was very pleased with their communication 
It’s a perfect upper east location and close to plenty groceries and restaurants! The metro is also close by and it’s not a busy area so it doesn’t get too noisy. Friendly neighborhood :) would still recommend', '2023-08-02 21:38:00+00'),
  (8857, 707, 1701, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Fantastic stay in the UES. Great building, location, and apartment with all the amenities for an extended stay. Easy to get anywhere in the city either by subway or walking. Nearby you will find Central Park, Madison Ave, and Fifth Ave. There is plenty of dining, shopping, and entertainment in the surrounding neighborhood. Our host Eran was incredibly responsive, helpful, and friendly. It was exactly what we were looking for to maximize and enjoy our holidays in NYC.', '2023-01-05 14:59:00+00'),
  (8858, 707, 1204, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'I enjoyed my 5-week stay here. It’s within close walking distance of groceries, restaurants, and subway stations. The apartment is clean and nicely furnished. There’s a washer/dryer and dishwasher. I felt safe and couldn’t hear neighbors much - only street noise. There are 3 bedrooms (1 is very small) and one bathroom and a small kitchen and common area.', '2022-11-12 20:16:00+00'),
  (8859, 707, 1665, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'This is a good place to stay! Very good location, good value', '2022-10-08 08:20:00+00'),
  (8860, 707, 1226, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'The duplex is nicely decorated but small. Keep this in mind when booking, especially if more 2 people are staying there.
The check in, check out and overall communication were great! The host quickly follow up on a couple of requests we had.
The area is extremely well served with great restaurants, supermarkets and convenience stores. The 6 and Q line are 5 minutes away.
The building could benefit from a better cleaning routine and overall maintenance perspective.', '2022-03-31 19:02:00+00'),
  (8861, 707, 1856, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Not the first time with this owner and definitely not the last in case we visit again. Apartment is as described, in a very convenient location, and hosts are wonderful and helpful.', '2021-09-16 22:05:00+00'),
  (8862, 707, 1806, 5, 5, 3, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Spacious, modern unit close to everything. Outdoor dining during Covid was a breeze given the vast choice of restaurants on 2nd and 3rd Ave. Our host was available to answer questions and address issues very promptly given we were here for 2 months. We wd definitely stay here again', '2021-06-16 17:27:00+00'),
  (8863, 707, 1122, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'This apartment is absolutely wonderful! My boyfriend and I wish we could stay longer. The apartment, located in a beautiful Upper East Side neighborhood, is impeccably clean, stylishly decorated, and flooded with natural light. I especially love the open kitchen and the sleek, modern appliances. In addition, in the age of Covid, taking precautions in this apartment felt especially easy: the buzzer system lets packages and groceries be delivered right to our door (contact-free), and the washer-dryer in the unit lets us avoid communal laundry rooms (typical of most New York apartments). Moreover, for anyone working from home, there is ample room to spread out comfortably and set up home office spaces in the upstairs bedroom (with the desk) and the dining table on the bottom floor. We cannot recommend this place enough!', '2021-04-03 15:07:00+00'),
  (8864, 707, 767, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'This is a great place to stay. The apartment is very nicely decorated and the location is great! Would recommend to stay here.', '2020-02-22 12:39:00+00'),
  (8865, 708, 1874, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Place was great, price was reasonable, host is kind, and dog is cute. 
Kitchen and all are nice, and the bathroom is clean and well stocked. Wifi is also great!', '2023-11-22 11:57:00+00'),
  (8866, 708, 1290, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'Even though I suddenly was delayed from the original arrival time, she made a flexibility. And she is so friendly.', '2023-11-05 18:56:00+00'),
  (8867, 708, 1205, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'I went to Nyc for work purposes and Stella''s airbnb was cozy and exactly what you see in the pictures, I was very comfortable with my stay', '2023-10-20 20:23:00+00'),
  (8868, 708, 1181, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'A modern flat at a great location. Very convenient to get from LaGuardia airport. The ferry station is within a 10min walking distance. If you can catch a sunset while taking the ferry all the way down to Wall Street when the weather is nice, it will make a moment for you.', '2023-09-27 14:56:00+00'),
  (8869, 708, 932, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'Very quiet stay. Nice location and neighborhood.', '2023-09-15 19:16:00+00'),
  (8870, 708, 903, 4, 3, 3, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Clean place in Queens with easy access to public transportation. My boyfriend and I had a quick trip to the city for a concert. We were able to find free street parking, walk to the bus station, and had an easy time checking in and communicating with Stella. 
Great price for what you get. The space was clean and the bed was comfortable. We did not see Stella much and she kept to herself when we were in the apartment. 
Nice spot for a short visit depending on what you are trying to do. Not a lot of gluten free restaurants around, but there are some.', '2023-09-13 21:19:00+00'),
  (8871, 708, 1311, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'I enjoyed the place and the price was perfect for me.', '2023-09-11 18:59:00+00'),
  (8872, 708, 814, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 'I bet everyone could have a great time living there. The host is friendly and open to questions about the place. The location is easy to find and quiet at night. More importantly, it’s cheap and worthy!', '2023-09-09 09:45:00+00'),
  (8873, 708, 1297, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Had a great time! The place was clean, comfy and modern. Stella is friendly and laid-back. Well connected to public transport. Recommend!', '2023-09-06 09:28:00+00'),
  (8874, 708, 909, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 'The apartment was nice and clean and despite only having a divider it felt private. The area was nice and lots of cool cafes and restaurants nearby!', '2023-08-09 21:04:00+00'),
  (8875, 708, 751, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 'Everything was exactly as published. Great spot when visiting New York, highly recommend.', '2023-08-02 13:15:00+00'),
  (8876, 708, 1803, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Really liked the stay! Clean place, clear instructions, compact but met all requirements. 
Had a very cute dog, well mannered!', '2023-07-30 12:09:00+00'),
  (8877, 708, 775, 5, 3, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 'Beautiful apartment for a short stay!! Very well communicated with public transport and gorgeous views of Manhattan from the ferry', '2023-07-20 11:10:00+00'),
  (8878, 708, 966, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Stella was great! Very communicative and respected your privacy. Great neighborhood with walkable bus station and ferry so it was easy to immediately get into the city (I used this AirBnb as a base point in apartment-touring). I felt safe as a female solo traveler! Clean and very affordable for the amenities and access, I would recommend staying through-and-through.', '2023-07-14 17:39:00+00'),
  (8879, 708, 1636, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 'If you are a fan of parks and Manhattan city line view cross the river in Astoria Queens, this could be your choice. The privacy through the large screen is fine for me, as host usually in her own room and mkst of your time you may go enjoy a walkaround the park and river line and explore anyway. Even great if hou like to have some chats.', '2023-07-03 19:27:00+00'),
  (8880, 709, 1199, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'Seçil’s apartment is awesome! 
Great location that is very clean, bright, big, and cute. 
Seçil was a great host. Very friendly and easy to talk to. 
I had a great stay, highly recommended.', '2023-07-16 09:27:00+00'),
  (8881, 709, 1400, 3, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Great airbnb experience! The apartment was super clean and tastefully furnished. Theres also plenty of space in the apartment, so I overall felt I had privacy even with roommates.', '2023-06-30 21:00:00+00'),
  (8882, 709, 1390, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'I had a great stay! Felt at home and enjoyed meeting the host. Very central to heart of Brooklyn. Love the neighborhood!', '2023-06-04 13:53:00+00'),
  (8883, 709, 1370, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Secil was a fantastically wonderful host. It was a great home to stay at.', '2023-05-05 13:46:00+00'),
  (8884, 709, 1156, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Highly recommend. Seçil is really accommodating and hospitable. The location is amazing and the value is really solid. Seçil is a designer, so the space is thoughtfully put together. There’s not a ton of sound proofing, so it’s pretty easy to hear what’s happening elsewhere around the house…but everybody was very considerate, so it wasn’t a problem.', '2023-04-27 19:03:00+00'),
  (8885, 709, 918, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 'Seçil was so responsive and friendly, the space was very private and the location was convenient and well connected to the subway. The flat is absolutely charming, tho the room had a different aesthetic and was at the bottom floor.', '2023-04-10 15:23:00+00'),
  (8886, 709, 835, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Secil was the most incredible host I’ve ever had! 5 out of 5 stars!! The process was seamless from beginning to end, She was very accommodating and considerate of any needs I had. She communicated everything ahead of time, so I knew exactly what to do and where to go. Her apartment is absolutely cool, arty, impeccably clean and comfortable. The room was very big. And the laundry in the building is a big plus. The location is very easy to get to and convenient, with several subways only a few blocks away. I cannot say enough good things about my stay. It was wonderful, thank you Secil! I’d recommend this stay to anyone visiting the area.', '2023-02-17 18:41:00+00'),
  (8887, 709, 1120, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 'Secil’s place is an excellent place to stay in Newyork, clean, bright, comfortable bed, nice linens and with every amenity you can ask for. The apartment is as advertised although it was more spacious than we expected.
I would recommend this place on location alone.
The apartment is situated in the Clinton Hill/Brooklyn area. It was an easy 10 minute walk to Fort Green. There are bucket loads of bars, cafes and restaurants to choose from. A great spot especially if you want to hang in this area. If you wanna go Manhattan, the subway is across the road and other subway lines were also about 5 - 10 minutes away. I wholeheartedly recommend Secil’s apartment - you won’t be disappointed.
Thank you. Hope to stay again.', '2023-02-05 16:27:00+00'),
  (8888, 709, 1595, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Secil is a lovely, friendly host. Her space is artistic, cool and quite. Especially location is amazing. I came for a short time visiting It was really easy to commute around- 5 min to train. She is clean, responsible and super artsy!! Thank you for the gallery recommendations Secil will come back for sure.', '2023-02-03 19:23:00+00'),
  (8889, 710, 858, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, '5-star rating for all of the above. Great location, comfortable place a d great communication by the owners. Everything was fabulous. We would definitely come back here.', '2026-08-16 15:40:00+00'),
  (8890, 710, 971, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 'Beds were great, location was ideal and the AC units worked perfect. Location will bring us back.', '2026-08-10 12:49:00+00'),
  (8891, 710, 827, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Location was fantastic! Walking distance to so many great restaurants and public transport was easily accessible. Bedrooms were comfortable and a/c in rooms was very comfortable. There was a plumbing issue that made parts of the kitchen unaccessible for us so I cannot rate the kitchen but the managing staff worked with us on this.', '2026-07-12 18:01:00+00'),
  (8892, 710, 729, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We loved the apartment it was very comfortable, clean and had everything needed . Big closet , washing machine and dryer. Beds are comfortable. Super clean.
The location is the best between SoHo and village. The only thing is the noise from the street. The living room is quiet. One bedroom out of 2 is more noisy. But it did not hurt our great experience. We would love to come back .', '2026-05-20 17:04:00+00'),
  (8893, 710, 975, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Fantastic stay here. Loved the walkability and the village feel of the area. 
The apartment is as in photos, no unwelcome surprises. Well equipped with the extras, eg coffee pods, toiletries and laundry detergent, all of which we appreciated not having to go shopping for after our long haul flight from Australia. 
Comfortable beds and ample space for the two of us. 
Would stay here again for sure.', '2026-05-14 16:35:00+00'),
  (8894, 710, 1249, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'Excellent apartment in the best zone in NYC! The location is unique. You are in SoHo, surrounded by excellent restaurants, stores and the beautiful streets of SoHo. The apartment is very comfortable. The beds are good. Everything is clean and in good state. It helps you to make your trip to NYC as you are in your own home. The noise of the street is not an issue, it is typical standard noise of any big city.', '2026-05-09 18:32:00+00'),
  (8895, 710, 1716, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'We absolutely loved our stay. The location is perfect! It is definitely on the noiser side at night, so I would recommend ear plugs and a noise machine. It''s super walkable to tons of restaurants and shops. It''s a safe area. The host was very responsive and kind. We had a fantastic time!', '2026-04-01 08:17:00+00'),
  (8896, 710, 1193, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Great place to stay, convenient to everything. Felt very safe!', '2026-03-29 15:23:00+00'),
  (8897, 710, 1590, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'This apartment had a great location! It was very clean and the furniture was comfortable. The host had great recommendations too. It was fun because it felt like being part of a neighborhood.
I would bring earplugs because you hear everything from other apartments and the road noise was incredibly loud, and it made it very hard to sleep. Bedrooms were cold but space heaters are provided.', '2026-03-08 13:42:00+00'),
  (8898, 710, 1828, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great time staying at this SOHO place. The place is very clean and the location is super. Highly recommended for anyone traveling to NYC.', '2026-03-01 10:32:00+00'),
  (8899, 710, 1424, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'Had a great stay! Nice beds and great location!', '2026-02-23 21:57:00+00'),
  (8900, 710, 1049, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great apartment in a great neighborhood! Place was clean, beds were comfortable and shower was great. Would definitely recommend. Host is courteous and responsive.', '2026-02-17 15:19:00+00'),
  (8901, 710, 1794, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'This is a great location just between Soho and the West Village. A 5-10 min walk to multiple train lines, as well as tons of shopping and dining options. 
We were a family of 5 traveling for a celebration and loved the ease of cooking breakfast in the apt every AM. The in-unit washer / dryer was also super convenient. 
The hosts were proactive in their outreach throughout our stay, so it was clear that they were invested in ensuring that we had a good stay. We would definitely stay again!', '2026-01-19 12:38:00+00'),
  (8902, 710, 998, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Honestly, this house was more than I expected. Starting from the location, it was in the middle of everything. Between my favorite neighborhoods: West Village and Soho. There is a different subways close by, lots of great restaurants and the neighborhood is so cute. 
The house was super clean. We had plenty towels and sheets. We were in four people and the space felt comfortable and not crowded. The bed was very comfortable. Even the couch was great for sleeping. 
Communication was great. The host was very accessible and was very understanding helping us out with letting us leave our bags before check-in. 
Would recommend it 100%.', '2026-01-12 11:42:00+00'),
  (8903, 710, 993, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Our 7-night stay was amazing. The apartment is very well located and easy access to from various metro lines. The place was spacious, rooms great sized even for a party of 5 such as us.', '2026-01-02 12:02:00+00'),
  (8904, 711, 1437, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'Felix is an excellent host!! My family really appreciated her help with everything. The place is close to midtown which is the major hub but also not far from all other NYC landmarks. Thanks for your help with everything Felix!', '2025-10-31 08:04:00+00'),
  (8905, 711, 1905, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 'This apartment is great! Felix is also very helpful throughout this month. Definitely try for another time to stay!', '2025-09-24 18:54:00+00'),
  (8906, 711, 1360, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 3, 4, 'The apartment was decent but the neighborhood was quite rough. (Many homeless people, poop everywhere, drug usage, and constant sound of sirens) I got harassed by men quite often.', '2025-05-31 22:54:00+00'),
  (8907, 711, 864, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'I had an amazing 4 week stay! Apartment has good security system and always felt safe. The place is perfect and very spacious. Really close to the subway station and other convenience stores. Ida was very responsive and attended every concerns!', '2025-01-05 16:46:00+00'),
  (8908, 711, 1873, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'I was in NYC for work and Ida''s place was exactly as the pictures depicted.
I stayed for a month from early December to early January. Easy to check in with an elevator to the 4th floor was perfect for toting luggage. There are personnel manning the lobby from 9 pm to 2 am so I felt very safe.
The furnishings and appliances were top notch with a huge TV to relax after work...and Ida''s bed was amazingly comfortable. The apartment was super quiet, I hardly could tell there were neighbors.
The neighborhood is fun; so much to do and it was a great experience. I walked to church, walked from a Meetup social event, and many events were going on in the area, especially at Central Park which is in walking distance.
Ida was very responsive and caring of her guests'' experience.
Great find for working in or visiting NYC.', '2024-01-07 21:01:00+00'),
  (8909, 711, 1186, 5, 3, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Ida’s place is lovely and exactly as pictured. Everything that we needed was there. We didn’t have a need to contact her much during our stay but the one time we did she was very responsive. She sent us a nice message when we checked out. I would stay there again.', '2023-07-25 12:44:00+00'),
  (8910, 711, 776, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'A nice place to stay in Harlem, close to the subway station (125 st).', '2023-06-06 22:26:00+00'),
  (8911, 711, 905, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 'Ida is a breeze. Super accommodating and the place is spectacular.', '2023-05-29 08:40:00+00'),
  (8912, 711, 1450, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 3, 4, 'I strongly recommend this place. I enjoyed my stay. The host responded to my messages within 24 hours or less. The room looked like the pictures in the listing. The apartment was clean. East Harlem is East Harlem. During the day the neighborhood is safe enough, but I wouldn’t recommend taking a stroll through Wagner Houses or Jefferson Houses at night. The trains and busses are a short walk away. There is a deli nearby and two grocery stores across the street. There’s a place to do laundry in the building, but if you don’t feel like doing your own laundry, there’s a laundromat nearby. Plenty of good places to eat within walking distance. The upper east side, midtown, and soho are only a few stops away on the train. Getting to and from LGA or JFK via public transportation is inexpensive and easy. I’d recommend this apartment over an NYC hotel any day.', '2023-05-21 16:13:00+00'),
  (8913, 711, 945, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I stayed at Ida’s place while solo traveling and it was a very comfortable experience. The apartment is a 5 minute walk away from the metro station and within 25 minutes you can be downtown. I would definitely stay there again and I am very thankful to Ida for being a great host.', '2023-05-04 22:41:00+00'),
  (8914, 711, 1573, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Ida was such. A fabulous host from the start, super responsive and friendly and also very thoughtful. My daughter and I were set to arrive earlier in the day and she made arrangements to make sure we were well taken care of at check-in. Her place was clean, convenient, and she made every detail work well by informing us along the way. Really enjoyed her ability to be so kind and responsive. We had to leave early due to unexpected events and she was also so kind and accommodating through that. Thank you Ida. We truly appreciate you being such a wonderful host. 🙏🏽', '2023-04-24 10:36:00+00'),
  (8915, 711, 1808, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Ida made our stay in The Big Apple an enjoyable one. She was very responsive and friendly, and also gave us great recommendations in regards to nearby restaurants and local attractions. The place itself was quite cozy and true the pictures posted. It''s also bigger than your average Manhattan apartment, which is a big plus. I''d definitely stay again when visiting!!', '2023-01-01 10:12:00+00'),
  (8916, 711, 1261, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'What an awesome space! Absolutely loved it. It exceeded expectations. Great host, great space, perfect location. I will definitely book here again!💯', '2022-11-14 19:52:00+00'),
  (8917, 711, 980, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Ida was an incredible host - kind, communicative and genuinely accommodating. Her place was clean, well equipped and conveniently located for a pleasant stay. Thank you for making my first visit to New York all the more enjoyable :)', '2022-11-08 20:36:00+00'),
  (8918, 711, 1848, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'We enjoyed our stay in Ida''s apartment. The location in Harlem is great with a nice grocery store across the way and easy access to the subways, Lenox Avenue. The host has the essentials for cooking. The building and neighborhood quiet down nicely at night. There is a beautiful rooftop social area with views of the neighborhood. We were surprised to find the building under renovation that started early in the mornings, but we learned to live with it.', '2022-10-12 15:09:00+00'),
  (8919, 712, 1882, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'my stay at Benjamins was awesome, the location, the apartment was super quiet & calm, very convenient & nicely designed. Communication with Eva was outstanding, was perfect, thanks Eva & look forward to returning.', '2025-04-14 22:21:00+00'),
  (8920, 712, 1261, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We were very pleased with Eva’s apartment. The location was perfect and close to everything. It also felt very safe for our daughter who was interning in NYC for the summer. The Elevator/Doormen were all very kind and helpful. The apartment was comfortable and the art and decor was eclectic. 
Would absolutely stay here again.', '2024-08-17 14:45:00+00'),
  (8921, 712, 1076, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'Ben’s apartment has a great atmosphere. It gets a lot of light, has a very comfortable bed, and the shower is wonderful (not always the case in NYC bathrooms). The location of the building is perfect. Several subway lines within a block’s walk. And there is an elevator attendant on duty 24/7, so it always feels secure.', '2024-04-21 20:46:00+00'),
  (8922, 712, 857, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Ben was a great host - very responsive and proactive about check in/check out, etc. The place was also great! Very spacious for New York and the location was ideal.', '2023-11-19 09:48:00+00'),
  (8923, 712, 1829, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 'Ben’s place was awesome. Our daughter was there for a summer internship for seven weeks. The place was very safe, the doormen were attentive and friendly. Place is even bigger than the pictures.
Ben was responsive, friendly, and communicative.
Book this place without hesitation.', '2023-07-21 15:01:00+00'),
  (8924, 712, 895, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 'I stayed at Ben’s place for seven weeks during the summer. Amazing location just steps from the 1, 2, and 3 trains and a block from the A. The apartment gets great sunlight and was quiet the whole time. A/C worked great. Chelsea was exciting with a restaurant or bar every ten feet. Loved my time here—would absolutely recommend.', '2021-08-01 18:51:00+00'),
  (8925, 712, 1534, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'We had a great stay in Eva’s studio. The location is fantastic, right near plenty of subway lines including the L/1/M/F. Plus you’re a short walk from many awesome spots in Chelsea and the West Village (which is where we primarily wanted to visit). The space is clean with artful, zen decoration, a nice shower, and a particularly comfortable mattress. It was great to come back to after a day of hitting the city or a nice evening out.', '2020-01-01 20:54:00+00'),
  (8926, 712, 1115, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'This was the perfect place to land in Manhattan - very clean, neat, and very stylishly appointed. For NYC, the studio has lots of natural light and was very quiet. The location as well cannot be beat - extremely walkable to all of the best restaurants, coffee shops, and quick access to the other great neighborhoods of the city and trains. Check in couldn’t have been easier and Ben was extremely clear and responsive. Would definitely recommend and stay here again!', '2019-09-06 17:47:00+00'),
  (8927, 712, 1615, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Ben was a great host and promptly answered any questions we had. Check in was easy and the location wS fantastic. We were close to shops, supermarkets, restaurants and the subway. The doorman was very friendly and helped with any questions. There was no cable TV which would have been nice. Otherwise a comfortable stay for two people. Thank you!', '2019-07-29 16:59:00+00'),
  (8928, 712, 764, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Good location, close to Chelsea market, high line, was a great set-up for us to attend conference in midtown all week, host was available and responsive.', '2019-05-25 20:18:00+00'),
  (8929, 712, 1532, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Really good apartment , very well decorated. Ideal location. Ben was really responsive and helpful. Highly recommended', '2019-04-27 15:09:00+00'),
  (8930, 712, 1661, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'All time high Airbnb experience! Eva`s Chelsea Studio was great positioned in the New York grid. The apartment has a relaxing energy with is stylish and with quality furniture and materials. It is oriented towards a courtyard that provides a silent atmosphere. Communication was effective and smooth check in/out. Highly recommended! Would love to come back!', '2019-04-22 21:47:00+00'),
  (8931, 712, 1619, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Ben is a terrific host, easy to communicate with, and has the perfect apartment for a stay in the heart of Chelsea / West Village. A+', '2019-03-20 21:14:00+00'),
  (8932, 712, 1862, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Ben is the most responsive host I’ve ever stayed at. Flexible, communicates fast and easy. The place is amazing, convenient, stylish, clean and in the best location.', '2019-02-28 13:51:00+00'),
  (8933, 712, 1248, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Cute space in a great location. I''d definitely recommend it.', '2019-02-15 19:21:00+00'),
  (8934, 713, 1181, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Our stay at Elin’s was perfect. The pictures were accurate. It was clean, had everything we needed and was very spacious for a studio. We lived hanging a king bed. Our favorite spot was the window seat looking out onto the street. There was street noise but by 10pm the neighborhood was quiet. The brownstone itself was extremely quiet. Close to a few great restaurants, a Key food and laundromat. A quick 10 minute walk to the A/C train. Elin was very responsive to our needs and communicated quickly. 100% recommend Elin’s place.', '2025-08-07 10:46:00+00'),
  (8935, 713, 1849, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Gorgeous apartment, great location in the heart of bed stuy. Lots of nice cafes, shops, bars etc nearby. I loved staying here - the bay window lets in lots of lovely natural light. Super comfy huge bed!', '2025-04-25 21:33:00+00'),
  (8936, 713, 1540, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, '+ great value
+ extremely communicative and helpful host
+ AC was amazing
+ spacious studio
+ great lighting from outside
+ prolly the most comfy bed I''ve ever slept in
+ safe neighborhood and close to AC train/citibike
- no microwave
- not a big fan of the chairs (they''re pretty sharp/old)', '2024-08-08 15:57:00+00'),
  (8937, 713, 1153, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great neighborhood and easy to get to the subway. Apartment was missing some amenities that were listed and the host was very slow to respond or unresponsive.', '2024-06-23 20:15:00+00'),
  (8938, 713, 1771, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Elin’s stay is located on a charming, tree-lined block in the heart of Bed-Stuy. It’s within walking distance of the A/C trains — both of which run fairly often. The stay itself was very clean and the bed was among the most comfortable I’ve ever slept on. Was definitely worth what I paid.', '2024-05-11 13:43:00+00'),
  (8939, 713, 1149, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We stayed at this apartment for a little
over a month. The area is great, close walk to the subway and some good coffee shops & restaurants around. 
The bed was very comfortable it’s not the one shown in the pictures it’s a king! 
When we arrived the apartment had a strongish smell of paint or chemicals it slowly faded but was mostly present. We also requested a broom or a vacuum from the hosts but they never responded and we had some
Issues with water and plumbing that were either slow to be resolved or not at all. We stayed there over the holidays and there were a couple loud karaoke parties in the building but only on the festive a days.', '2024-01-18 14:51:00+00'),
  (8940, 713, 918, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We loved Jasons apartment! Great to explore Brooklyn from. Check-in was super easy and the bed is probably the best I have ever slept in. It was also no problem to check-out late the day we left.', '2023-12-08 11:33:00+00'),
  (8941, 713, 1246, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'Had such an amazing stay here! The place was beautiful and very clean!', '2023-11-04 10:07:00+00'),
  (8942, 713, 1127, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Had an overall great stay! The apartment was super cute and the bed was very comfortable. Elin was also really accommodating when we had a flight change! If you plan to spend a ton of time in Manhattan, this might feel a little far away. But we explored a lot of spots in Brooklyn, so it was great for that.', '2023-08-26 14:01:00+00'),
  (8943, 713, 1163, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'A lovely place to stay for our first trip to NYC. Very responsive and accomodating hosts, super comfy bed, well decorated apartment, a lovely and quiet neighbourhood, close to subway and the highly recommended local Italian restaurant and bakery Saraghina was excellent. Thank you Elin and Jeff for a very pleasant stay. Highly recommend your apartment for a nice stay in NYC ❤️', '2023-08-21 20:51:00+00'),
  (8944, 713, 1310, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I loved the staying and the place was awesome. So lovely, seemed like a Pinterest picture haha Elin was always responsive and helped when I needed something. It’s a really residential place, not close to lots of stores or market places, but it was good and close to the Utica metro station. I would definetly go there again!', '2023-08-12 18:36:00+00'),
  (8945, 713, 1104, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'We enjoyed our stay here, it was super handy for the subway and felt like a safe neighbourhood. Elin was quick to respond to messages and sent recommendations for cafe/restaurant close by. The apartment could do with a little TLC as feels a bit worn and I’d have liked a full length mirror, apart from that, everything was spot on! Thanks 😄', '2023-07-12 15:44:00+00'),
  (8946, 713, 937, 4, 5, 4, 5, 3, 5, 4, 'The apartment is in a great location, nicely decorated and laid out, and a great base to explore Brooklyn. The bed is super comfy too!', '2023-06-28 20:32:00+00'),
  (8947, 713, 1836, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'The space is beautiful, and Elin was very responsive and communicative.', '2023-06-21 08:36:00+00'),
  (8948, 713, 1619, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 'Had a wonderful stay here. Exactly as described. Elin was very responsive and helpful at the time of check in. The studio is in a beautiful neighborhood, easily walkable to several cafes, a few restuarants as well as the subway. Highly recommend.', '2023-06-17 21:48:00+00'),
  (8949, 714, 1063, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'We really enjoyed our time here. The space was just the right size for the two of us, it was clean and airy with lots of natural light, and the location in Williamsburg, just one block from McCarren Park, was ideal. Best of all, whenever we had a question, our host Maria Aino and her family were responsive, friendly, and eager to make our stay as pleasant as possible.', '2026-07-31 11:12:00+00'),
  (8950, 714, 962, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'My husband, baby and I had wonderful stay at M Aino''s place, which was comfortable and spotless. The apartment is also in a great location, one block from McCarren park and an easy walk to coffee shops and restaurnants in Greenpoint, Williamsburg and East Williamsburg. Our hosts were very kind, welcoming and easy to communicate with whenever we needed anything. I would happily stay there again!', '2025-11-08 17:58:00+00'),
  (8951, 714, 1364, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Mariana, Aino, and Carlos''s place was perfect. They were extremely responsive and helpful from start to finish. The unit was so comfortable and spacious. It had an office where I could work, a comfortable bedroom, and a living room/kitchen with everything I needed. The private patio was a gem of an addition. It was a block away from McCarren park which was ideal for me and dog. I really can''t say enough great things about the unit and the hosts. You won''t be disappointed here. Nothing but gratitude for the experience. I hope to return soon.', '2025-10-04 21:52:00+00'),
  (8952, 714, 1579, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great apartment in a beautiful central neighborhood! Would stay again', '2025-09-03 16:41:00+00'),
  (8953, 714, 1813, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I stayed and worked remotely from the apartment for two months. It’s in an excellent location in Williamsburg and well suited for remote work. The hosts were exceptionally responsive. I had one minor issue during my stay, which was fully resolved in less than 30 minutes from my initial message. The building itself is quiet with very respectful and welcoming neighbors. 
Overall, I enjoyed a very pleasant stay and highly recommend the apartment and hosts.', '2025-05-28 16:28:00+00'),
  (8954, 714, 1107, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Very responsive hosts - great location and place to stay', '2025-01-01 20:58:00+00'),
  (8955, 714, 1831, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'This apartment was perfect for my month-long stay. It was really important that I was in a quiet and safe area, that was also dog friendly. I felt so comfortable here, and the neighborhood is very safe! The apartment is clean and modern, with plenty of natural light. My hosts were extremely helpful, and very responsive to any questions I had. Can’t thank them enough for being an important part of such a memorable trip.', '2024-11-05 12:36:00+00'),
  (8956, 714, 1774, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'The airbnb was in a great location, close to McCarren park. The hosts were very responsive and communicative. Overall we enjoyed our stay very much.', '2024-09-28 14:33:00+00'),
  (8957, 714, 1705, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Excellent spot. Great location in Wburg. Very spacious 1BR with terrace. Very safe building. Outstanding communication from owners. Could not be more pleased.', '2024-05-23 12:57:00+00'),
  (8958, 715, 1104, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'The location was excellent, the room cleaning was good, I would definitely recommend this Airbnb to anyone!', '2026-08-30 14:10:00+00'),
  (8959, 715, 938, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 'Amazing location for a great price. We had a great time exploring the city and always having a nice place to come back to. Very clean and the rooftop view is one to remember.', '2026-07-21 22:18:00+00'),
  (8960, 715, 1313, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Thoroughly enjoyed our 11-day stay at this Airbnb. Good value, great location with many restaurants nearby as well as public transport being easily accessible. The apartment was exceptionally clean, and clutter-free with good storage space for clothes, personal affects, and suitcases. The apartment is very well designed with loads of light and incredible views through windows that make up most of one of the walls in the living room and bedroom. Clean and easy-to-use laundry room in basement. The only possible improvement may be better sheets (sheets were polyester) and softer pillows (but having said this, bed was still extremely comfortable with a beautiful view over lower Manhattan).', '2026-01-21 19:51:00+00'),
  (8961, 715, 1145, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Loved this place! Way bigger than shown in the photos. Communication wasn’t the best but overall wonderful stay :)', '2026-01-08 15:13:00+00'),
  (8962, 715, 1500, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Close to subway, Chinatown, and Nolita. Spacious studio and bathroom. However, this place is not quiet at all. One night there were people fighting and yelling in the hallways at 3am and another night a crazy person next door was screaming at 2am which was very scary and concerning. If you’re a light sleeper, bring earplugs and sleep early. You can hear the neighbors talking and slamming the door due to thin walls and the sound of water running all the time. There was hair in the sink drain when we first arrived. Only had one chair for two people. The TV would randomly turn on/off at which made us felt like someone was watching us. The bed was too soft and would sink where you sit. Provided very little toiletries like toilet paper and soap for 1 week stay. Overall, only stay here if you prioritize convenience for travelling outside rather than staying in your room to relax.', '2026-01-02 15:32:00+00'),
  (8963, 715, 1395, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Nice place in a convenient location. Communication isn’t great but would still stay here again.', '2025-10-16 08:06:00+00'),
  (8964, 715, 788, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'I would have given it a 5 star review but this was the 2nd worse host experience I''ve had. And I''m a perpetual traveler.
Just know that the place is awesome but that the host takes up to a day to respond, if at all.
For 3 days I had to leave the apartment door unlocked due to problems with the door. The staff in the building told me that that''s a known problem and that there''s not one host but a team who deals with the message....and boy did it show that they don''t care!!', '2025-09-03 22:35:00+00'),
  (8965, 715, 1436, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great location, easy communication and instruction, clean and spacious apartment and the rooftop was the cherry on top.', '2025-08-25 22:36:00+00'),
  (8966, 715, 729, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Really great place to stay! It was a lot more spacious than I expected, possibly was upgraded without knowing, and the kitchen had a nice assortment of appliances, dinnerware, and cooking utensils. Plenty of toiletries, extra towels and toilet paper, and it was generally pretty quiet. I will say that the office chair felt a bit unstable, and there was a time or two where the elevator would not come up to my floor but I’d definitely still recommend!', '2025-08-04 09:52:00+00'),
  (8967, 715, 736, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 'It’s a great place! Very comfy and clean. Jennifer provided all the necessary information needed for the check in/out. If it was worth the money paid is probably controversial. It is def expensive but it is Manhattan 🤷🏽‍♂️', '2025-07-14 18:28:00+00'),
  (8968, 715, 863, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'It was a comfortable stay with plenty to do in the area. Aside from some expected street noise the building was quiet, so it was easy to relax and rest. It was really nice that there were pots and pans available to use if you felt like cooking. It was very easy to check in and any questions we had were answered promptly.', '2025-05-11 09:00:00+00'),
  (8969, 715, 1603, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Had an excellent stay at this apartment! Really convenient and clean, good wifi too!', '2025-03-15 12:48:00+00'),
  (8970, 715, 750, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Perfect little place ! Great location ! Super value for NYC…have already recommended it to friends. 
Could have had more kitchen tools, I like to cook, New York is too expensive to be dining out everyday.
Could also have had some cleaning products. I like to leave spaces as I found it.
There is a desk, a little office lamp was missing, would have been a nice bonus. 
The lamp provided makes the space very cosy, lighting is so important, for me anyway…
Good experience overall, would definitely rent it again.', '2025-02-28 15:26:00+00'),
  (8971, 715, 1549, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'The best place to stay in New York, very clean , quiet place, nice location, definitely would stay again!', '2025-02-22 22:25:00+00'),
  (8972, 715, 1508, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'This place was perfect for our Manhattan focused trip. Was no more than a 10 minute walk to the subway where it was easy to get anywhere we wanted to go. Chinese and Italian food-spots galore. Room was private and easy to check-in/Out. Highly recommended!', '2024-12-10 22:43:00+00'),
  (8973, 716, 1742, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Good location and friendly responsive host, but the hot tap water was leaking to the floor and we saw a few cockroaches in the kitchen. Maybe that is normal in New York. Host tried to repair the leaking tap and even washed our dishes, but it might need larger maintenance to make it work properly.', '2023-11-05 15:13:00+00'),
  (8974, 716, 1426, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'We had a wonderful stay in this spacious and clean appartment. Clara was a friendly and helpful host. The location near subway, bus, restaurants, and supermarket is excellent.', '2023-10-27 09:35:00+00'),
  (8975, 716, 1450, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Thank you Clara, for everything! Our staying was amazing!!! Me and my friends appreciate how helpful you were! We really recommend this place 😊🤗😀😃', '2023-10-08 21:43:00+00'),
  (8976, 716, 851, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'The apartment is good reachable with Metro. Everything was clean. We missed some kitchen utensils e.g. Saladbowl , spatula.', '2023-10-02 08:03:00+00'),
  (8977, 716, 818, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Nice place, good beds, easy to reach subway. Close to grocery shopping (Whole food and Lidl)', '2023-09-25 20:17:00+00'),
  (8978, 716, 1876, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'We stayed here for five days, and were more than satisfied with the location, easy access to the metro and the apartment itself.', '2023-09-19 18:26:00+00'),
  (8979, 716, 1308, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 'We very much enjoyed staying at Clara''s place. The apartment is in a traditional New York building and is clean and spacious with AC in each room (two bedrooms and a large living room + kitchen). The location is very good - only one block away from the subway station on 125th Street (15 mins to Times Square) and a good supermarket (Whole Foods), and you can walk to Central Park in 10-15 mins. Clara was friendly and responsive. We would certainly recommend the apartment!', '2023-09-11 19:43:00+00'),
  (8980, 716, 1573, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Clara was a great, responsive and communicative host, responsive to all my group’s questions. The property was really lovely and in a great location for a visit to Harlem. Definitely worth reserving!', '2023-08-21 13:26:00+00'),
  (8981, 716, 958, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Great place for your stay in NYC. Just consider that you have to go upstairs until the last floor. 
The place is spacious and clean, and you have all the amenities. 
Subway station 2 blocks away, and a lot of restaurants.', '2023-07-16 14:42:00+00'),
  (8982, 716, 1710, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 3, 'Clara was a great host. He was very responsive and met us for check in late in the evening after our flight was delayed. He was always available on site but also respected our privacy. He even kept our bags after checkout on the last day when we had a late departure. The neighborhood is friendly with both box stores (Whole Foods) and great local spots (Harlem Shake and Harlem Breakfast Club). We would stay here again.', '2023-07-15 15:51:00+00'),
  (8983, 716, 1354, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 'The unit was very spacious and clean. Stayed with my Dad, my wife and two kids. Kids had plenty of space to play around. The only small drawback was the unit being at 4th floor without any elevators. Clara is a great host and always available for anything you need.', '2023-07-07 16:07:00+00'),
  (8984, 716, 962, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Lovely place to stay for myself and my small child. Great neighborhood: tons of excellent food and drink and a very charming city park just a block away. Super easy access to the rest of Manhattan and not hard to get to Brooklyn or Queens (and don''t underestimate the power of local busses if you''re traveling within Harlem or to the UWS). Clara was a great host and was helpful when I had questions/concerns, of which I had few.', '2023-06-26 14:45:00+00'),
  (8985, 716, 1559, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 'Clara’s place was spotlessly clean. Well located in Harlem near the park. We found the front door left ajar twice, once all night. Broken bedside lamp. In all adequate.', '2023-06-18 15:10:00+00'),
  (8986, 716, 1529, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 'Only problem was we couldn’t access the wifi but overall we felt comfortable staying there and always responded promptly when we needed help around the apartment', '2023-06-08 19:10:00+00'),
  (8987, 716, 1590, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 3, 'Clara was a really great host. The apartment was very nice and clean, and the space was even more spacious than on the photos. It is close to metro, just a few minutes away so that you are very fast in the city. We enjoyed our stay at Sergos house.', '2023-05-28 22:35:00+00'),
  (8988, 717, 1436, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I had such a wonderful stay at Pedro''s apartment! He gave me super clear instructions that made checking in a breeze, and he was always so helpful whenever I needed anything. Would definitely recommend staying here.', '2026-08-29 11:52:00+00'),
  (8989, 717, 1112, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'My husband and i had wonderful time at Pedro''s place. It exceeded pur expectations in terms of how spacious, user friendly and fabulously located it was. Literally a home away from home💞
Both Jenn and Pedro responded instantly to any queries that we had, and just made us feel really welcome.', '2026-06-12 14:25:00+00'),
  (8990, 717, 1382, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Wow what a fabulous three months we had at Pedro''s ideal Prospect Heights apartment. My husband and I were there during a home reno and half way through our stay we wondered why didn''t just move to Brooklyn! The apartment was perfect for working from home - large roomy desk; great internet; lots of shelves and room for a big monitor. The location is ideal - so close to Prospect Park. We took our dog there every morning. Close to groceries, restaurants and we joined a fabulous super nice gym. Pedro''s family is super friendly but gives you space. Pedro was immediately responsive and the kitchen had everything we needed to cook meals. Also, close to the subway which was so easy to navigate. We had a car but no problem moving it a few times a week. The neighbors were friendly - would love to make our visit an annual one!', '2026-01-09 10:25:00+00'),
  (8991, 717, 1265, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'We totally loved our stay at Pedro and Jenn’s in Prospect Heights. The urban location was wonderful in terms of local coffee shops, bakeries, restaurants, bars and convenience to Prospect Park for running and serenity. The apartment was very attractive with excellent kitchen appliances and laundry facilities. This is an idyllic spot if you are seeking to experience the joys of Brooklyn in a safe and comfortable setting!', '2025-08-18 14:05:00+00'),
  (8992, 717, 1199, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'This was one of our favorite AirBnB stays. The apartment was perfect for our 1 month stay in Brooklyn. It has a lot of space, an extremely comfortable king size bed, and a kitchen that has all you need to cook. It was impressive how much cookware was available! We also loved the location and being close to the beautiful prospect park. Pedro has a dog too named Roxie that we loved and will miss dearly. Everything with checkin and checkout smoothly and we highly recommend it.', '2024-12-11 13:30:00+00'),
  (8993, 717, 824, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Pedro is an outstanding host while being friendly and super communicative. We had no issues with the stay and anything that came up, Pedro was quick to respond! I would absolutely stay here again for the neighborhood and the host. Thank you!', '2024-09-27 14:13:00+00'),
  (8994, 717, 1202, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'I had an incredible stay at this charming brownstone apartment. It''s very spacious inside, and it''s on one of the most idyllic and pretty blocks of Brooklyn. Pedro and his family are all very friendly and welcoming. Great king size bed that''s extremely comfortable. Lovely backyard and a fun picnic table out front. Neighborhood has great restaurants and I love being close to the park and museum. Highly recommend staying here.', '2024-06-10 08:44:00+00'),
  (8995, 717, 1082, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'My wife and I stayed here for six weeks and had a wonderful time. The apartment was spacious, clean, and well stocked. Pedro and his family were gracious and communicative hosts. The block is beautiful and is just a short walk away from restaurants, stores, and two subway stations. Recommended for a long-term stay!', '2024-05-01 09:33:00+00'),
  (8996, 717, 901, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Pedro and his family were wonderful hosts. I spent 2 months here and really enjoyed it. The location is outstanding and the unit is spacious, beautiful, well decorated, and fully stocked. Pedro was always quick to respond and very helpful for resolving small issues with the heating etc. My dog loved the place too! :) Highly recommend for anyone looking for a temporary home base in Brooklyn.', '2024-01-15 22:21:00+00'),
  (8997, 718, 862, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'All in all, a great stay in a beautiful neighborhood, and I hope to do it again next year!
Daniel''s apartment was very much as represented, comfortable, clean and peaceful. I had requested that the space be low- or no-fragrance, and this worked out fairly well. 
The small difficulties were not her fault: the keypad entry to the building is very fussy, and my cell phone failed as I arrived, really not helpful! But it did work out very well overall and I had an excellent trip.', '2023-09-04 09:37:00+00'),
  (8998, 718, 1030, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'Clean, quiet and spacious place
Easy to get to the park and botanic gardens
Would definitely recommend', '2023-07-11 15:26:00+00'),
  (8999, 718, 1068, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 'great size room, privacy and top location situated moments from the beautiful Prospect Park and the 2min to train station Q,B and S. Highly recommend to anyone seeking a quiet location, with easy access to all of Brooklyn and Manhattan.', '2023-07-07 08:42:00+00'),
  (9000, 718, 1180, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 'Daniel''s place was great for a long term stay! Very clean and large room. Only things I would note are that the apartment smells strongly of incense and Daniel plays music often.', '2023-07-01 16:59:00+00');

INSERT INTO reviews (booking_id, listing_id, guest_id, rating, cleanliness_rating, accuracy_rating, check_in_rating, communication_rating, location_rating, value_rating, comment, created_at) VALUES
  (9001, 718, 1714, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 'Had a wonderful time staying here. The apartment is huge and in a great location! Loved the decor!', '2022-12-31 17:51:00+00'),
  (9002, 718, 1171, 4, 4, 4, 5, 3, 4, 5, 'I stayed in Daniel''s apartment long term, for about 4 months. It was a very safe and comfortable space for me, and Daniel was very welcoming. It was a pleasure to get to know her and hear her play her music daily. 
The room is gorgeous, with tall ceilings, a good sized closet and desk area. The apartment has been updated since the photos on here were taken, so the apartment does not look like the photos but it is still beautiful. 
The location was absolutely perfect- right next to the Subway, Prospect Park, grocery store and laundromat. 
I would love to stay here again. Thank you Daniel!', '2022-12-23 15:27:00+00'),
  (9003, 718, 754, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 'Daniel is a wonderful host -- she''s a talented musician and a nice conversationalist. I really appreciate Daniel''s flexibility. Her place is also beautiful and conveniently located just half a block from a subway station.', '2022-09-06 09:54:00+00'),
  (9004, 718, 916, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Great location, nice host, perfect room. Would absolutely recommend it and would try to stay here again.', '2022-08-25 20:41:00+00'),
  (9005, 718, 1551, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Nice location. Camilla’s space is spotless, she’s was really nice.
Place’s do not look like the photo, still quite nice though.', '2022-08-21 17:05:00+00'),
  (9006, 718, 1588, 5, 5, 4, 4, 3, 4, 5, 'A gem of a place. What I’d give to stay in a place like this permanently.', '2022-08-10 15:17:00+00'),
  (9007, 718, 725, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'Great space to call home in Brooklyn. Perfect location right by Prospect Park. Lincoln Market is just a block away for all your grocery needs and cute little coffee shops are close by for your caffeine needs.
Daniel was very responsive to any questions or requests. Definitely recommend for anyone to stay here during their visit to NYC.', '2022-07-29 19:11:00+00'),
  (9008, 718, 910, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Daniel’s place was clean, cozy and definitely more spacious than most flats around the area. The location is also very close to a lot of metro lines! Would recommend!', '2021-12-12 22:29:00+00'),
  (9009, 718, 1718, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'I had a wonderful stay at this apartment. The room is really spacious and Daniel was super flexible with my schedule. Just across the street from Prospect Park and one block from the subway station. I would definitely come back ¡Gracias por todo, Daniel!', '2021-12-07 14:21:00+00'),
  (9010, 718, 1858, 5, 5, 4, 3, 4, 4, 5, 'Great host. My mother-in-law was very comfortable. Thanks, Daniel.', '2021-11-30 10:48:00+00'),
  (9011, 718, 1146, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 'Daniel''s place is such a great space in a nice location, extremely close to public transport. The apartment is nicely decorated, the bed is comfortable and the room is spacious and cozy. It was a great atmosphere to be in. I recommend booking this place.', '2021-11-21 14:39:00+00'),
  (9012, 719, 1644, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'A very cozy place with all the amenities listed. Shirin was extremely responsive and helpful even during extreme weather events. He immediately sent over people to fix any issues that we raised and was always reachable and friendly.', '2026-02-20 17:11:00+00'),
  (9013, 719, 1277, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I stayed here for five months whilst studying at Brooklyn College and I cannot recommend more!! April and Shirin are the kindest, most responsive hosts ever and the flat is the most amazing space. There is ample room for a student and the location is safe and commutable into the city. 10/10 would recommend!!!!', '2026-01-10 14:47:00+00'),
  (9014, 719, 1603, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'We loved our stay! She was so very responsive and helpful!', '2024-07-29 21:32:00+00'),
  (9015, 719, 1328, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Very homey and close to the subway! The host was super responsive and made sure my stay was seamless. The apartment was cozy and had everything I needed for a comfortable stay. The only downside was the thin walls – I could hear everything from the neighbors, which was a bit unsettling at first. Otherwise, I highly recommend staying with Shirin!', '2024-04-02 18:56:00+00'),
  (9016, 719, 1802, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Shirin and April were amazing hosts. They were incredibly fast to respond to all messages throughout our entire stay. Super friendly and helpful with all our questions and needs. The apartment was just as described and completely spotless. The area was convenient and walkable with a big Target just a 5 minute walk away and a good number of restaurants. The subway was also less than a 5-minute walk away. A great experience all around!', '2023-12-17 14:00:00+00'),
  (9017, 719, 1355, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great place really comfortable a lot of living room space and plenty of space in the rooms as well. It has both a Target and an Aldi for groceries and a couple of fast food options really close (2 blocks walking) as well as the end of the 2/5 Metro Station (its about 30 to 45 mins to Manhattan depending on the station).', '2023-06-17 18:27:00+00'),
  (9018, 719, 1251, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Staying with Shirin was wonderful! My friend and I stayed here for a few months for our semester "abroad" in NYC, and this place worked out really well. Location was great to get groceries and to hop on the subway, and there was a lot of space inside the apartment to get comfortable as well. Shirin and April were always super helpful if we had a question or needed anything - I would recommend staying here for sure! (just be sure to get out of the apartment once and a while - the 1 window in the place is a little tough, but my only complaint!)', '2023-05-23 20:37:00+00'),
  (9019, 719, 725, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Definitely this was an amazing choice. Shirin is the best and the place is beautiful. Having the possibility to wash our clothes makes all the difference! Everything was easy to use, we felt super comfortable. I had to work from there during some days and the little desk with the chair was the perfect spot for that. Of course, the fast internet was super helpful too.
Thank you for being so kind and for letting us stay in your beautiful place. We had an amazing time, we felt like home!', '2022-11-27 19:28:00+00'),
  (9020, 719, 1092, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Another amazing stay at this AirBnB…….the hosts (Shirin & April) go out of their way to ensure you’re comfortable…….and the location provides quick access to everything you’ll need.', '2022-11-02 22:08:00+00'),
  (9021, 719, 1911, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'it was very nice, modern and cozy place to stay as a pictured. kitchen and utensils were very useful.
near lot of groceries and foods.
near to MTA flatbush a-brooklyn college, about 30min to manhattan. safe environment. there are also police nearby every night.
April was so kind and communicative.
Thanks April.', '2022-10-03 21:53:00+00'),
  (9022, 719, 1335, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'The apartment is a basement apartment. It''s very clean and well furnished. There''s a subway station and supermarkets close by which is great. As for April, she''s very responsive and nice, she even left some toys and accessories for my son to use/play with during our stay, very appreciated. I recommend this place!', '2022-09-03 15:23:00+00'),
  (9023, 719, 1092, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 'Very clean, comfortable, and modern AirBnB that’s located in a central location with easy/quick access to public transit.
The host (April) is super supportive and quick to answer any queries that may arise.
We had a pleasant experience and wouldn’t hesitate to recommend to others and/or stay here again.', '2022-08-26 20:33:00+00'),
  (9024, 719, 1631, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Wonderful communication with us- answering quickly and clearly. The location is definitely convenient with the subway, target, and other restaurants close by! Place was neat and provided pretty much all we needed. Thanks again!', '2022-08-16 09:27:00+00'),
  (9025, 719, 1578, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'This is a really nice and well furnished semi-basement unit at a prime location in Brooklyn with easy and quick access to public transportation. April was always very prompt and communicative whenever we needed any help.', '2022-07-31 18:28:00+00'),
  (9026, 719, 1809, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Near lots of food / shopping. Clean, well-stocked, and April was very communicative and kind!', '2022-06-19 08:45:00+00'),
  (9027, 720, 1561, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Our group had an excellent stay at Lucas''s place while attending the US Open tennis tournament just a few miles away. The apartment is close to markets, bars, cafes, and public transit--we did not need a rental car. It was very clean and had everything we needed, including an air mattress and extra linens . Lucas was super helpful and quick to respond to all questions, but especially when we learned one person in our party was not able to go, and making necessary changes for someone else to join our group. Would definitely book again--thanks, Lucas!!', '2026-09-02 16:44:00+00'),
  (9028, 720, 1339, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'It was a wonderful stay. The host was very responsive and handled any issues promptly. The house was clean, spacious, and very well equipped for cooking. The location was great as well, with easy access to Flushing. Overall, we had a very pleasant experience and would definitely recommend staying here.', '2026-08-13 20:45:00+00'),
  (9029, 720, 1339, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'We needed a two-bedroom apartment with a living room, so we ended up finding this place. The neighborhood is quiet and convenient, with many ways to get to Main Street. There are also plenty of places to eat and shop nearby.', '2026-08-06 17:33:00+00'),
  (9030, 720, 1134, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Lucas''s place was great. Loved the space, was very clean, safe area and close to restaurante. This is my second time staying in Jays apartment and hopefully when I return to Queens I would love to book again.', '2026-07-21 13:44:00+00'),
  (9031, 720, 1300, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 'Had a great stay, was exactly what our family needed in terms of location and access to walkable restaurants.', '2026-07-15 13:59:00+00'),
  (9032, 720, 1041, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Lucas is a great host—friendly, responsive, and very easy to communicate with. He addressed our concerns promptly and handled everything professionally. We really appreciated his kindness and understanding. Thank you again, Lucas!', '2026-07-02 21:30:00+00'),
  (9033, 720, 990, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Great apartment in Queens with 2 separated bedrooms. The naberhood have everything that you need. Transport is well organized and the apartment is close to retail park with a lot of shops. The host was very nice and repsnd quickly. We enjoyed our stay and recommend it.', '2026-01-02 17:03:00+00'),
  (9034, 720, 1695, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Great, friendly host. Clean apartment with kitchen. Easy free street parking.', '2025-12-16 11:36:00+00'),
  (9035, 720, 899, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'My stay was excellent. The accommodation was clean, comfortable, and well-appointed. The host provided clear instructions and was quick to respond to any questions. A great experience overall—highly recommended for anyone visiting the area.', '2025-11-30 13:56:00+00'),
  (9036, 720, 1068, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Five stars! Jiale is truly a fantastic host. He was very attentive, helpful, and incredibly quick to reply to any questions we had. The apartment itself was comfortable and came with every essential we could need. We especially appreciated the spot-on local recommendations he shared; they really enhanced our visit! Overall, we had an amazing trip and would definitely book this place again. Thanks, Jiale!
P.S. For future guests, we highly recommend checking out the KTV Flagship Store just a minute away from the apartment for some karaoke fun!', '2025-11-01 11:01:00+00'),
  (9037, 720, 1195, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'We had a very nice stay at Jiale’s place in New York! We needed an earlier check in time due to our flight and they quickly accommodated with the check in availability to allow us to enter earlier in the day!! The place was exactly what we needed, making our stay comfortable and safe. They were very punctual and responsive, giving all the information we needed!', '2025-10-06 09:07:00+00'),
  (9038, 720, 770, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'Wonderful and great place to stay. Jiale was super responsive as well!', '2025-09-14 17:04:00+00'),
  (9039, 720, 1814, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great location for the US open. Safe neighbourhood and comfortable beds! Fully equipped kitchen. Host is very accommodating and friendly! Highly recommend', '2025-08-30 09:12:00+00'),
  (9040, 720, 1274, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Fantastic host, smooth check-in, and a beautiful space. Highly recommend !!', '2025-08-23 08:52:00+00'),
  (9041, 720, 1630, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'We stayed at this apartment for a week and had a great experience. The place was clean, quiet, and located in a very nice neighborhood. Public transportation (bus and metro) was nearby, which made it super easy to get around the city without needing a car.
The apartment itself was comfortable and had everything we needed. The AC worked really well—which was a big plus for us since we tend to get hot easily. There was also a laundromat within walking distance, which was really convenient.
The host was great at communicating and checked in with us to make sure everything was okay throughout our stay.
Overall, it was a pleasant and peaceful place to stay, perfect for relaxing after a long day exploring the city. Would definitely recommend!', '2025-08-19 14:12:00+00'),
  (9042, 721, 1184, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Great location and very convenient for getting around the city. I stayed here for a couple months and had a great experience with no issues throughout my stay. Highly recommend.', '2026-08-16 12:11:00+00'),
  (9043, 721, 1430, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'Spacious apartment and love the open layout! The balcony was a huge bonus. The apt is in a prime location! A ten min walk to Central Park and plenty of great restaurants, coffee shops and bars nearby!', '2026-06-01 09:52:00+00'),
  (9044, 721, 1835, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 'Great location! Close to the park, bars, train, grocery stores. You can hear neighbors as others mentioned but it was okay for me as others didn’t bother when I slept. I had a small issue with drainage which the host sorted out quickly and communicated through the process. The unit was a little limited and I purchased some cookware that I took with me. Overall great experience and I enjoyed my time on the UES. I was comfortable with the host booked a month with this host at a different location on the west side to experience the west side.', '2026-02-01 21:17:00+00'),
  (9045, 721, 1565, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'The place was exactly what I expected. All the amenities were functional and easy to use. The apartment was spotless when I arrived though I did have a couple of cockroaches appear a month in, but no other issues. The host was responsive and the apartment in great condition overall. The neighborhood is fantastic with everything you could need right outside the door. The area felt very safe and the other residents of the building were kind.', '2024-07-21 08:50:00+00'),
  (9046, 721, 1597, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Charming studio close to Central Park. The location is incredibly convenient, with easy access to subways, restaurants, and even a nearby Whole Foods for groceries.
While the kitchen is small, it''s well-equipped with all the necessary appliances, making it easy to whip up a quick meal. Highly recommended!', '2023-12-06 20:10:00+00'),
  (9047, 721, 1715, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Enjoyed my stay in this studio. The space was clean and well furnished. Just enough room for one person in a great location with amazing restaurants and bakeries. Only a few blocks from Central Park.', '2023-11-04 15:02:00+00'),
  (9048, 721, 782, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'Amazing stay! Beautiful place and perfect location. The place was very well cleaned :)', '2022-09-09 19:44:00+00'),
  (9049, 721, 952, 5, 4, 4, 5, 3, 4, 5, 'Great place to stay. Central, nice decor, clean. Will be back again.', '2022-06-20 15:26:00+00'),
  (9050, 721, 1231, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Just as you can see in the pictures. Great location, lots of grocery shops and cvs store nearby. There are Guggenheim and Central park within a 10-minute walk. Generally great, but I''d like to let you know a minor few things.
First of all, there was a hairdryer in the bathroom. It was different from what was on the list. If I had known this before checking in, I wouldn''t have bought a hairdryer.
The other is the laundry problem. I was quite troubled when I first used the washing machine. If you want to use it, you have to buy a 5$ card from the vending machine. The machine accepts ONLY 5$: 10$ or 1$ aren''t working. And it doesn''t include usage fees. It is only for the card. 
You should go to Variety Coffee(varietycoffeeroasters.com) and Bagel Shop(www.bagelshopnyc.com) near the apartment.', '2022-05-15 14:04:00+00'),
  (9051, 721, 1593, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Simple clean Apt in a great location, very comfortable bed and space. Super easy to get around with subway close by and any & all shopping amenities just out your front door. Safe / clean neighborhood 
I would definitely stay again and recommend. Two Thumbs up!', '2022-01-03 11:25:00+00'),
  (9052, 721, 985, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 'Nice place, well located. Having a balcony was a plus. The only downside was the noise. Being in the second floor it gets quite a lot of noise from the street, since is it located between two busy avenues (lexington and the third). It is perfect for short-stays and for a person or couple, otherwise you will feel the space is too small.', '2021-09-22 08:27:00+00'),
  (9053, 721, 1531, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Beautiful apartment...Perfect location..lots of room..great building..
You will never want to leave!', '2020-08-31 19:41:00+00'),
  (9054, 721, 761, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'Awesome location and the building super keeps the place very clean. Great place to stay!', '2018-09-30 10:08:00+00'),
  (9055, 721, 1119, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'A place to live. Good location, smooth check in process, quiet, close to livelyhood streets and close from transit and a walkable distance to CP. Professionally managed so the responsiveness is great and there will be no problem if something has to be fixed.the location is perfect for long term stay. We now moved permanently in NYC, but would be on my list if I had to return in the City. Definitely recommended for a couple (may be with a kid too) and business travelers or anybody in fact.we could have stayed there for longer that the 3.5months we stayed there.', '2018-07-07 20:55:00+00'),
  (9056, 721, 846, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Very nice neighborhood you have a laundry shop and supermarket near to the building. High speed internet connection never cutting off. Overall it''s a good apartment. Only problem the apartment needs more care with the painting, floor and the sofa.', '2017-08-15 22:23:00+00'),
  (9057, 722, 1897, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 'Everything we needed !
Aino was a great host always ready to help and accommodate us! Will rebook if in the area again! Thank you so much!', '2026-08-24 22:45:00+00'),
  (9058, 722, 993, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'We were so happy to find a place in the city for our girls'' reunion. Aino''s place was warm, comfortable, and inviting. We walked everywhere from the location - easy. I really enjoyed all of the beautiful original features of the home. I would highly recommend Aino''s place to others.', '2026-07-29 22:20:00+00'),
  (9059, 722, 1394, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'What a fantastic day! This was a wonderful very historical brownstone in Harlem. Aino was so helpful and we loved the convenience of the station right at 125th. A great homebase to go out into the city!', '2026-05-26 19:15:00+00'),
  (9060, 722, 1424, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'Conveniently located near subway. The house was perfect size for our group of eight. There was a lot of dust on the base boards, but otherwise the house was very clean. There seems to be a lot of city activity at night, trash pick up, etc and the neighbors across the street threw a banger of a party one night so it can be quite loud if you''re in one of the bedrooms facing the street. So pack ear plugs but we would definitely stay here again.', '2026-05-03 12:51:00+00'),
  (9061, 722, 1748, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Aino’s place was exactly as described. There were 6 adults staying and we had plenty of room. It is only a few blocks to a subway stop.', '2026-04-14 22:56:00+00'),
  (9062, 722, 1223, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'We really enjoyed our stay! This is a wonderful, vibrant location! The house offered everything we needed. The kitchen and common space gave us plenty of room to cook and gather. The deck and yard added lovely private outdoor space. There is a sweet garden/park across the street. 
If you''re looking for a hotel style this may not be for you. This house has history which is part of its charm!
 Aino was very easy to communicate with and we would definitely recommend and return! 
Thank you!', '2026-04-06 09:45:00+00'),
  (9063, 722, 1437, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Aino was so helpful, especially when we had travel complications, I couldn''t ask for a better host. The house is cute and full of old Harlem personality. Super walkable to multiple subway stops and buss stops.', '2026-03-23 12:55:00+00'),
  (9064, 722, 1668, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Aino was helpful and friendly from the start and her traditional brownstone was a great place from which to see the sights of New York', '2026-01-02 12:21:00+00'),
  (9065, 722, 1199, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Beautiful home and Aino was a great host.', '2025-11-30 21:53:00+00'),
  (9066, 722, 1466, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'We had a great time! As returning New Yorkers, it was great to enjoy Harlem at a great location.', '2025-10-19 11:27:00+00'),
  (9067, 722, 1551, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Host was very tentative and responsive! Great place for a group trip!', '2025-09-29 14:16:00+00'),
  (9068, 722, 1381, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Aino hosted me and my family in her home.
The accommodation has everything you need for your stay! Located just steps from the subway that will take you to downtown Manhattan!
Aino is always available, reachable at any time, and very kind!
I recommend this fantastic accommodation.', '2025-09-09 15:13:00+00'),
  (9069, 722, 1836, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'starting with Host ,she is fantastic ,responsive ,accomodative and clear .We have had a wonderful time in beuatiful place .Pics may be very old but overall interirors ,rooms ,accesibility to various Deli ,restarunts ,coffee shops nearby is very good .Only flip side little away from downtown and will cost one anything between 20 to 30 dollar each side but having said that its worth spending time at this property .Will come back again soon.', '2025-08-17 09:05:00+00'),
  (9070, 722, 1001, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 'Great place. Great host. Great location.', '2025-07-25 12:53:00+00'),
  (9071, 722, 945, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'An excellent choice for an NYC stay for a group! Incredibly easy to get to any tourist destinations - whenever we went to a show, it was only about a 25 minute subway ride, and after the craziness of the city, the quiet townhouse was a perfect place to relax!', '2025-06-23 22:09:00+00'),
  (9072, 723, 1358, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'I enjoyed my stay at Unrich''s apartment. The apartment is exactly as it is pictured on the profile. It was clean and cozy and easy to find. Very close to the subway stations and bus stop. There are bodegas within walking distance to purchase groceries/cooked food.', '2022-10-30 09:18:00+00'),
  (9073, 723, 729, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Nora was a great host, friendly and communicative. The place was very nice and cosy. The only thing to be aware of is the bedroom is on the main road with thin windows so quite noisy throughout the night. Fine if you’re a heavy sleeper like me, but maybe not so good for light sleepers.', '2022-10-21 20:28:00+00'),
  (9074, 723, 802, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'The apartment was clean and nicely set up. Nora had some snacks for us too as a welcome. We didn''t get to meet her in person as schedules unfortunately didn''t align, but the place was as described and very easy to get to and check in and out of. There''s a store nearby called Food Universe and it has one of my favorite frozen treats, Mamita''s (I love the coconut cream ices the best, and you also can''t find this brand where I''m from), and there''s multiple trains quite close. Nora was very communicative despite her busy schedule, and answered all our questions. She was also very accommodating in that she offered to let us extend our check-out time a little, which we took her up on so that we could avoid carrying our luggage around with us until our evening trip home. I would stay again. Thanks!', '2022-09-17 10:46:00+00'),
  (9075, 723, 1063, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Nora is a great host—we really appreciated her kindness & flexibility, and her prompt & helpful communication. The apartment is located within easy walking distance to Yankee Stadium, where our family enjoyed a Yankees vs Mets game. Nora’s generous check out time of 12 pm and the variety of snack items Nora provides to guests are also helpful features of this Airbnb. Thank you, Nora, for a great stay!', '2022-08-24 12:58:00+00'),
  (9076, 723, 947, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'Was a cute little apartment walking distance from Yankee stadium and all the food NY offers. She was very responsive. When I had a stupid question at 11:30 PM she answered my message threw the app in minutes . I don’t know if she put out little baseballs because she has them as decorations all the time or because I said I was coming in for the Met Yankee game but it was a nice little touch. Building was quiet and only up a few stairs. It was a hot day and I could tell she turned on the A/C hours before I got there to cool the place down. Couldn’t of asked for a better host.', '2022-08-23 17:53:00+00'),
  (9077, 723, 894, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Nora was such a wonderful host!! Great location with a bus stop right in front of the building. Lots of small shops with food. Very spacious for city living and in a quiet building. It is the city, which means city sounds, but even on the weekend it died down around midnight. Can’t wait for our next trip! Would absolutely book again', '2022-08-22 20:38:00+00'),
  (9078, 723, 1229, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Had a nice stay here with my family while we took in a Yankees game. Ended up taking an Uber there and walking back which really worked out. Nora is very sweet and everything was very clean and just like it was pictured. We parked in the garage down the street which she recommended. Thanks!', '2022-08-20 22:22:00+00'),
  (9079, 723, 1148, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'This is a lovely, well-equipped apartment (it even had free food), in a lively interesting part of NY. Nora was super responsive and very flexible with the check-in-check-out time.', '2022-08-08 18:07:00+00'),
  (9080, 723, 1170, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'Nora is a gracious host. The apartment was perfect for my daughter and I. It was comfortable, welcoming and cozy. The bed was so comfortable. The location was great and we were able navigate easily throughout the neighborhood. I would most definitely stay hete again.', '2022-08-05 15:26:00+00'),
  (9081, 723, 1049, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'The place was very cozy and on spot from the listing on the app, loved everything and host was very nice', '2022-08-01 15:58:00+00'),
  (9082, 723, 963, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great host - She made us feel welcomed when we checked in and throughout the stay. The place is nice and comfortable.', '2022-07-31 21:15:00+00'),
  (9083, 723, 1650, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'The place was wonderful. Exceptionally clean and in a great area. We would stay here again. Thank you!!', '2022-07-29 09:54:00+00'),
  (9084, 723, 1804, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'the stay was absolutely wonderful, and the apartment was nice and cozy, it''s honestly a place I''d be willing to rent long term if i was local. i will say, the nearest handicap station is a bit far, and its all uphill to the station, which made it a bit of a trek to get there, but that won''t be an issue for most. without a wheelchair, I''d 100% stay again, with a non accessible subway being a block away.', '2022-07-25 12:54:00+00'),
  (9085, 723, 1423, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Nora is a great host who takes the time to ensure the comfort of her guests. This is the perfect place to stay if you’re in the city for a Yankees game, as the stadium is a 10 minute walk.', '2022-07-15 22:26:00+00'),
  (9086, 723, 1384, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, '*****Five Stars all around*****
Nora is a wonderful host and responds immediately. Her apartment felt just like home and I would definitely stay here again. Great location, close enough to walk to Yankee Stadium, and super easy to grab the Metro to head into Manhattan. All of her linens are high quality and she has fantastic style and functionality for home furnishings. Thank you so much - I hope to return again & I will recommend this to anyone seeking a place to stay in NYC area! ❤️', '2022-07-14 09:48:00+00'),
  (9087, 724, 1695, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 'We had a great experience! LOVE the neighborhood, close to everything and lots to do. Host is very friendly and extremely responsive. Thank you for making us feel right at home while we looked for our permanent home.', '2025-11-02 14:51:00+00'),
  (9088, 724, 1788, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Our host was very responsive and my team loved the gym. Definitely would wanna stay here again.', '2025-06-15 16:41:00+00'),
  (9089, 724, 1517, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great stay, would definitely stay here again. Very safe, good wifi, spacious, and comfortable with everything we needed.', '2025-03-31 11:59:00+00'),
  (9090, 724, 1093, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'This is a great airbnb in the best part of Williamsburg. Great hosts and excellent apartment.', '2023-04-30 09:28:00+00'),
  (9091, 724, 1206, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Easy helpful and accommodating. Nice place and great location. Thanks!', '2022-09-22 17:43:00+00'),
  (9092, 725, 1544, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great location from the train and the ferry. Very clean, big kitchen, very comfortable bed and a great host! Will be back!', '2026-09-12 20:44:00+00'),
  (9093, 725, 848, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'Ines is a really cool guy. When we arrived early from the airport, he let us drop off our luggage before check-in. The apartment was spotlessly clean and the Wi-Fi was incredibly fast — I''m talking 1 Gbps!', '2026-09-11 17:51:00+00'),
  (9094, 725, 1828, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Absolutely perfect stay! Ines is a fantastic host, and the place was spotless, comfortable, and exactly as described. The location in Brooklyn is excellent and very convenient. Everything was 5- star from start to finish. Highly recommend!
If you are trying to open the door and key doesn''t seems to work then dont put the key all the way in key hole just keep some space and it will work out', '2026-08-25 17:52:00+00'),
  (9095, 725, 1071, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We spent three wonderful nights here. The property is very close to the subway station, and the neighborhood is pleasant and safe. Ines was very responsive and always willing to answer our questions.', '2026-07-26 17:26:00+00'),
  (9096, 725, 911, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'I thoroughly enjoyed my stay here and it’s perfectly located close to the R sub line taking you right into the city! I’ll be sure to book this property again in the future and thank you for having me!', '2026-07-17 22:36:00+00'),
  (9097, 725, 1700, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Everything was as described :) quite well connected with public transport. Decent and safe neighborhood. No complaints at all.', '2026-07-07 16:49:00+00'),
  (9098, 725, 1319, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Awesome spot especially if you have the intentions of being out exploring the city. Plenty of space to cook and nice size fridge to hold a ton of food. Plush bed definitely helped with sleep after a long day. Will book again.', '2026-06-29 20:47:00+00'),
  (9099, 725, 760, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'The key was not in the lockbox when I arrived. And I had to deal with a non-English speaking family member to resolve the issue. Complicated and annoying.
No real complaints after that, though. The space itself was completely adequate. Really didn’t like the pillows though.', '2026-06-21 19:13:00+00'),
  (9100, 725, 1687, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Ines was a great host. He had a quick response time and was very accommodating. He accepted my last minute request within an hour of my arrival time. Check-in was very easy and directions were very clear. The place is located on the first floor and is exactly as described with a full kitchen. It was very clean and the bed was comfortable. It’s about an 5 minute walk to the train. Even though my stay was only one night, I highly recommend this place!', '2026-06-19 20:10:00+00'),
  (9101, 725, 1244, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'It’s a fantastic stay and definitely is a hidden gem! Has everything you need for a comfortable temporary abode! Ines is super responsive and on it!', '2026-06-12 09:20:00+00'),
  (9102, 725, 1160, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Place is nice, Ines is always responsive and helpfull
Location is peaceful', '2026-05-23 15:41:00+00'),
  (9103, 725, 1632, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'We had an amazing stay at Ines’s place. It was clean, spacious, and Ines made my family and I feel very welcome.', '2026-05-18 16:22:00+00'),
  (9104, 726, 1463, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Such a great stay. Jonas was super kind and responsive', '2026-06-08 10:57:00+00'),
  (9105, 726, 1024, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Beautiful place to stay. You can easily access the city. The bed is extremely comfortable. I would highly recommend staying at Jonas’s place.', '2026-05-03 10:40:00+00'),
  (9106, 726, 1919, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 'Such a great space for our stay in New York. Kitchen was stocked for cooking and eating. Lots of room to play games and relax. Just an FYI for sleeping--the bedroom is at the front of the place, right by the street so definitely will hear some traffic noise which is normal for city stays. Very easy and comfortable stay!', '2026-04-03 20:30:00+00'),
  (9107, 726, 1438, 3, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 'Older retired couple here. A great ground floor/garden level apartment for our week long stay in NY in January. The neighborhood offers a great French patisserie & good coffee around the corner, a bodega for snacks at the corner, restaurants and supermarket a block away, and two blocks from the A/C metro lines. The apartment was spacious, clean and comfortable, and reliant on radiator heat during winter. Water is nice and hot. Warning to short folks like me: the bed is high so we left a little step stool behind which worked perfectly; and once in, the bed is so very comfortable, providing great sleep! Lots of cozy blankets available. We had a really enjoyable stay and would consider it again.', '2026-01-20 22:33:00+00'),
  (9108, 726, 1231, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Thank you! We had such a great stay here for our holiday trip to NYC. The location was great - walkable and some great cafes and restaurants nearby. 
Hope we can stay here when we come back for the holidays next year!', '2025-12-22 16:33:00+00'),
  (9109, 726, 1609, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'Jonas’s place was very comfortable and cozy! Loved the clawfoot bathtub and large bed', '2025-11-17 17:58:00+00'),
  (9110, 726, 1544, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 'We really enjoyed our stay! Jonas’s place is cozy and so close to the subway. Plenty of shops and restaurants in the surrounding area. Everything we needed for our NYC trip.', '2025-11-11 11:17:00+00'),
  (9111, 726, 1514, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 'We enjoyed our stay at Jonas‘s AirBnB very much. The apartment was easily accessible from JFK airport and it was also easy to reach Brooklyn and Manhattan with the A and C lines.
Jonas stopped by to welcome us on our first day, gave us valuable tips and was very friendly.', '2025-10-23 21:08:00+00'),
  (9112, 726, 1551, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 'Really great accomodation, a lot of space and very well placed, right next to the metro line !', '2025-09-19 22:29:00+00'),
  (9113, 726, 1664, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We loved staying at this apartment! Jonas sent excellent check-in instructions, and was very kind to introduce herself when she saw us. The location is super convenient to the subway, and I enjoyed having great breakfast at Je T''aime Patisserie and Sofia''s Bagels within walking distance before even getting the day started, as well as the convenient market for snacks just a crosswalk away. There was ample space inside the comfy apartment to get ready for exploring NYC and to unwind after those busy days. We would love to stay here again when we visit the city!', '2025-09-14 10:28:00+00'),
  (9114, 726, 1197, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'We had a nice stay at Jonas''s place. It is close to the subway in a fairly quiet area of Bed Stuy. Lots of restaurants to walk to and only about 25 minutes to Manhattan on the A train. Will definitely stay here again when we return to New York.', '2025-09-10 08:44:00+00'),
  (9115, 726, 1591, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 'Boyfriend and I went to visit family and loved the location it was perfect for all our needs. Apartment is perfectly spacious but still cozy. We were initially concerned that there was only one ac unit in the living room, however we found out very quickly that the air circulates very well in the apartment which was amazing. Parking was super easy to find, we never had to walk more than half a block for a space if we didn’t find one right in front. Also we loved crossing the street to the deli to grab some quick beverages, snacks, and even meals. Could not thank Jonas enough for her help!', '2025-07-28 22:16:00+00'),
  (9116, 726, 1370, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Jonas was a lovely, responsive host. The place is a great space and huge bedroom for New York. Bathroom and kitchen were very clean and had nice amenities. I was recovering from surgery and felt so cozy there. 
To clear up older reviews, the mattress was very comfortable and apartment pretty quiet for Brooklyn. It is also not in the basement, but ground floor. 
There was only one window A/C in the living room but the whole place cooled down quickly, even in the hot summer month of July. Bedroom also had a nice ceiling fan and another fan was provided, but I didn’t need it. 
Wonderful place and host, would definitely stay again.', '2025-07-23 13:07:00+00'),
  (9117, 726, 847, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Everything was as described and shown in the photos. The apartment was very clean and we felt very comfortable there. AC in the living room worked well — no AC in the bedroom but it was still comfortable. 
I would book Jonas’s place again for my next trip to Brooklyn.', '2025-07-14 14:51:00+00'),
  (9118, 726, 1403, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Jonas''s place was everything described in the photo''s. Quiet neighborhood and close to the Subway. Will definitely stay here if ever I am taking a trip again to NY.', '2025-07-07 11:50:00+00'),
  (9119, 727, 1328, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Everything about this stay was perfect. The apartment is in a great location for Brooklyn and with easy subway access for trips into Manhattan. 
The apartment is exactly as it looks in online. Clean, roomy and with everything we needed for a long stay. 
The few times we had a question Johnathan responded quickly and was very helpful. 100% recommend this stay to others and will definitely stay again if we are in NYC. Thank you.', '2026-08-08 10:49:00+00'),
  (9120, 727, 1918, 5, 4, 5, 5, 3, 5, 5, 'My husband and I stayed in Ana’s downstairs apartment for a few weeks in between leases. The place was in a great location with lots of restaurants, close to trains, very clean and well stocked with everything we needed to be comfortable there for an extended stay. Ana was quick to reply with any questions. Also very much appreciated that pets are allowed, which is hard to find!', '2026-05-02 15:03:00+00'),
  (9121, 727, 1777, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great location to stay in park slope. Ana and family where excellent and supportive host during a difficult time as I was going through a kidney transplant. I really appreciate the support and loved the apartment.', '2026-03-28 22:07:00+00'),
  (9122, 727, 1509, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'My husband and I stayed a month and we enjoyed “our apartment” very much. Great lay-out, well furnished, feels spacious, so clean. Even the bathtub seems to “self-clean.” Our landlord even ensured that our sidewalk and path to the entrance door from the street were always cleared of daily snowfall. The second room has a desk and office chair / lamp, a “day bed” which is really a second bed (I slept there a few nights when I developed a mild cough midway, so that my husband wouldn’t catch it) with a side table and space for the exercise mat that they graciously provided. The main bed is very comfortable with a bureau (many drawers) and a large closet with the suede hangers I also use at home in the Philippines. At the risk of others booking it when we need to return, we recommend it highly.', '2026-02-04 15:49:00+00'),
  (9123, 727, 755, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Second time staying here - it is the perfect home base for staying in Brooklyn or visiting NYC more broadly. Extremely comfortable apartment with everything you could want, and close to the train and uber distance from the city. The hosts are super friendly and responsive.', '2026-01-05 21:44:00+00'),
  (9124, 727, 1493, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'We had a wonderful stay in this beautiful, tastefully designed apartment. It’s stylish, comfortable, and equipped with everything you might need. The hosts were kind and attentive, always making sure we had everything throughout our stay. We stayed for over two months and would be happy to return in the future!', '2025-09-26 21:39:00+00'),
  (9125, 727, 1886, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'Great spot - close to the subway, park, and great restaurants. Space was well furnished and decorated, which made it a very comfortable stay.', '2025-05-31 19:43:00+00'),
  (9126, 727, 1271, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'This was a return visit for family visiting from out of town. Ana''s place was immaculate and he was very responsive in all communications. The location is also close to many coffee shops, grocery stores and restaurants. Highly recommend!', '2025-04-02 15:55:00+00'),
  (9127, 727, 1879, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Wonderful hosts! Stayed for a month and it was a comfortable experience. Modern, clean, and well furnished home. Spacious master bedroom with premium bedding. Office space was great for remote work. Close to subways, excellent pastry and coffee shops. Would definitely stay again!', '2025-01-31 16:06:00+00'),
  (9128, 727, 755, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Amazing place in the heart of South Slope and steps away from every subway you need. A great spot to call home for a few weeks. The apartment is pristine and has everything you could need, and it’s beautifully decorated.', '2024-08-31 19:29:00+00'),
  (9129, 727, 1261, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'Location was convenient to family in Brooklyn as well as plenty of options for restaurants, groceries and Prospect Park.', '2024-06-30 22:51:00+00'),
  (9130, 727, 1300, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'We lived at Ana’s place for 6 months. It was the perfect apartment for our family (two adults, one infant). Exceptionally clean, well-stocked, safe, modern, comfortable. And it’s in a great location in Park Slope, just a couple of blocks away from a convenient subway station. Ana is a wonderful host. We felt right at home.', '2024-05-31 22:17:00+00'),
  (9131, 727, 751, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Beautiful apartment, great location, and a king bed! Loved our stay and would definitely stay again!', '2023-11-27 22:48:00+00'),
  (9132, 727, 919, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 'My wife, daughter and I really appreciate our time at Ana’s place. I appreciate how flexible he was with check in and check out. The place is very central and very modern and spacious. The unit also has central HVAC, which is uncommon in NYC.
The unit was clean and the host was incredibly friendly. Will stay again!', '2023-11-04 19:36:00+00'),
  (9133, 727, 1232, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We had a great stay at Ana’s apartment! The apartment is very comfortable, clean, and calming. We especially appreciated that Ana offered us his highchair for our baby and brought it down for us to use during our stay.', '2023-10-20 09:09:00+00'),
  (9134, 728, 1727, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Great location, clean, hot water, parking is not horrible for Brooklyn, AC, heat, and hot water all work and the bed is comfortable. My only complaint is that weak ass coffee in the rooms. But it’s the same everywhere you go, BYOC (Bring Your Own Coffee)', '2026-09-13 20:38:00+00'),
  (9135, 728, 1556, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Nice place and easy to find. Around a lot of restaurants and parking', '2026-09-13 17:34:00+00'),
  (9136, 728, 1367, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'It was okay! The hotel was much smaller than expected. Felt like the value for what I paid for wasn’t it, but overall okay experience.', '2026-09-13 19:18:00+00'),
  (9137, 728, 1131, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I had high expectations for an Airbnb-run hotel. I am an Airbnb host and have had nothing but great experiences with Airbnb and their customer service. I hate that this is my first bad review. Room 520 had an unbearable odor of perfume, as if it was spilled on the linens. The hotel had a large assortment of perfume on sale at the front desk, which may have explained a lot. The bathroom sink pressure was so high that I got soaked when i turned it on. We tried leaving the windows open to air-out the perfume smell while we went out for dinner. This didn’t improve the smell, so we requested another room. After some difficulty, we were finally moved. The new room 407 had a dirty toilet, but this was the only option presented to us and the staff made it clear they weren’t interested in helping any further. We will not be returning.', '2026-09-13 11:39:00+00'),
  (9138, 728, 1536, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'This is a nice stay if you are stopping by In New York for a couple days.', '2026-09-08 09:28:00+00'),
  (9139, 728, 1762, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 'The workers were respectful and courteous, and it was a nice room and quiet.', '2026-07-25 21:25:00+00'),
  (9140, 728, 1499, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Excellent location for the event I was attending. Lots of food places in walking distances', '2026-07-12 11:41:00+00'),
  (9141, 728, 1907, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Would have given 4 stars if the bathroom was cleaner. Extremely slow draining shower, dirty shower head, moldy shower stall corners, and a second drain in the floor that flies were crawling out of.', '2026-06-28 15:24:00+00'),
  (9142, 728, 1780, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'great place! Super clean and comfy. Adam was super nice too. Would come back', '2026-06-14 16:47:00+00'),
  (9143, 729, 847, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Rosa was kind and let me stow my bag early. Good conversation, clean room and hot shower.', '2023-10-07 21:48:00+00'),
  (9144, 729, 838, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We stayed at Rosa''s place for a week and it had everything we needed. It was a great pleasure to meet Rosa who is a wonderful person and a great host. Thank you !', '2023-09-17 19:02:00+00'),
  (9145, 729, 1445, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Rosa was a great guest, the apartment is very welcoming and in a perfect location - highly recommend!', '2023-09-09 08:12:00+00'),
  (9146, 729, 1640, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Rosa was an amazing host to stay with. This is about the only instance in which the place turned out to be better than the pictures on the listing. Rosa was responsive throughout the booking process and demonstrated a lot of flexibility as he allowed me to check-in early. Also, I''d initially made a reservation for two nights but had to cut short my trip by a day, and Rosa was kind enough to approve my itinerary change.
It can take a bit of a walk to get to a major subway stop but I wholeheartedly recommend Rosa and his home!', '2023-08-20 22:10:00+00'),
  (9147, 729, 1259, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'I felt very comfortable and safe staying at Rosa’s place. The room was cozy (but cool enough for warm summer nights because of the air condition inside!) and even though the apartment is on the ground floor/ pavement level it was bright and welcoming due to the Christmas lights which hang in basically the whole accommodation on the ceiling (gave me inspiration how I could level up the brightness of my own room!). It was lovely being able to enjoy breakfast outside in the little garden and winding down after long days of discovering the city. Rosa is a very friendly and welcoming host and I enjoyed our little chats!
I can only recommend Aarons place, especially if you search for an accommodation in a nice area in Brooklyn close to the Subway and nice little cafes and shops.', '2023-08-18 13:04:00+00'),
  (9148, 729, 1781, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Aarons place was a great stay! He was very welcoming and hospitable. The place was very nice and i loved the backyard. It was nice and clean, and during the summer heat the ACs really helped. Overall a great place!', '2023-08-13 11:50:00+00'),
  (9149, 729, 1891, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Cool neighbourhood, lots of great places to eat and drink. Rosa is super easygoing and had lots of good suggestions of where to get fed and watered.', '2023-07-30 19:52:00+00'),
  (9150, 729, 1793, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Rosa''s place was great! Rosa sent very detailed instructions and restaurant recommendations before check in, which made the process stress-free. The room was very comfortable and I loved the mood lighting. Location-wise, you''re surrounded by great food and subway stations that allow for easy access to both JFK airport and Manhattan. I really enjoyed talking to Rosa and was sad to only stay one night! I will definitely stay here again next time I''m in NYC.', '2023-07-26 12:40:00+00'),
  (9151, 729, 1496, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Rosa is an amazing host and a great communicator, he made me feel welcome and was always up for an interesting chat. I really enjoyed staying at his place and would strongly recommend it to anyone who would like to feel at home thousands of miles away.', '2023-07-04 19:48:00+00'),
  (9152, 729, 1405, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Had a great time at Rosa’s place. He’s a very chill and friendly host.', '2023-06-25 18:29:00+00'),
  (9153, 729, 806, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Rosa is a great host and the room and bed he offered are quite comfortable. The street he lives on is quiet with great bagels and pizza close by. If you want the a good Brooklyn/NYC experience, check this accommodation out!', '2023-06-24 13:21:00+00'),
  (9154, 729, 1854, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'For those who come from quiet place bedroom * might* be a bit loud with trucks at *some times *of the day. The neighborhood is so fantastic and Rosa is so fantastic 
bed and the decor are wonderful.', '2023-06-21 18:57:00+00'),
  (9155, 729, 1619, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I felt very safe and comfortable staying at Rosa’s place! The room is so cozy and the bed in there is very comfortable. I slept great both nights that I stayed. Rosa is also lovely! Thank you again. Would definitely return.', '2023-06-18 11:58:00+00'),
  (9156, 729, 1213, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I had a lovely few nights at Rosa’s apartment. He was a very welcoming and accommodating host. It was a perfect base for exploring both the Brooklyn and Manhattan areas. The recommendations for local bars and restaurants were also really good. Thanks Rosa!', '2023-06-08 14:49:00+00'),
  (9157, 729, 1488, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'Rosa is so great. He met me outside and made sure I was able to get in okay. Friendly in conversation and lovely to talk to. Will definitely try to stay with him again next time I am in Brooklyn.', '2023-05-29 20:11:00+00'),
  (9158, 730, 1900, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'The place was very nice and i had a good time. The location was good for where i wanted to go and to get food.', '2023-01-01 10:00:00+00'),
  (9159, 730, 829, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 'The Airbnb was in a very convenient location and was just as described.', '2022-12-30 09:29:00+00'),
  (9160, 730, 813, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 'It was good the place was awesome and it was very spacious and overall the place was very nice we really enjoyed our stay there only thing was the heating system I wish it could have been different', '2022-12-26 09:51:00+00'),
  (9161, 730, 866, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I had a great stay here. Eva was great at checking in and helpful if needed. Place looked great, back patio was nice. Design is cool. Wish there was a few more towels tho. Nice clean spacious place', '2022-12-18 22:55:00+00'),
  (9162, 730, 1342, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Great stay! I felt right at home. Very comfortable and nice aesthetic. Eva was very responsive and helpful. I would come back.', '2022-12-16 11:57:00+00'),
  (9163, 730, 762, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Eva was very nice and attentive, always quick to respond whenever we needed anything! Only think I do have to say is you can hear everything going on upstairs. It shouldn’t be a big problem unless you’re a light sleeper:)', '2022-12-13 13:25:00+00'),
  (9164, 730, 853, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'I’ll give the air bnb a 7/10… it was clean and cute. My issues with the air bnb were the shower water wasn’t hot and you can’t move the shower head so water got on the floor. We went when it was really cold so it would’ve been nice if we could control the heater (only the owner can). It was also hard to flush the toilet. Other than that it was a great stay.', '2022-11-20 14:49:00+00'),
  (9165, 730, 864, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, '1st time in Brooklyn perfect location and perfect place to stay i will most definitely visit this peaceful space again and will without a doubt recommend to anyone that wants to have just alil get away and peace of mind', '2022-11-13 11:28:00+00'),
  (9166, 730, 1598, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Eva’s place was everything I wanted and needed during my stay. I really appreciated how simple yet luxurious and immaculately clean steph’s place was! The neighborhood was safe, with everything in close proximity. I highly recommend!!', '2022-10-25 18:07:00+00'),
  (9167, 730, 1843, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Eva worked with me while having to check in late. Very responsive. The place is absolutely gorgeous. Extremely clean, and private.', '2022-10-18 22:40:00+00'),
  (9168, 730, 1877, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 'Exactly as pictured beautiful place on the first floor communication was fast check in was easy and my stay was great i would definitely book here again', '2022-10-03 19:21:00+00'),
  (9169, 730, 1525, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Eva was very polite and friendly. Place was very cool and cozy. Blue lights were really cool at night! He was very detailed on the function of everything in the space. He was also educated about easy to get food nearby. Would stay with again.', '2022-09-23 13:04:00+00'),
  (9170, 730, 1222, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 3, 5, 'The place was a perfect size for me and my girlfriend. The bathroom is small but the shower was very comfortable!
We loved the outdoor area too!!
The place was perfectly clean and communicating with Eva was seamless.
Getting Ubers and Lyfts were super easy (and reasonably priced).
**I personally would suggest that you use UberEats instead of Doordash in this area. Doordash was a hot ass mess but UberEats made trying out new food easy.', '2022-09-13 17:40:00+00'),
  (9171, 730, 919, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'I really enjoyed my stay at this location. I absolutely loved the culture of the neighborhood. Straight Caribbean vibes!! The Airbnb was clean, no complaints! The people upstairs were a little loud but that''s NY for you! The train wasn''t super close but we easily ubered and you can in fact walk if you don''t mind the distance. Eva was very nice, flexible, and responsive. I would stay here again.', '2022-09-07 12:24:00+00'),
  (9172, 730, 1723, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Love the space, great for solo travels or with couples', '2022-09-04 21:18:00+00'),
  (9173, 731, 1709, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'This is a great spot - would stay again!', '2026-09-06 13:40:00+00'),
  (9174, 731, 1684, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Great place to stay in Brooklyn. Walkable with public transportation options near by. We’d stay here again. Jonas was very proactive with instructions and overall this was a great place to stay.', '2026-08-30 13:58:00+00'),
  (9175, 731, 765, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Great place for anyone wanting to wind down, place was convenient close to different subways for getting into the city.', '2026-08-28 12:37:00+00'),
  (9176, 731, 825, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Nice host! Good, well kept place, in an okay area!', '2026-08-22 22:29:00+00'),
  (9177, 731, 1195, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Very spacious apartment, quiet neighborhood. Bedroom located at the back of the property provides good privacy overnight with the help of the split A/C unit.', '2026-08-17 15:10:00+00'),
  (9178, 731, 825, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'super clean space. Absolutely loved the stay, it was very cozy. Jonas was very responsive and made sure I had a great stay. Only thing for future guests is as mentioned there is a family upstairs and they are LOUD. if that is not your thing, this wouldn’t be the place for you. You will woken up late hours while you’re trying to sleep and mornings. other than that, It’s perfect.', '2026-08-10 10:29:00+00'),
  (9179, 731, 1235, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Very much enjoyed Jonas’s space! Check-in was super easy, the space was exactly as pictured and spotless. Easily walkable to a few different subway lines and lots to do in the surrounding areas! Jonas was very responsive and helpful when we had questions, and the checkout process was super simple and didn’t require much from us on the way out. Overall this was a lovely little crash pad for a few days in the city and we would absolutely stay again.', '2026-07-30 11:18:00+00'),
  (9180, 731, 872, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Our stay was wonderful! The home was exactly as described—very clean, comfortable, and well maintained. The neighborhood also felt clean, safe, and was a great location for exploring Brooklyn. I would absolutely stay here again and would recommend it to others!', '2026-07-02 15:38:00+00'),
  (9181, 731, 1070, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 'Good stay overall. The house was clean and well organized which we appreciated. A couple of things worth noting for future guests — there is only one TV in the living room and the couch was slightly broken making it not the most comfortable for watching TV. However the host was responsive and very accommodating, particularly when we needed to check in a day early. A few small improvements would make this a five star experience.', '2026-06-28 22:55:00+00'),
  (9182, 731, 750, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'My best friend and I had a lovely time at Jonas’s place, was cosy, clean. 5 minutes walk to trains to Manhattan. Some cute and yummy coffee shops near by was perfect.
Would stay there again and recommend it further.
Thank you Jonas🌷', '2026-05-31 22:16:00+00'),
  (9183, 731, 1033, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Super close to subway lines and close to popular spots in Brooklyn! Space was very clean and equipped with everything we needed for our weekend stay!', '2026-05-17 18:54:00+00'),
  (9184, 731, 1347, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'Jonas’s place was SPOTLESS, the cleanest Airbnb I have ever stayed in. After staying in a hotel for the first half of our trip, this place felt like a sanctuary. When I mistakenly locked myself out, Jonas had an immediate solution. Would 100% stay here again! 
Location: in a super cute neighborhood with lots of brownstones and yummy food nearby. 
The kitchen had everything we needed to make food.', '2026-05-10 16:39:00+00'),
  (9185, 731, 1065, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Overall Jonas’s place was solid. I would stay here again and recommend this bnb to a friend/family. Super clean, shower water got hot with great pressure, and the bed was comfortable. There was plenty of space! I do wish there was a microwave and a full body mirror.', '2026-04-12 15:13:00+00'),
  (9186, 731, 1234, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Jonas''s place is great. Very well located, clean, comfortable. Jonas also communicates actively and clearly. I would definitely stay here again.', '2026-03-15 12:11:00+00'),
  (9187, 731, 749, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'Jonas was a great host who went above and beyond, I really enjoyed my stay in Brooklyn.', '2026-03-10 15:58:00+00'),
  (9188, 732, 1645, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Amazing location and beautiful home. Very quiet. Everything was super clean. Bed was super comfortable. Laila communicated with us the entire time. Easy check in and check out. 
Close to great bars and restaurants.', '2026-08-29 09:55:00+00'),
  (9189, 732, 1140, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Fantastic place! You’ll feel the same once you walk in and experience the sprawling space right in the heart of NYC!', '2026-08-09 21:29:00+00'),
  (9190, 732, 1299, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'I cannot possibly say enough nice things about Laila and his property. We spent a week in New York with our family, and everything from the location to the home itself to the communication throughout our stay was truly five-star.
Laila was incredibly responsive anytime I had a question and was quick to help when we needed to troubleshoot something during our stay. The entire experience felt easy, comfortable, and seamless.
I absolutely recommend this property for your next stay in the city. We had such a wonderful experience and will for sure be returning!', '2026-08-08 17:02:00+00'),
  (9191, 732, 1254, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'We had a great time in NYC with the family. The space is exactly as described and had plenty of room for the whole family. Walkable to everything!', '2026-08-02 13:06:00+00'),
  (9192, 732, 1304, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'What an amazing apartment! While it looks great on the website, the photos don''t do it justice. My friends and I spent four nights here and had the best time. Everything about the apartment is thoughtfully designed, making you feel instantly at home. The common areas are great for hanging out, and the bedrooms are private and beyond comfortable. The full kitchen is beautiful—a true chef''s dream. Staying here gave me a glimpse of New York life that was far out of reach when I lived in the city 25 years ago.
The location was perfect for us and made accessing the rest of the city super easy. Laila was an ideal host: easy to contact and quick to reply to any questions. The apartment was set up to anticipate anything we needed. 
If you are heading to NYC and want an Airbnb that makes your stay feel truly special, you couldn''t pick a better place.', '2026-07-30 20:46:00+00'),
  (9193, 732, 1533, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We kept saying, how is this place in Manhattan? It was so spacious and open with high ceilings, the pictures don’t do justice. The theater room was a great bonus when it rained. The location was just what we wanted, walkable to shows and shopping but no throngs of people right out front. I only hope it will be available again when I come back!!', '2026-06-29 17:04:00+00'),
  (9194, 732, 1638, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Beautiful apartment with an incredible movie theater. Great location, and very spacious, which you never typically get in New York City. Would definitely recommend and stay at again. 
Thank you!', '2026-06-07 12:53:00+00'),
  (9195, 732, 1096, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We came to New York to see family. Our family came inside to see this townhouse that we rented through Laila and they were shocked at how beautiful and how large it was! That should say something!
Even though you were right in the middle of the city, you felt like it was peaceful and not as loud as other places. 
Multiple large TVs with surround sound. Video games to play. Beautiful kitchen. Bedrooms had their own temperature control. Really a unique spot.
I would absolutely stay again!', '2026-06-01 11:07:00+00'),
  (9196, 732, 1723, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great place to stay very centric had everything I needed. Great host as well!', '2026-05-17 22:02:00+00'),
  (9197, 732, 1592, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Laila is a great host and we had a wonderful day with my family', '2026-05-06 22:42:00+00'),
  (9198, 732, 834, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'What a fantastic stay! The apartment was spacious, spotlessly clean, and beautifully appointed — it felt like a home away from home in the heart of NYC. The location was perfect for exploring the city, and the cozy vibe made it wonderful to come back to after a day out. The host was an absolute pleasure to work with — friendly, helpful, and incredibly quick to respond to any questions. His communication made the whole experience seamless from start to finish. This place truly made my trip a delight, and I wouldn''t hesitate to book again. Highly recommend! Thank you so much Laila!', '2026-03-24 10:51:00+00'),
  (9199, 732, 1646, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We had great stay at Laila''s place! I would recommend this place.', '2026-03-15 13:26:00+00'),
  (9200, 732, 900, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'This is an amazing and spacious place, great location in the heart of NYC, my family loved it! Laila was very communicative and responsive. Will definitely stay here again.', '2025-12-24 22:56:00+00');

INSERT INTO reviews (booking_id, listing_id, guest_id, rating, cleanliness_rating, accuracy_rating, check_in_rating, communication_rating, location_rating, value_rating, comment, created_at) VALUES
  (9201, 732, 784, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Laila’s place was the perfect fit for our family! We could walk anywhere we wanted to be. The location was the best. The space itself was clean and comfortable. It had plenty of comfortable space for our family of five for the week. I would definitely book it again!!', '2025-12-23 09:03:00+00'),
  (9202, 732, 1796, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'We had such a wonderful stay at Laila’s place. The apartment is beautiful and perfectly located right in the heart of NYC, just a few blocks from Grand Central, which made getting around incredibly easy. The kitchen was super convenient for cooking (especially traveling with a baby). We also really enjoyed relaxing in the evenings and watching movies together after busy days in the city. The tech setup made it easy to play music throughout the apartment, which was such a fun touch.
Laila was a fantastic host, flexible and quick to reply when we had questions. We’d absolutely stay here again and highly recommend it!', '2025-11-27 18:00:00+00'),
  (9203, 733, 895, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'Malik is a superb hostess. She couldn’t have been anymore helpful during our stay in unusually difficult times. 
The apartment itself is small - comfortable beds, a private shower room and a small shared kitchen. Very little storage and in a basement down steep stairs.', '2026-05-18 11:09:00+00'),
  (9204, 733, 826, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 'Malik was a great host — very communicative and attentive throughout my stay. The check-in process was smooth, and she made sure everything was comfortable.', '2025-11-02 21:24:00+00'),
  (9205, 733, 1588, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'The place was great. Wasn’t sure what we were walking into when we booked it, but we had very minimal complaints while staying here. There are three different rooms in the basement level of the owner’s house. All rooms are protected by a pin pad that only you have access to. The house is located on a busy street, but I was able to park my car out front for the whole weekend without a ticket or tow. Hosts were considerate and appropriate. Location was walking distance to shops and restaurants. Highly recommend going to Bagel Oasis while in town. Bathroom was a little cramped and Wi-Fi was a little slow, but nothing worth actually complaining about. Overall 5 stars!', '2025-09-29 19:38:00+00'),
  (9206, 733, 1750, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'my mother and I needed this space very suddenly when her flight home was canceled last minute. Malik kindly allowed us to book immediately and also offered an early check in. the space was very clean, but it is on the cramped side if you have large luggage. no one else was in the other units, which made using the kitchen easy- I can imagine it would be difficult if sharing with other parties. there was some noise overhead from the family upstairs (not a dealbreaker, but fyi) and also strong air freshener. the beds were comfy but a bit creaky. you can open the tiny windows if you want fresh air. Malik followed up after our stay to wish us well, and while we didn’t meet her in person, seems like a very nice host :)', '2025-06-29 15:44:00+00'),
  (9207, 733, 911, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'My stay was wonderful and the area was beautiful.', '2025-01-03 20:54:00+00'),
  (9208, 733, 1321, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'Malik was really responsive and helpful.
The neighborhood was safe and commutable to Manhattan.', '2024-12-29 08:16:00+00'),
  (9209, 733, 963, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Had a great stay! Perfect for visiting friends in the area', '2024-12-15 09:23:00+00'),
  (9210, 733, 809, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Had a very nice stay, my room was clean and comfortable, house is situated in a very nice neighborhood, with supermarket , restaurants etc nearby, Malik is a very responsive host. I will definitely stay again!', '2024-10-27 13:18:00+00'),
  (9211, 733, 796, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'The host was very kind, and quick to respond. There was street parking as well. Place was relatively easy to find. The tv stopped working as soon as we got there, and they quickly replaced it within the first few hours which was very nice of them to do. The stay was pretty noisy due to the kids playing outside the room and people walking about upstairs at different times through out the day/night. We kept getting hair from previous guests either on our clothes, our faces, or in our mouths which was pretty of gross. There was also hair and trash under the bed, and the room also had a scent to it which stuck to our clothing and blankets after we left. The place was within walking distance to a decent selection of food, and close enough to the city for what we needed which was nice, but overall the experience was something I wouldn''t want to experience again.', '2024-09-28 13:23:00+00'),
  (9212, 733, 1873, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Last-minute booking between evening arrival at JFK and morning departure at LGA. Close to eateries and a bus line. Malik was responsive online and had little sweet treats waiting for us. The kitchen was great to heat up dinner leftovers for breakfast. Cute, clean, and convenient accommodations. Would stay again & recommend.', '2024-09-25 10:17:00+00'),
  (9213, 733, 1636, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Malik''s place was a nice place to stay in NYC and very convenient to LGA and all the places we visited. Malik is a super responsive host, great communication.', '2024-09-15 15:12:00+00'),
  (9214, 733, 1408, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Overall was a nice place, and within walking distance to a number of shops nearby, though you will likely need to drive or use rideshare to get to the attractions. There were some issues we had with wifi though, maybe because it was in a basement room.', '2024-09-08 13:03:00+00'),
  (9215, 733, 778, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'good place to stay on a budget! quick walk to bus lines and relatively safe neighbourhood. getting luggage up/down stairs was very difficult.', '2024-08-11 21:05:00+00'),
  (9216, 733, 1334, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Very kind hostess! She was so sweet and made sure we were comfortable. 
Her place was well equipped with AC which made our stay even more pleasant. Very polite.', '2024-08-05 17:28:00+00'),
  (9217, 733, 1289, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Needed a space to stay for a conference at St John''s University, and this was exactly what I was looking for. Good transit connectivity, given how deep into Queens I was. Would absolutely stay here again.', '2024-07-14 21:39:00+00'),
  (9218, 734, 990, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I stayed on this apartment for 2 months with my young daughter. It was perfect and the host was fantastic! Also, One thing you can’t really see from the photos is the amazing view of New York. I highly recommend this Airbnb', '2026-01-05 13:19:00+00'),
  (9219, 734, 900, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'This is a nice two bedroom apartment, with a lovely view and a good setup. Babak and Kendra were very responsive and helpful hosts. The apartment could use some updates and I found the low water pressure to be frustrating. Aside from that, it worked very well for our purposes.', '2025-11-05 17:14:00+00'),
  (9220, 734, 1219, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We loved our stay here and would book again!', '2025-07-01 08:54:00+00'),
  (9221, 734, 1404, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Babak was very helpful from start to finish. Very responsive. The condo was even better than the photos. The beds are very comfortable. The second bedroom is small but very functional . Plenty of towels and linens. Kitchen was a dream. Very well stocked and appliances were top of the line. The location was perfect for us. The parking was very convenient . Can''t say enough about that view! Thanks Babak, we will be back.', '2023-09-10 19:43:00+00'),
  (9222, 734, 1644, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Great location in Williamsburg! Really enjoyed the quiet, private, and clean listing.', '2023-08-17 20:08:00+00'),
  (9223, 734, 1132, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'We had a wonderful time at Babak’s condo . It was the perfect oasis for my daughter and I . She needed a break from her crowded her Crown Heights apartment . Babak was a very responsive and proactive host . Hope to stay again !', '2023-06-12 19:20:00+00'),
  (9224, 734, 1523, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Million dollar view of the skyline of Manhattan. Very comfortable and stylish. Wonderful music system. Large and spacious. Great restaurants, cafes, markets within steps. Domino Park was where we held our daughter’s graduation party. It couldn’t have been more convenient or special. Babak was the perfect host. Highly recommend!', '2023-05-18 20:48:00+00'),
  (9225, 734, 1235, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Lovely host, great location and amazing rooftop.', '2023-04-26 22:07:00+00'),
  (9226, 734, 826, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'We really loved staying at Babak’s place. So much, we extended our stay a few nights.
Babak is super responsive and helpful if we had any question or concern. 
We loved the space - it was so comfortable and perfect for our work/play trip to Brooklyn.
Thanks again Babak!', '2023-04-14 12:15:00+00'),
  (9227, 734, 1660, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Gorgeous apartment with great light and perfect location. Beds were so comfortable.', '2023-03-31 16:59:00+00'),
  (9228, 734, 847, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Babak''s place was very clean, great location and exceptional view of the city. Other than a minor issue checking in we had a wonderful stay! The primary bedroom is very spacious especially for city apartments; the secondary bedroom is typical NYC size so if you are sharing with another couple the bedrooms aren''t equitable. The apartment over-all is lovely and Babak is very responsive if you have any issues....location is exceptional!', '2022-11-26 14:17:00+00'),
  (9229, 734, 1741, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'The apartment was absolutely beautiful! We were there for NYC marathon weekend and the apartment was the perfect place to rest up for the race. It’s in an amazing location with tons of food and bars nearby. We had a car with us and it was very convenient to be able to use the apartments parking- great value for the price. Thanks so much for hosting us y’all!', '2022-11-07 09:21:00+00'),
  (9230, 734, 1076, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Great stay, great location. We used this as a base for our wedding weekend. A few blocks away from the venue. This was a great space where we hosted some friends. Nice little outdoor patio. Loved the quality of the fixtures, decor etc. Beds are comfortable, great showers. Would recommend.', '2022-10-17 14:26:00+00'),
  (9231, 734, 1354, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'My husband, baby and dog had a great time at Babak’s place! It was super clean and Babak was always available whenever any questions came up. Great location, would definitely stay again.', '2022-10-14 16:13:00+00'),
  (9232, 734, 1680, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Babak was an absolutely an amazing host, so kind and beyond accommodating! the apartment was very special and cozy, it had everything we needed during our stay! The beds were also insanely comfortable! the location couldnt have been better. we had a coffee shop right next to us, the cutest corner restaurant and a bodega all within a few feet! highly recommend staying here and hope to stay there again ! x', '2022-10-08 13:50:00+00'),
  (9233, 735, 1867, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Lovely home and neighbourhood! It was our first time in New York and we appreciated the hospitality and recommendations sent our way. The White House was conveniently located, just a walk away from the subway and a citibike lot! Would recommend to travellers looking to stay somewhere outside the bustling city.', '2026-07-21 17:44:00+00'),
  (9234, 735, 1245, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'Great place to stay. Love that neighborhood. Subway close by, lots of restaurants and the apartment was very comfortable.', '2026-06-16 08:04:00+00'),
  (9235, 735, 1753, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great place at a cosy location with a communicative host.', '2026-05-25 12:42:00+00'),
  (9236, 735, 908, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Great location in Brooklyn. Easy to communicate with!', '2026-05-04 12:31:00+00'),
  (9237, 735, 1430, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'This is my second time at Ida''s apartment and has been great, as the previous one.
Ida and Tracy answer the questions immediately, they are very kind and helpful. The place is confortable, everything works perfectly, the neighborhood is quiet and walking distance to the Metro.
All I can say is that everything went great and I''ll be there again!', '2026-04-21 21:55:00+00'),
  (9238, 735, 1443, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'neil’s place was a amazing and they were very nice host, i definitely recommend.', '2026-04-12 21:21:00+00'),
  (9239, 735, 1852, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Ida is a really friendly and helpful host with a nice apartment in a beautiful neighborhood. We immediately felt at home and loved all the cafes, bars, and delis around.', '2026-01-14 13:54:00+00'),
  (9240, 735, 770, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'This was a great place! Super easy to get to from JFK and to all the places in the city. The place itself is very cozy and has everything you could need in it. Our only complaint is to bring earplugs as there is a vent that can make some noise in the wind. Other than that though, the place is completely perfect.', '2025-12-17 14:39:00+00'),
  (9241, 735, 791, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Very lovely place, about 10 minute walk from nearest metro station which was very convenient and perfect for us! Ida communicated well, and was proactive with this also, answered and questions we had. Very clean apartment and photos realistic.', '2025-12-06 21:23:00+00'),
  (9242, 735, 789, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'This was the perfect little apartment for our stay in Brooklyn. The apartment was clean and comfortable. There were plenty of fresh towels and linens. The host even provided toothbrushes and shampoo. The host was very responsive and had everything well organized. Check in and check out was super easy and convenient. The. neighborhood was safe and very walkable with lots of shops, restaurants and the subway nearby. We even stumbled across a cute little African store that sold the most delicious lavender lattes. We can’t wait to visit again.', '2025-11-18 18:32:00+00'),
  (9243, 735, 1877, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Ida’s place was a great refuge from the hustle and bustle of NYC. The neighborhood is walkable, has great restaurants and easy access to public transit. Ida is great. He’s responsive and gave great recommendations for every question that we had. Would definitely book again in the future.', '2025-10-26 08:41:00+00'),
  (9244, 735, 1632, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Great responsive host and nice unit in a great area. Thanks Ida!', '2025-10-18 16:09:00+00'),
  (9245, 735, 1587, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'We loved our stay. It was close to the train and gave us easy access to everything we wanted to see while in town. The space was comfortable and we were able to make ourselves at home quickly. My partner and I would stay here any time. The privacy was an absolute plus!', '2025-09-15 17:35:00+00'),
  (9246, 735, 1080, 5, 4, 5, 5, 3, 5, 5, 'We loved our stay in Brooklyn. Ida was very helpful and our space was everything we needed. I would definitely recommend if you want to explore Brooklyn more.', '2025-09-12 10:32:00+00'),
  (9247, 735, 864, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I''ve stayed at Ida''s place several times and it''s always so enjoyable! The place is quiet, clean and spacious! I absolutely love the neighborhood as well - so much to do and close by to several train stops. I can''t wait to come back again!', '2025-09-03 19:43:00+00'),
  (9248, 736, 1574, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'It''s a nice place, and I had a great stay. Freja, the host, was very helpful and provided many suggestions for things to do nearby. I recommend this place.', '2025-07-02 22:29:00+00'),
  (9249, 736, 1302, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'My family and I had a wonderful stay at Freja''s place this winter. My parents stayed here two years ago whilst visiting the city, they had such fond memories of the place that we didn''t hesitate to book it again this year! The apartment is in a fantastic location, within walking distance to some fantastic restaurants and attractions, and also close to many public transport links within the city. The place itself was spotless and had everything we could have needed during our stay. Freja is a fantastic host and all around lovely person, she went out of her way to make sure our stay was as perfect as possible, I''d recommend this listing for anyone looking to stay in New York City!', '2024-12-13 13:15:00+00'),
  (9250, 736, 1289, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'A great place to stay, in-between Lower East side and China Town, short walks from the New Museum, the Film Forum, and many other places. With the B, D and Line 6 close-by, you can just go anywhere easily. The flat is comfortable and very practical and Freja a great host! You can’t go wrong!', '2023-10-30 14:37:00+00'),
  (9251, 736, 1601, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Fantastic stay, first time in NYC and Moshkas was a great spot, felt like a proper New Yorker. Moshka was a fab host, really good comms, super friendly and responsive, also really useful recommendations which were spot on. 11 out of 10', '2023-10-13 20:59:00+00'),
  (9252, 736, 1755, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Freja''s apartment is absolutely beautiful.  It is exactly what I hoped for: very clean, quiet, spacious and very bright as there are windows on both sides of the apartment.  The sweeping view of the Manhattan Bridge is breathtaking. Freja is a wonderful person and very responsive. She welcomed me upon arrival to show me around, making me feel right at home. I couldn''t think of a better place to stay, also because it''s in the heart of Chinatown and the Lower East Side neighborhoods full of tiny shops, cute restaurants, bustling bars and trendy vintage and streetwear stores. Higly recommended, I will definitely stay there again!', '2023-09-29 10:18:00+00'),
  (9253, 736, 1042, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Had a great stay at Freja''s place. The apartment has a nice feel to it as it has windows on each end, onto 2 different streets. Despite being close to the Bridge and tracks, the place was surprisingly quiet and the view at night pretty cool :). Lots of great restaurants in walking distance and Freja even had a map with her favorites laid out. I specifically wanted to be in the Chinatown area with all its food and bustling, but the street itself is pretty quiet.', '2023-09-05 11:39:00+00'),
  (9254, 736, 1436, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'This place is great and Mo is a helpful, responsive, and overall just wonderful host. I wouldn''t hesitate to stay here again!', '2023-08-06 16:50:00+00'),
  (9255, 736, 1204, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Freja’s place was perfect for us. We were in such a fun neighborhood with so much to do (and eat!) and then got to come back to a peaceful, quiet, and very comfortable space. The art and music was a fun extra touch too. In addition to the apartment having everything we needed (including being super clean and close to lots of transportation options), Freja was a wonderful host. She is thoughtful, communicative, and happy to help you make the most of your stay. We look forward to coming back!', '2023-07-12 09:58:00+00'),
  (9256, 736, 1276, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'Had a great stay, the location is good and the surrounding neighborhoods are easy to get to by walking or metro.', '2023-07-02 16:21:00+00'),
  (9257, 736, 1160, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Comfortable nice place to stay and the host was very responsive', '2023-04-25 10:04:00+00'),
  (9258, 736, 915, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Mo was a fantastic host! She was proactive, let me in and gave a tour, provided lots of resources and tips, and was helpful about checking in (via text) to make sure I was doing well. 
The place is super cute and has lots of nice amenities. Cloud like bed, killer music selection, nice tall shower, and fun decorations. It’s also very walkable. 
It can get a little noisy with the train and bridge, but closed windows do a respectable job dampening. There was also a white noise machine and earplugs provided. If you’re the lightest sleeper you might struggle. 
Thanks for the great spot!', '2023-04-22 16:55:00+00'),
  (9259, 736, 963, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'great place! Mo was super communicative and the place is very cute. 
great location and perfect stay.', '2023-04-06 11:10:00+00'),
  (9260, 736, 986, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We had such a wonderful stay! We were met in front of the entrance and given a tour inside. The place was spotless and matched the photos. Mo was so responsive and friendly and welcoming. 
We were able to walk to many restaurants we wanted to try and there were many subway stops within walking distance.
It was so nice that we asked to stay an extra day and Mo was really responsive to our request.
We would not hesitate to stay here again.', '2023-03-25 12:45:00+00'),
  (9261, 736, 1879, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'The location of the flat was ideal for a first time visit to NYC. Easily accessible to the metro station & main bus lines, the main attractions are of walking distance for people who likes to walk full day. I would recommend to book the accommodation to anyone looking for affordable housing in NYC.', '2023-03-19 15:12:00+00'),
  (9262, 736, 1371, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 3, 'Mo was a “Super Host.” She made sure we had great communication and was there to greet us and show us around. She gave us great recommendations for food and fun. We will return!!! Highly recommend!!', '2023-03-12 12:01:00+00'),
  (9263, 737, 822, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'My son stayed there during his NYC internship. Really enjoyed it and the alertness and help from Anders Anders was world class.', '2026-07-19 14:08:00+00'),
  (9264, 737, 1226, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Amazing place with friendly staff and great location!', '2025-10-04 12:03:00+00'),
  (9265, 737, 899, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I had an absolutely fantastic time in New York and I wholeheartedly recommend this apartment without hesitation. The location is simply perfect - the Essex House exudes elegance and charm at its finest. I would gladly book this place again at any time.', '2023-11-15 19:26:00+00'),
  (9266, 737, 756, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'It’s a studio in midtown just south of Central Park. As described and responsive hosts. Professional operation and felt safe the entire time. Easy to book and very communicative, easily a five star Airbnb.', '2023-07-14 22:29:00+00'),
  (9267, 737, 1283, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Wonderful apartment in a perfect location. Loved my stay and highly recommend to all!', '2022-10-20 21:26:00+00'),
  (9268, 737, 1344, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'The host was always responsive and accommodating. We had a very positive experience overall. Location is fantastic!', '2021-08-27 21:22:00+00'),
  (9269, 737, 1009, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Perfect location, just a few steps to Central Park. Excellent service from the host. Really enjoyed our stay. Highly recommend!', '2021-05-22 19:40:00+00'),
  (9270, 738, 1110, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Very much enjoyed my stay at Hugo and Hugo’s place while traveling for work. The apartment was clean, cozy, and provided a great deal of comfort after long days. Would definitely return the next time I’m in the city!', '2026-09-11 17:00:00+00'),
  (9271, 738, 949, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 'Responsive and proactive host, easy access into building/room, all listed amenities, and convenient neighborhood for food however all linens/towels were dirty and unusable due to fresh stains on towels and headboard and hairs in the bed. i bring extra bedding liners and used a spare shirt to dry off so i lived but neat freaks alike beware.', '2026-07-05 20:56:00+00'),
  (9272, 738, 1020, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Great value, easy access to airports, and clean place with great AC.', '2026-06-28 19:24:00+00'),
  (9273, 738, 1386, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'My stay at this location was reasonably priced, and the space was exactly as advertised. Great experience!', '2026-04-15 11:31:00+00'),
  (9274, 738, 1452, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'A fabulous convenient little place in BK to go get away, very affordable and cozy!', '2026-04-03 08:45:00+00'),
  (9275, 738, 1724, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'Very clean and comforting. Everything was as described and pictured. If ever in the area I would book again. 10/10', '2026-03-21 11:39:00+00'),
  (9276, 738, 1853, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'I walked into an unclean room. I booked late, in an emergency situation but the host responded and handled the situation with great urgency and professionalism. Can’t even be upset due to my situation and the price point at which I purchased this room. When I got relocated, it was a lot more clean. I understand it was a mistake and I was just happy the host answered. The fact they answered made me grateful.', '2026-02-27 09:50:00+00'),
  (9277, 738, 1068, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Hugo and Hugo are great hosts. The space is cozy and the area is very walkable with lots to do. The subway is also right up the street so it’s easy to get to other areas of the city if needed!', '2026-01-19 08:35:00+00'),
  (9278, 738, 914, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Nice spot in a good location. Communication was clear and responsive as well.', '2026-01-12 17:07:00+00'),
  (9279, 738, 1570, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Was an okay stay for a spontaneous New Year’s Eve booking, great for a solo individual or someone who won’t be in all the time.', '2026-01-01 15:05:00+00'),
  (9280, 738, 1488, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 'Wonderful place to stay for the weekend. Small but cozy. Didn’t feel cramped at all. Lots of good places to eat within walking distance and many things to do just a few blocks in any direction.', '2025-10-19 16:26:00+00'),
  (9281, 738, 1531, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'The room was so cute and refreshing! Clear instructions and checking in was so easy and stress free. This little area had a lot of food options, a pretty view of the bridge, and was walkable during the day. Also conveniently right near the 95 subway station. The hosts are very friendly and responsive, always gave a quick reply.', '2025-07-28 18:45:00+00'),
  (9282, 738, 1179, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 'Very proactive host, the apartment is great and location is perfect. The interiors are stunning too.', '2025-07-25 22:15:00+00'),
  (9283, 738, 1585, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'We had a good experience staying at Hugo and Hugo’s listing. Everything listed on the page was accurate! Location was very nice, many small shops and restaurants to go to. The subway is easily accessible from the listing.', '2025-06-30 08:21:00+00'),
  (9284, 738, 1333, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'I had an incredible experience staying at this Airbnb in Brooklyn! The space was exactly as described—clean, stylish, and super comfortable. The neighborhood was vibrant and full of great cafes, restaurants, and local charm. It was also conveniently located near public transportation, which made getting into Manhattan and exploring other parts of the city really easy.
The host was fantastic—responsive, friendly, and helpful. I especially appreciated how quiet and peaceful the apartment was at night, even being in such a lively area.
I would absolutely stay here again and recommend it to anyone looking for a true Brooklyn experience with the comforts of home!', '2025-06-24 13:20:00+00'),
  (9285, 739, 948, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Excellent host is an understatement, I really felt like I was at home and the apartment was beautiful!', '2026-05-13 21:09:00+00'),
  (9286, 739, 879, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, '"Tariq Place might be good overall, but the bed mattress, wardrobe, and reading table are terrible—like garbage. The rest of the things are fine.', '2025-08-17 18:02:00+00'),
  (9287, 739, 1671, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Very comfortable space and very clean. Looks exactly like the pictures and very modern looking. We enjoyed our stay 10/10', '2025-03-10 13:30:00+00'),
  (9288, 739, 1110, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'They place was very clean and nice 👌 and Mosey was very helpful very nice person.', '2023-11-14 22:20:00+00'),
  (9289, 739, 1564, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'My family and I stayed there for 2 months until our move to Florida. Mousey is an exceptional host. He made us feel right at home and always made sure things were perfect for us. He definitely deserves more than this review could ever say. We had a wonderful stay! And we will definitely be back!', '2023-06-30 10:35:00+00'),
  (9290, 739, 1108, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Mousey was very responsive and entrance instructions were clear. 
But The post mentions parking on premises, which isn’t true. There was only street parking. I also wasn’t aware there were house rules until the first day we arrived. For the most part, house rules are ok, but the no shoes in home rule, makes it kind of difficult, specially after showering. House seemed cleaned for the most part, floor was dusty. Mattress was ok', '2023-04-18 12:48:00+00'),
  (9291, 739, 936, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'I would definitely recommend this place to anyone looking to stay in Queens New York', '2023-02-25 08:45:00+00'),
  (9292, 739, 1847, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We really enjoyed our stay here. Mousey was almost immediate on his responses with anything and everything we needed including our last minute check in. Everything was clean and as it should be. Shower head took me a minute to figure out… you’ll see. I highly recommend this place and Mousey!', '2022-10-11 21:06:00+00'),
  (9293, 739, 1071, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Great place to stay near JFK! Hosts keep the place clean and stocked for visitors. Will stay again 10/10 times', '2022-09-06 15:07:00+00'),
  (9294, 739, 1147, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We stayed in the house for couple of months and had a good overall experience. House is located close to JFK airport. Plenty of parking space available on the street. Mousey is an excellent host. Responded to messages quickly during our stay and has addressed issues in a timely manner.', '2022-07-30 18:46:00+00'),
  (9295, 739, 910, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'It was truly a pleasure staying at this cute very cozy apartment!! The bed was super comfy and the shower the best!! Very clean with brand new shiny beautiful wood floors. Laundry/cleaning service fantastic. Great neighborhood and neighbors! The proximity to JFK airport was a real plus for me since I was in NYC for work ... I look forward to returning and exploring NYC! Will stay here again!!:) The owner was very attentive and always responded to any questions within minutes. ***An A+ rating', '2022-05-12 19:01:00+00'),
  (9296, 739, 1580, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Host is great with communication and accommodated every need ! This was an extended long stay for over two months and it was a pleasure !', '2022-03-01 17:05:00+00'),
  (9297, 739, 758, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'It was a pleasant experience. Mousey delivered to his promise and was very cooperative and responsive.', '2021-09-22 16:50:00+00'),
  (9298, 739, 1267, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'My family and I had a long term stay at Mousey’s place and I can honestly say we felt like we were in our own home. The house is beautiful, there was wine left out for us and it was very cozy. He was very responsive and went above and beyond to meet any needs we had. He also provided cleaning service every week while we were there. We definitely recommend him, he’s a great host!', '2021-09-02 18:15:00+00'),
  (9299, 739, 1569, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 'I never leave reviews but after staying at this beautiful home I have to let everyone know they need to book here. This is absolute best AirBnb stay I’ve ever had. The pictures didn’t do the place justice, this is the first time the actual home was better than the pictures. The home is clean and inviting and we felt at home right away. My whole family stayed in the home and we all felt comfortable from the moment we walked in. The host communicated everything perfectly so check in was simple and easy. The location is so close to the airport and to major shopping and public transportation it makes getting around so easy. The host provided A/C and fans so the house was comfortable even during the summer heat. I don’t think you should look any further if you’re coming to NY and if this place is available you should book it right away.', '2021-07-14 10:16:00+00'),
  (9300, 740, 1126, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'There was a lot of noise from the other guests and quite a bit of mess as well, which was often only addressed on the cleaning staff''s scheduled workdays. I also saw many cockroaches in the kitchen, and on several days there was no dish soap available. On the positive side, the host was quick to respond and helpful in trying to resolve the issues.', '2025-07-16 13:50:00+00'),
  (9301, 740, 1461, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, '5 stars - Fantastic Stay!
I had a fantastic stay at Nils’s place! The space was sparkling clean and conveniently located near the train station and two lovely parks—one just a 3-minute walk away. Nils’s hospitality and the great location made my stay memorable. I highly recommend staying here if you’re in the city. Thanks again, Nils, for a wonderful experience!', '2024-09-12 11:32:00+00'),
  (9302, 740, 1328, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Nils was kind and friendly, I enjoyed my stay I would have extended but the room was already booked. Area has plenty of food options and very affordable, also near public transportation and easy to get around! Thank you 🙏', '2024-04-30 09:32:00+00'),
  (9303, 740, 969, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Good place to stay in NYC . Close to subway stations, quiet and clean . Thank you', '2023-11-01 21:19:00+00'),
  (9304, 740, 1739, 5, 4, 4, 3, 5, 3, 4, 'Room is very small, but worth the price. Has large drawers and lots of outlets. Found a few cockroaches in the kitchen for the first couple days, but didn''t see any again after bringing it up. The microwave wasn''t working for more than half of the time I was there and most dishes and pots/pans were a little dirty.', '2023-09-13 11:07:00+00'),
  (9305, 740, 944, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 'This place is good if your only looking for a place to crash at night.', '2023-06-04 19:42:00+00'),
  (9306, 740, 1594, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 3, 4, 'The location is 3 minutes waking to the subway. The place generally clean but found a cockroach in the bathroom. There was a problem with the shower handler when you open it. The walls are not noise proof. The size of the room was small but good for people who wants to sleep only. There is groceries, restaurants, petrol station and hospital around. The host is very responsive but I had an issue once I reached at the main door and he wasn’t flexible solving my issue.', '2023-05-30 18:33:00+00'),
  (9307, 740, 1235, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 'Nils is on top of everything, and make sure all is going well.', '2023-04-03 16:16:00+00'),
  (9308, 741, 1845, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'A perfect home-base in the heart of the city. Endless food, drink, and entertainment in all directions. The proximity to both iconic and new finds is unbeatable. This is a stellar way to test apartment living vs. a hotel feel. The river walk is nice and close for running. Easy to cab up to catch shows.', '2026-08-20 12:07:00+00'),
  (9309, 741, 1251, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'This place suited my needs and I feel like Laila’s detailed description of the place was accurate and helpful. There were not unexpected surprises like at many Airbnbs!', '2026-08-07 21:07:00+00'),
  (9310, 741, 1093, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'That was a great stay. It felt like my home in Greenwich Village for a week.', '2026-08-03 09:32:00+00'),
  (9311, 741, 1124, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Loved staying at Laila''s place with my kids. The location is fantastic, such a fun part of NYC, lots of great restaurants nearby, so much that is walkable, and 2 subway stops within a few minutes for trips further afield.
The studio is accurately described in the listing, and Laila is responsive, friendly and helpful.', '2026-07-22 09:57:00+00'),
  (9312, 741, 1876, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Laila is a fantastic host with an authentic gem in the village. There''s so much to see and do in the neighborhood...great walks and easy transit access. We truly hope to visit again!', '2026-07-02 14:53:00+00'),
  (9313, 741, 1064, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'It is an old house, and not a fancy hotel standard. The host described the place honestly, and we were positively surprised. The neighbourhood is fantastic, and this host is really nice.', '2026-05-24 09:32:00+00'),
  (9314, 741, 1527, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'NYC is expensive and with this apartment you are paying for the location and convenience although it was disappointing that there were some renovations going on. Laila was responsive to our requests and did communicate well. It was convenient and it''s a safe neighborhood, with taking the regular city precautions. Beds were comfortable and besides convenience that was most important. Plus there are bars, a convenience store, and coffee shops steps away for late night or early morning.', '2026-05-17 08:37:00+00'),
  (9315, 741, 739, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Great stay. Very convenient place to stay.', '2026-04-02 19:47:00+00'),
  (9316, 741, 777, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We love staying at Laila’s. Everything we need is close, even the subway. It truly makes for a fun adventure when we are here. Laila is responsive and extremely helpful, making our stay comfortable:) Looking forward to our next stay!!', '2026-03-19 14:50:00+00'),
  (9317, 741, 1496, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 'Great place for the price. Definitely the right vibe for someone who wants a slightly bohemian place to crash in the Village. Easy access to subway stops, plenty of places to eat nearby. If you’re slight sleeper, bring earplugs - there’s a fair amount of street noise (but that’s the city for you).', '2026-03-11 15:26:00+00'),
  (9318, 741, 1252, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'Really enjoyed staying here. We were working on a project for The Whitney museum and it’s hard to find great places nearby for an affordable rate, so this checked those boxes for us. Laila was amazingly accommodating and helpful as well!', '2026-03-05 11:25:00+00'),
  (9319, 741, 1923, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 'love our stay, felt like we had our own NYC apartment in Greenwich village!', '2026-02-20 17:27:00+00'),
  (9320, 741, 1653, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'I loved this little studio - warm and inviting and Laila was so helpful and accommodating . The space was clean and lovely and close to everything fun in the village. Would definitely stay here again.', '2026-01-28 14:22:00+00'),
  (9321, 741, 770, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'If you want a convenient, relatively inexpensive, no frills place in the West Village, this place is perfect! I felt like a real New Yorker! Close to subway also.', '2026-01-26 17:15:00+00'),
  (9322, 741, 1144, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Exactly to description which feels like stepping into 80s New York and I''m all for it. If you want to feel what it''s like to live in the heart of the city this is the place for you.', '2026-01-21 20:54:00+00'),
  (9323, 742, 843, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I had a great time at Nadia‘s place. She is such a wonderful host and cares about you. The apartment is perfectly located, quick access to the city. It’s a bit noisy but with earplugs everything was fine. I enjoyed spending time with her and her family. Can absolutely recommend the place.', '2019-12-21 20:23:00+00'),
  (9324, 742, 1207, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'This was my first Airbnb experience and I couldn''t have asked for a better one! Nadia made me feel very welcome and comfortable staying there. Her communication was assuring, the bed was comfortable, her apartment is warm and the company was priceless. Hope to have opportunity to stay there again!', '2019-10-06 09:33:00+00'),
  (9325, 742, 1433, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Nadia''s place was great in every way. Her family was also very kind and there were no issues in sharing any of the spaces. I think of them as good friends now and would highly recommend staying with them!', '2019-09-29 08:13:00+00'),
  (9326, 742, 1395, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Thank you for everything! She is the best host, you really feel at home ! Her house is the best choice I could have made!', '2019-07-07 15:53:00+00'),
  (9327, 742, 1690, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Very excellent place! Stayed here for two weeks while on a research fellowship at the New York Historical Society. Bed was very comfortable and the location was perfect! Nadia is a very kind and wonderful host!', '2019-06-02 14:29:00+00'),
  (9328, 742, 1751, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'A great host! Helpful with NY insights. Also check-in and check-out were pretty flexible.', '2019-05-19 11:21:00+00'),
  (9329, 742, 1352, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'The place is wonderful. Excellent location, very clean. Nadia is so hospitable and helpful. Would definitely stay again.', '2019-05-05 19:30:00+00'),
  (9330, 742, 1186, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I had a very pleasant stay. Nadia was a great host, very thoughtful - and super kind to me after I hurt myself falling from a bike in the park. The bed was large and comfortable and there was a large wardrobe with plenty of space to store clothes. The room is conveniently located in the apartment off to one side right by the bathroom and kitchen, with the living room and host''s quarters in the other direction, so you have a good amount of privacy for this sort of set up.', '2019-05-04 15:05:00+00'),
  (9331, 742, 955, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Nadia is just a wonderful host!!! She was flexible with the check in time, friendly and really made me feel at home. Her place is great!!', '2019-04-21 22:41:00+00'),
  (9332, 742, 1880, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Nadia’s place is very close to subway station. The room is clean. Nadia is super nice.', '2019-04-07 20:27:00+00'),
  (9333, 742, 1813, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Nadia is a great host, and the apartment is very cute and clean. Nadia was flexible with my changing check-in time and check-out. I would definitely stay here again!', '2019-03-24 22:00:00+00'),
  (9334, 742, 1164, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Nadia is an incredibly gracious host. She was extremely responsive and very accommodating when I needed to check in a little early. I loved the apartment as well - the room was private, clean, and well located. I would highly recommend staying with her!', '2018-12-09 13:21:00+00'),
  (9335, 742, 1329, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'My Sister stayed at Nadia''s place. She told me that She had a great time with her.
Nadia is such a friendly, polite and respectful person. 100% recommended.', '2018-12-02 22:40:00+00'),
  (9336, 742, 1237, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Nadia’s apartment is cosy and clean, exactly as described and presented on the photos. It’s very well-located, easily accessible by public transport. She’s a lovely host, very helpful and discreet. The layout of the apartment allows a lot of privacy. Wouldn’t hesitate staying there again.', '2018-11-11 13:33:00+00'),
  (9337, 742, 1124, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'very nice house house at the amazing Harlem! bus, subway, restaurants and nice bars in the neighborhood. :-)', '2018-10-27 14:16:00+00'),
  (9338, 743, 1223, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'The apartment is situated in a very convenient area. There are grocery stores (Lidl, Whole Foods) in walking distance. The 2 and 3 trains that run through the city are 3 blocks down. Easy to get JFK by taxi or train. Responsive hosts. Lots of space in the studio.', '2026-07-31 18:58:00+00'),
  (9339, 743, 1327, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Will was an amazing host, and the apartment was great. I spent very good time in Will''s apartment. I highly recommend this apartment, and I will come back for sure in this place if I had to come back to NYC. Thanks a lot Will for this great time in Harlem.', '2026-07-01 13:47:00+00'),
  (9340, 743, 914, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'This was a beautiful apartment. It was close to the subways and plenty of restaurants. Had a great time staying here!', '2025-09-23 08:39:00+00'),
  (9341, 743, 1442, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Will is a great host. He is always available and very kind and fast to respond to any need.', '2025-02-04 15:01:00+00'),
  (9342, 743, 774, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Will and Julie are wonderful hosts and very quick to respond to any questions. The apartment is st a very safe location and close to everything. We had a great stay.', '2024-12-11 20:24:00+00'),
  (9343, 743, 798, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'I love Will''s place! Perfectly clean, a nice and safe building, which is important for me. The train station is a 3 minute walk away, everything you need is in walking distance. The area is more residential and not too loud, which is nice too. Will is a lovely person who will make you feel very comfortable. Would come back always!', '2024-10-04 13:43:00+00'),
  (9344, 743, 1451, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Perfect space for our month long stay. Spacious enough that we weren''t stepping on each other like we do in a hotel room. Easy access to public transportation. Quiet building. 
Everything we needed was in the kitchen, linens were clean and at the ready, WiFi at the ready.
Thank you Will for being so friendly and helpful.', '2024-07-30 10:30:00+00'),
  (9345, 743, 1293, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Overall, my wife and I really enjoyed our stay. The studio apartment is located in a brownstone building and is airy, clean, peaceful, functional, well appointed and light filled. It has three lovely bay windows overlooking a mature tree-lined, quiet street. We think the location in West Harlem is ideal with easy access to the Subway system and several supermarkets and varied restaurants. The area feels safe with a good buzz to the neighbourhood. We stayed here for 1 month and would highly recommend this apartment to any travellers to NYC. The host, Will, is both kind and considerate and very responsive to any questions we posed to him.', '2024-06-03 10:30:00+00'),
  (9346, 743, 1467, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'beautiful apartment and very helpful host
I absolutely adore this place. very clean, spacious, just like the description in a beautiful tranquil area of Harlem. definitely will book the next time
Will, the host, is always available and very proactive and easy to communicate.', '2024-04-11 15:24:00+00'),
  (9347, 743, 862, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'This the perfect location for us to explore the usual and go off the beaten path. Will was so responsive and friendly. I usually prefer self check in but Will made it such an easy experience and honestly we loved getting to meet him. We had everything for our trip, and when we came in super hungry from our flight there were so many great options near by! Plenty of space for us especially since we hung out at the bnb a good bit.', '2023-12-04 21:33:00+00'),
  (9348, 743, 1730, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Will was super accommodating. Our bus from Rochester came in late, and he was outside in the cold welcoming us when we arrived on foot! He showed us where everything was. His apartment was beautiful, with golden light from the tree outside every morning.', '2023-11-25 16:41:00+00'),
  (9349, 743, 1181, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'This Harlem walk-up apartment was our oasis in NYC. It’s close to the subway, had some great local restaurants (caffe latte and greedy pot) nearby and had everything else we needed for a comfortable stay, including an awesome bed.', '2023-11-20 09:40:00+00'),
  (9350, 743, 840, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Easy access to the subway and Will was very responsive with texting and anything we needed. Overall a great place to stay. The only thing (and it is very much a personal preference and no reflection on the host) was the mattress is VERY firm.', '2023-11-06 22:20:00+00'),
  (9351, 743, 1137, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Will was a gracious and welcoming host. His place was a perfect spot from which to explore NYC. He was proactive in communicating with us and was very responsive to any questions we had. The apartment was very clean and had everything we needed for a comfortable stay.
Will''s friendliness and attentiveness enhanced our stay in NYC.
Highly recommend!', '2023-10-28 20:41:00+00'),
  (9352, 743, 1761, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Will''s place is awesome--located in central Harlem steps away from the subway in a great neighborhood. What a find!', '2023-10-20 10:26:00+00'),
  (9353, 744, 1057, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'As main positive points of Marcio’s study I can highlight its localization, close to lots of restaurants and nearby Times Square. The apartment was very clean, and it corresponds faithfully to the pictures. Marcio was very flexible and willing to help. 
On the other side, the study is located in an old building with narrow stairs and funny smell.', '2023-04-12 17:05:00+00'),
  (9354, 744, 840, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Great location, friendly host and lovely studio.', '2023-01-01 14:03:00+00'),
  (9355, 744, 1821, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We loved staying at Kenji’s place! The description was just as described - it’s such a cute apartment in an AMAZING location. We were able to walk to so many great restaurants, catch a Broadway show, and visit Times Square. The place was comfortable, clean, and everything we were looking for in our trip to NYC. We would easily choose this place to stay at again next time we plan on visiting. Thank you Kenji!', '2022-12-17 09:10:00+00'),
  (9356, 744, 1472, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 'Kenji’s place has everything you need and more for the perfect days at NYC, close to all the places you want to go, restaurantes, dinners and delis, the apartment is what you see on the pictures!
I recomended 100%', '2022-12-05 13:52:00+00'),
  (9357, 744, 827, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Perfect location for walkable distance to Times Square, Broadway district.
Plenty of restaurants very close by.
Extra clean.
Recommend!', '2022-11-28 08:57:00+00'),
  (9358, 744, 1356, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 4, 'We had a fantastic trip to NYC! Kenji''s place is in a great location - right in hell''s kitchen with a Target nearby, about 10 minute walk from Time''s Square and the nearest subway stop, and only a couple blocks from a great bike trail. The place was furnished with a kitchen, dishwasher, and a full fridge. We had everything we needed to cook. He was very responsive when we messaged him as well.', '2022-11-16 09:55:00+00'),
  (9359, 744, 1399, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We had a great time in nyc! Kenji was very helpful and a great host!', '2022-10-09 14:27:00+00'),
  (9360, 744, 954, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'Kenji is a lovely host. He is incredibly kind and was extremely accommodating when I requested a late check-in/checkout. His place was absolutely spotless and super comfortable. It is also very quiet. The location is wonderful. You are within easy walking distance of Broadway and Central Park. I can’t say enough what a blessing it was to stay at Kenji’s. I would highly recommend.', '2022-09-24 13:18:00+00'),
  (9361, 744, 975, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'Perfect place for small group at the heart of Time square, Manhattan. The place has everything needed, clean and convenient. Host was very friendly, helpful and welcoming. Two blocks for subway and bus stand right at the corner. Convenient store on first floor of the building, cafes and restaurants are within the block. Perfect place!', '2022-09-06 17:58:00+00'),
  (9362, 744, 795, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Kenji was an incredible host! He made sure that we were accommodated and did an amazing job of helping us ease into the AirBnB. He was also very flexible with our schedules, which was appreciated because of our bus commutes out of the city. The place was extremely clean and well-prepared for us! Would absolutely stay here again!', '2022-06-27 15:05:00+00'),
  (9363, 745, 1354, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'Omar, was a great and responsive host from the very beginning, the home was and room was just like the pictures, the home was quiet and clean and overall a lovely place to stay', '2026-08-29 18:39:00+00'),
  (9364, 745, 1592, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Had a great experience with Omar. If you’re looking for somewhere in brooklyn this is definitely the place! Beautiful open space and greenery, welcoming and communicative host! Thanks again!', '2026-08-24 13:10:00+00'),
  (9365, 745, 1535, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'The housing is very neat and clean. There are many green plants, which makes people feel cheerful. During the long journey, I feel at home when I come back to my room every night. It takes 30 to 50 minutes by subway to get to the city center. Omar is also very friendly and cordial. His reply was very quick.And he carefully reminded me of all kinds of things to pay attention to.', '2026-08-07 19:00:00+00'),
  (9366, 745, 856, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'I had an absolutely amazing stay at Omar''s apartment! Everything was exactly as described—clean, comfortable, and well-equipped. The location was great, and I felt at home from the moment I arrived.
Omar is an outstanding host: incredibly kind, friendly, welcoming, and always quick to respond if I had any questions. He truly went above and beyond to make sure I had a great experience.
I couldn''t have asked for a better place to stay. I highly recommend Omar to anyone looking for a comfortable stay with a fantastic host. I would gladly stay here again. Thank you so much for everything!', '2026-07-29 14:08:00+00'),
  (9367, 745, 1736, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'It was great time in NYC, love the location really close to metro and easy to get there from airport and to the airport as well. 
The room I stayed was really cozy. 
I definitely would love to comeback and stay at Omar’s appointment again and would recommend my friends', '2026-07-22 19:19:00+00'),
  (9368, 745, 1790, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'I really enjoyed staying at Omar''s home. It was stylish, spacious, and clean. It was also in a great location for me. Close to family and not far from the train to go into the city for work. The neighborhood is full of friendly folks, and there is some great caribbean food in the area.', '2026-06-19 17:13:00+00'),
  (9369, 745, 1840, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Peaceful stay in a stylish, comfortable home. It was a very last minute booking on my part due to extension of a work trip; and I made the choice due to the great price and it being an LGBTQIA+ friendly listing. I hadn’t fully appreciated the house was a bit further out of the main stretch of Brooklyn sights and attractions- it’s very much a residential area and travel into my various meetings in Brooklyn was a c. 30 to 45 min journey.', '2026-06-14 15:21:00+00'),
  (9370, 745, 1648, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Great stay overall. The place was clean, comfortable, and well organized. The host was responsive and helpful throughout my stay. I would definitely recommend it to others.', '2026-05-16 15:00:00+00'),
  (9371, 745, 1269, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Omar’s was the most respectful, punctual, and overall great host. He provide a level of communication that made our stay peaceful and comforting. Highly recommended.', '2026-01-10 21:44:00+00'),
  (9372, 745, 1630, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Omar was a marvelous host. It was my first time and he was extremely helpful. His space was aesthetically pleasing. The plants and art were perfect. He also has a cute dog. He also has wonderful music choices that were great ambiance to my morning routine. Definitely will want to stay with him again.', '2025-12-30 19:59:00+00'),
  (9373, 745, 842, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 'Super easy, comfortable, clean and safe. Omar is a wonderful host, makes everything youn might need accessible, organized, convenient. A very smooth and I reiterate comfortable stay! (the way I crashed on that big bed the first night!)', '2025-12-15 15:45:00+00'),
  (9374, 745, 1599, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Probably the best place I ever stayed in my life! Living with Omar and the dog Minji was amazing. They are both very sweet, the place is clean, well decorated, it just felt like home 💫', '2025-11-15 19:25:00+00'),
  (9375, 745, 787, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Vibes were perfect. Spot was clean, stylish, and comfortable. Host was super chill and made everything smooth. Would definitely book again.', '2025-10-21 16:34:00+00'),
  (9376, 745, 1270, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 3, 5, 'House and room were great - nicely furnished and clean. Good shower. Short walk to the subway (both the 3 and L). Omar was friendly and helpful, and quick to respond whenever I messaged him. 
My only negative is that the immediate neighborhood is pretty impoverished - not exactly a tourist location, for better and for worse, but you''ve got the subway to go wherever.', '2025-10-16 21:14:00+00'),
  (9377, 745, 1335, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Love it, jiyoun was very clean and organized and very helpful!', '2025-09-30 19:03:00+00'),
  (9378, 746, 1557, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'I stayed here on two separate occasions, place is clean, close to the airport, and comfortable. Ana and Joan were quick to respond to my questions. Highly recommended. I will certainly stay here again.', '2022-10-07 10:54:00+00'),
  (9379, 746, 794, 3, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Nice place, cheap for what it is and good to get into NYC, but stay away from the hustle and bustle', '2019-09-01 14:05:00+00'),
  (9380, 746, 892, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 'Ask about the other guests that will be your roommates for your stay, it can turn out wrongly just like that', '2019-08-05 22:09:00+00'),
  (9381, 746, 1712, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'You will not be disappointed with your stay! I definitely wasn''t disappointed. I felt very much at home and will be returning.', '2019-07-01 08:26:00+00'),
  (9382, 746, 1131, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 'Ana''s place is beyond expectation, the family is warm and receptive. The place is very clean. I would definitely stay at Ana''s place in the future.', '2019-04-30 13:52:00+00'),
  (9383, 746, 1723, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 'The stay was amazing clean and very comfortable. I recommend Ana’s place to anyone looking for a home away from home. Thanks again Ana.', '2019-03-18 19:36:00+00'),
  (9384, 746, 1143, 5, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'My family and I stayed at Ana’s place this past weekend and it was perfect! Ana responds super quick, check in was easy, and it was sparkling clean. We were the first ones to stay in this air bnb and I would highly recommend it to anyone traveling into the city.', '2019-01-13 16:38:00+00'),
  (9385, 747, 1899, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Clara was a great host, easy to communicate with and always helpful. Convenient location for many great walks and restaurants and approx 14 min walk to subway station but bus was right around the block. The apartment was oraginzed with all the amenities you could need. Would book again!', '2026-07-17 10:20:00+00'),
  (9386, 747, 1428, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Great stay - Clara was very responsive and the apartment was well maintained and in a great location.', '2026-06-03 19:42:00+00'),
  (9387, 747, 1584, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Clara is reliable and communicative. The apartment is a clean and cozy gem and so convenient for a month in the city. Definitely a good find for any visitor!', '2026-03-08 12:45:00+00'),
  (9388, 747, 1547, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Clara''s place was clean, organized, and had plenty of kitchen and bathroom space, just enough for my month and a half stay in NYC. The only reason I am giving it 4 stars if because for what I paid, the location of the apartment wasn''t great. At minimum, the nearest subway was a 15 minute walk away. For something cheaper, I could have stayed in the heart of West Village, which is the area I spent the most time in. Otherwise, if you are looking for a quiet location with not too much bustle and you don''t mind walking far most days, this would a good spot.', '2026-01-18 14:00:00+00'),
  (9389, 747, 1102, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Clara was a great host. The area is perfect and super convenient. It’s very hard to find an Airbnb in New York that feels truly decent, and this one was definitely a 10/10 beautifully designed and with great taste.', '2025-12-03 09:45:00+00'),
  (9390, 747, 1134, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'I stayed here for a month in October, and it was nothing short of fantastic. The location is unbeatable 10/10! The apartment itself is immaculate, comfortable, and felt like a true home away from home. Clara, the host, was exceptional from start to finish, providing clear instructions and offering a ton of great local recommendations. He was always available to answer any questions, making the entire experience stress-free and enjoyable.
As a first-time Airbnb guest, I was a bit nervous, but I couldn’t have asked for a better experience. This place is perfect for 1-2 people looking to explore the heart of New York City and be close to all the action. Highly recommend!', '2025-11-02 10:32:00+00'),
  (9391, 747, 1862, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Clara was very helpful and available. I had a great stay!', '2025-10-02 16:21:00+00'),
  (9392, 747, 1016, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Great location. Responsive and friendly host', '2025-08-22 21:32:00+00'),
  (9393, 747, 1699, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Clara was a great host, super helpful and accommodating! The location of the Airbnb is great with many things to do.', '2025-02-09 16:34:00+00'),
  (9394, 747, 1921, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Clara’s place was fantastic! The apartment was well-decorated and had a cozy, charming vibe. The location was unbeatable, right in the heart of the Meatpacking District, with plenty of shops, restaurants, and activities within walking distance. The studio was small but very cute and equipped with the essentials. 
For longer stays, it might be helpful to add a few extras like more kitchen utensils, pans, or a hairdryer, but overall, it was a great experience. Clara was an excellent host—very communicative and quick to respond to any questions. Highly recommend!', '2024-12-20 08:18:00+00'),
  (9395, 747, 1198, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Fantastic location and exactly what a solo traveler or couple would need for a stay.', '2024-07-31 10:48:00+00'),
  (9396, 747, 1193, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'This Airbnb is GREAT! I''ve stayed in a lot of Airbnbs, and this one is one of the more thoughtfully put together ones I ever have stayed in. It has everything you need -- fully stocked kitchen, comfortable bed, work desk. The kitchen is super well laid out, large and functional by NYC standards. The bathroom has an amazing walk in glass shower. The apartment faces a main street, but is remarkably quiet. The whole space feels new, modern, and clean. Highly recommend staying here.', '2024-06-08 09:35:00+00'),
  (9397, 747, 1173, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great location and very responsive host!', '2024-03-01 09:43:00+00'),
  (9398, 748, 912, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Great stay! The host was very responsive, and the place gave us total privacy while still being within walking distance of bus and trains. Great value for the price.', '2026-08-24 13:17:00+00'),
  (9399, 748, 1211, 5, 3, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'the place was nice for a weekend in NY. close enough to bus stations to take to the subway which was nice. there was a great local market on 36th where we could get drinks and fruit for the stay. the unit itself was ok. nice and clean and the 3 window units kept us cool in the near record setting heat. what could be better are the fact there was no trash cans anywhere but in the bathroom miniature. some had soap and more hand towels would also be a great addition.
the tv remote was missing which made the TV unusable. would have been a lot nicer stay with an operation TV but not enough to ruin that stay.', '2026-07-06 16:05:00+00'),
  (9400, 748, 1839, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'We had a great stay here and would happily stay again if we return to New York.
The property is a little run down in places, but it was clean, comfortable, and had everything we needed for our stay. The beds were particularly comfortable, and the host was always quick to respond to any messages, which made everything easy.
The location worked well for us. It''s not too far from the main attractions, and there''s a deli right on the corner for picking up basic supplies and snacks.
For the price we paid, it was good enough and represented excellent value for money.
If I were to suggest any improvements, I''d add a tea towel in the kitchen and a few more glasses, as we found ourselves using the plastic cups provided. These are only minor tweaks, though, and didn''t affect our stay.
Overall, a comfortable, good-value place to stay, and one we''d happily book again.', '2026-06-17 10:37:00+00');

INSERT INTO reviews (booking_id, listing_id, guest_id, rating, cleanliness_rating, accuracy_rating, check_in_rating, communication_rating, location_rating, value_rating, comment, created_at) VALUES
  (9401, 748, 1842, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'We had a very comfortable 12-night stay here. The host was kind, allowing us an early check-in and always responding immediately to any questions we had.
The place was clean and practical. The living room is spacious, and the two bedrooms with queen-sized beds provided a good night''s sleep. The neighborhood itself is very quiet and peaceful.
All the amenities worked well: there was always plenty of hot water in the bathroom, an ample supply of towels, and the Wi-Fi was stable throughout our stay. The kitchen was also well-equipped, allowing us to cook meals easily using the oven, microwave, and stove.
In terms of location, the subway and ferry are about a 15-minute walk away, but it is a straightforward route to get into Manhattan. Considering the price and everything provided, this place offers excellent value for money. Highly recommended for a budget-friendly stay in NY!', '2026-06-03 08:20:00+00'),
  (9402, 748, 1252, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Definitely no frills at this spot. It was a place to sleep and I’m not too picky.
Overall the place was clean and the area was quiet.', '2026-03-30 08:17:00+00'),
  (9403, 748, 1560, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'I brought my mom, dad and sister for a short trip from the Dominican Republic they enjoy the visit while feeling comfortable in Santos place. Definitely love it', '2026-03-14 20:37:00+00'),
  (9404, 748, 1917, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 'Liv''s house was clean and quiet, and it was conveniently located within walking distance of the bus stop and supermarkets. A great local perk is the New Yorker Bagels factory on the corner—they give away free bagels from 2:00 PM to 6:00 PM, so don’t miss out!"
Thank you Liv!', '2026-03-01 11:16:00+00'),
  (9405, 748, 916, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 4, 5, 'Liv''s home was perfect for a quick NY stay. It was very spacious, clean, and easy to get to. It was conveniently located for our needs and in a great area for transportation and food. Would definitely stay here again!', '2026-02-17 20:48:00+00'),
  (9406, 748, 810, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 'Everything was perfect. Thanks Liv for everything. He was available anytime when we text me.', '2026-02-15 08:31:00+00'),
  (9407, 748, 917, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Overall the stay was great. It has a private space which always for feeling safe especially traveling with kids. spacious apt. lots of good spots around the neighborhood and easy to catch transport to get into the city!', '2025-12-07 16:50:00+00'),
  (9408, 748, 995, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'Liv was very responsive. The place could use some better upkeep but overall it''s a fine place to stay for the price. It''s bigger than the pictures make it out to be.', '2025-10-31 16:26:00+00'),
  (9409, 748, 1785, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Fantastic stay!
Liv was wonderful and very responsive. 
The place itself was even better than the photos!
A+++', '2025-10-05 22:09:00+00'),
  (9410, 748, 1341, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 'The airbnb looked just like the pictures, Liv was helpful and communicative, it’s about a 15 minute walk to the subway, but still close to restaurants and convenience stores, there were four of us staying there for five nights and we had four towels provided, no washclothes or hand towels unfortunately, the lighting in the rooms was a little dull but overall matched the pics and description.', '2025-08-13 15:32:00+00'),
  (9411, 748, 1097, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 3, 5, 'We had a great time at Liv’s home. I love the classic feel and the space was perfect for our needs. The beds were super comfortable and we slept like babies. The spot was very close to a convenient store and a 10 min walk to Costco. I highly recommend staying at Liv’s home and would love to stay again.', '2025-07-14 14:16:00+00'),
  (9412, 748, 1364, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 4, 'Very friendly host, but some of the amenities could use a bit of improvement.', '2025-07-11 08:03:00+00'),
  (9413, 749, 1890, 5, 3, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Our stay was great! The place was exactly like described, and the host was always very responsive and helpful. The apartment is very spacious, with huge windows and beautiful views, which makes the space feel even bigger. 
It was especially great for our family with kids, there was a lot of space for them to play and relax. The kitchen was amazing and we really liked the big dining table where we could all sit together.
The location was perfect for spending summer in NYC, with the waterfront and everything we needed very close by. We really enjoyed our stay and would be happy to come back again. Highly recommended!', '2026-08-06 18:41:00+00'),
  (9414, 749, 1737, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'We had an amazing stay in this apartment - truly exceeded our expectations. We’re a family with two kids, and the place was incredibly comfortable and well thought out for our needs. Having space for the stroller downstairs made a big difference and added to the convenience.
The apartment itself is beautiful, with a great design and a stunning view. We spent a lot of time enjoying the balcony. The kitchen is fully equipped with everything you might need, which made the long stay even more enjoyable.
We were genuinely surprised when we arrived - it’s even better than in the photos. We stayed for a full month, and everything went smoothly from start to finish.
Highly recommend - a really great place!', '2026-04-27 21:04:00+00'),
  (9415, 749, 1440, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'This location is everything - we walked domino park every day :) 
Also the balcony space and windows by the kitchen were incredible as we worked from home a lot!', '2025-10-15 19:19:00+00'),
  (9416, 749, 1663, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 4, 'Spacious and ideally located, with Anders being incredibly friendly and helpful. We absolutely loved our stay!', '2024-11-17 18:41:00+00'),
  (9417, 749, 971, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Amazing place with everything you need and great location and lots of light. Anders is super helpful and responsive too :)', '2022-04-01 17:31:00+00'),
  (9418, 749, 1291, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 'One-of-a-kind place. Complete gem. So incredibly lucky to be able to spend a summer here. Anders and her husband are true artists in how they constructed and decorated the place. So many great details and the view/private outdoor area is simply unbeatable. They were also very responsive. If possible, I would not hesitate to return in the future.', '2021-08-15 22:36:00+00'),
  (9419, 749, 1344, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great hosts, wonderful location and an amazing apartment. Industrial chic but still warm, the two floors plus deck with incredible views offered plenty of space for our family of four. Would definitely recommend this place.', '2021-06-14 14:51:00+00'),
  (9420, 749, 1048, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great unique spot in an excellent location. Excellent host.', '2021-02-03 21:38:00+00'),
  (9421, 749, 1344, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great spot! Anders was very responsive and helpful would definitely stay there again :)', '2019-04-12 18:06:00+00'),
  (9422, 750, 1654, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Great stay and awesome host. 100% would book again !', '2026-09-08 20:33:00+00'),
  (9423, 750, 1197, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 5, 'Babak place was great!! The neighborhood felt safe and I felt right at home. The place was clean, comfortable and had a lot of space. The beds were comfortable, linens were absolutely clean and smelled so good, the AC units in every space was pumping, the kitchen was clean, I never had to ask for anything - it was there. I stayed with my family of six. The airbnb was awesome! The neighborhood has public transportation at your finger tips. I honestly love this place and area and I would definitely recommend it to everyone who is looking to book...great job to the host(s)', '2026-09-03 21:31:00+00'),
  (9424, 750, 1667, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Babak was a great host and we felt right at home from the moment we arrived. The two rooms were spacious and the beds were very comfortable. We enjoyed all that came with the space especially the air fryer. Everything was provided and the host made sure we had everything we needed. We found parking just a block away so it wasn’t too difficult to find. I would definitely stay here again next time I’m in New York.', '2026-08-02 11:19:00+00'),
  (9425, 750, 1359, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4, 'Great Place to Stay, Very Communicative host.', '2026-06-22 16:50:00+00'),
  (9426, 750, 1573, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 'Babak was an excellent host - he constantly checked in to make sure all was well, and that I had everything I needed.
The place was well equipped for both long or short stay and I felt very comfortable there!
Plus it was a great deal!', '2026-05-18 18:50:00+00'),
  (9427, 750, 1675, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 5, 'The place was very clean. The host was very friendly.', '2026-05-04 17:27:00+00'),
  (9428, 750, 1497, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 'Babak is one of the best hosts I’ve ever had. He is very easy to communicate with, extremely flexible, kind, and always ready to help. He made the entire experience smooth and stress-free. I highly recommend this Airbnb to everyone!', '2026-01-25 11:16:00+00'),
