  (9432, 750, 1555, 4, 5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 4, '⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️
My stay in Brooklyn was absolutely wonderful, thanks to Babak! From start to finish, everything was smooth and stress-free. The space was clean, cozy, and exactly as pictured—if not better. Babak was incredibly welcoming, attentive, and made sure we had everything we needed to feel comfortable. The location was perfect, close to great restaurants, shops, and easy access to transportation. It truly felt like a home away from home. I would highly recommend staying here and will definitely book again whenever I’m back in Brooklyn. Thank you, Babak, for such a great experience!', '2025-07-14 09:06:00+00'),
  (9433, 750, 1868, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 'Babak is a great host. The apartment was beautiful, clean and well maintained. We love every minute of our stay. 10/10 star. We will definitely be back soon.', '2025-07-07 10:00:00+00'),
